export const norwayHousingBenefitTranslationsByLocale = Object.freeze({"am":{"Norway Housing Benefit Estimator":"የኖርዌይ መኖሪያ ቤት ጥቅማ ጥቅም አስማጭ","Norway Housing Benefit Calculator 2026 — Monthly Scenario":"የኖርዌይ መኖሪያ ቤት ጥቅማ ጥቅም ማስያ 2026 - ወርሃዊ ሁኔታ","Estimate a standard monthly Norwegian housing-benefit scenario from the household income basis, approved housing costs, household size and municipality group. See the 2026 assumptions and continue to Husbanken for a current eligibility check.":"መደበኛ ወርሃዊ የኖርዌይ የመኖሪያ ቤት-ጥቅማ ጥቅም ሁኔታ ከቤተሰብ ገቢ መሰረት፣ ከተፈቀደ የመኖሪያ ቤት ወጪ፣ የቤተሰብ ብዛት እና የማዘጋጃ ቤት ቡድን ግምት ውስጥ ያስገቡ። የ2026 ግምቶችን ይመልከቱ እና ለአሁኑ የብቃት ማረጋገጫ ወደ Husbanken ይቀጥሉ።","Use this private scenario to understand how Norway’s housing-benefit formula combines approved housing costs, weighted household income and the 2026 coverage rate. The interface language never changes the Norwegian rules.":"የኖርዌይ የቤት-ጥቅማ ጥቅም ቀመር እንዴት የተፈቀደ የመኖሪያ ቤት ወጪዎችን፣ የተመጣጠነ የቤተሰብ ገቢ እና የ2026 የሽፋን መጠን እንደሚያጣምር ለመረዳት ይህንን የግል ሁኔታ ይጠቀሙ። የበይነገጽ ቋንቋ የኖርዌይን ህግጋት ፈጽሞ አይለውጠውም።","Calculations run in this browser. Entries are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"ስሌቶች በዚህ አሳሽ ውስጥ ይሰራሉ። ግቤቶች ወደ አገልጋይ አይላኩም ወይም በዚህ መሳሪያ አይቀመጡም.","Example":"ምሳሌ","For one household member with no income and NOK 8,000 in monthly approved housing costs, the 2026 standard own contribution is about NOK 2,215 per month. The estimated benefit is about NOK 4,032 after applying the 73.7% rate.":"ለአንድ የቤተሰብ አባል ምንም ገቢ ለሌለው እና NOK 8,000 በወር የተፈቀደ የመኖሪያ ቤት ወጪዎች, የ 2026 መደበኛ የራሱ መዋጮ በወር NOK 2,215 ነው. የተገመተው ጥቅም የ 73.7% መጠንን ከተከተለ በኋላ ስለ NOK 4,032 ነው.","How the scenario works":"ሁኔታው እንዴት እንደሚሰራ","The tool divides household income by the official household weight, calculates the standard own contribution from weighted annual income, limits approved housing costs by the household-size and municipality cap, subtracts the monthly own contribution and applies 73.7%.":"መሣሪያው የቤተሰብ ገቢን በኦፊሴላዊው የቤተሰብ ክብደት ይከፋፍላል ፣ መደበኛውን የራሱን አስተዋፅኦ ከክብደት አመታዊ ገቢ ያሰላል ፣ የተፈቀዱ የቤት ወጪዎችን በቤተሰብ ብዛት እና በማዘጋጃ ቤት ይገድባል ፣ ወርሃዊ መዋጮውን ይቀንስ እና 73.7% ይተገበራል።","Common questions":"የተለመዱ ጥያቄዎች","Is this an official award or eligibility decision?":"ይህ ይፋዊ ሽልማት ነው ወይስ የብቃት ውሳኔ?","No. It is a standard-case scenario, not an application or decision. Husbanken’s official calculator applies current eligibility limits, personal rules and the month being checked.":"አይደለም፡ የመደበኛ ሁኔታ ሁኔታ እንጂ ማመልከቻ ወይም ውሳኔ አይደለም። የHusbanken ይፋዊ ካልኩሌተር የአሁኑን የብቃት ገደቦችን፣ የግል ህጎችን እና የሚጣራበትን ወር ይተገበራል።","What should I enter as household income?":"እንደ የቤተሰብ ገቢ ምን ማስገባት አለብኝ?","Enter the monthly household income basis used by Husbanken before household weighting. It may include taxable monthly income, reportable annual income converted to a month, applicable wealth supplement and tax-free rental income. Children’s income and several named benefits are excluded. Check Husbanken’s income guidance.":"ከቤት ክብደት በፊት Husbanken የሚጠቀመውን ወርሃዊ የቤተሰብ ገቢ መሰረት ያስገቡ። እሱ ታክስ የሚከፈል ወርሃዊ ገቢ፣ ሪፖርት ሊደረግበት የሚችል አመታዊ ገቢ ወደ ወር የሚቀየር፣ የሚመለከተው የሀብት ማሟያ እና ከቀረጥ ነፃ የኪራይ ገቢን ሊያካትት ይችላል። የልጆች ገቢ እና በርካታ ስም ያላቸው ጥቅሞች አይካተቱም። የHusbanken የገቢ መመሪያን ያረጋግጡ።","What counts as approved housing costs?":"እንደ ተቀባይነት ያለው የመኖሪያ ቤት ወጪዎች ምን ይቆጠራል?","Husbanken counts costs differently for renters, shared-cost housing and detached homes. Enter the amount already worked out under its current rules, not every housing bill. The result is still capped by household size and municipality.":"የባልከን ቆጠራ ለተከራዮች፣ ለጋራ ወጭ መኖሪያ ቤቶች እና ለግል ቤቶች በተለየ መንገድ ያስከፍላል። አሁን ባለው ደንቦቹ የተሰራውን መጠን ያስገቡ እንጂ እያንዳንዱን የቤት ቢል አይደለም። ውጤቱ አሁንም በቤተሰብ ብዛት እና በማዘጋጃ ቤት ተገድቧል።","Does changing language change the rules?":"ቋንቋ መቀየር ደንቦቹን ይለውጣል?","No. This tool estimates a Norway-only 2026 scenario in every interface language.":"ቁ. ይህ መሳሪያ በሁሉም የበይነገጽ ቋንቋ የኖርዌይ-ብቻ 2026 ሁኔታን ይገመታል።","Scope and limits":"ወሰን እና ገደቦች","Norway only. This standard-case estimate does not decide eligibility or model the separate upper household-income limit, minimum payout, single old-age pensioner or young-disabled thresholds, special-adapted housing, transition rules, or every income and asset exception. The 2026 rates are static and must be rechecked against Husbanken. Use its official calculator for the month you are checking.":"ኖርዌይ ብቻ። ይህ መደበኛ-ጉዳይ ግምት ብቁነትን አይወስንም ወይም የተለየ የላይኛው የቤተሰብ ገቢ ገደብ፣ አነስተኛ ክፍያ፣ ነጠላ የዕድሜ ጡረተኞች ወይም ወጣት-አካል ጉዳተኛ ደረጃዎች፣ ልዩ የተስተካከለ መኖሪያ ቤት፣ የሽግግር ደንቦች፣ ወይም እያንዳንዱ የገቢ እና የንብረት ልዩነት አይወስንም። የ2026 ተመኖች ቋሚ ናቸው እና በ Husbanken ላይ እንደገና መፈተሽ አለባቸው። ለሚያረጋግጡት ወር ኦፊሴላዊውን ካልኩሌተር ይጠቀሙ።","Estimate a standard monthly scenario":"መደበኛ ወርሃዊ ሁኔታን ይገምቱ","Norwegian rules only · standard 2026 rates · checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country or rules.":"የኖርዌይ ህጎች ብቻ · መደበኛ 2026 ተመኖች · የተረጋገጠ 17 ጥቅምት 2026 · ቋንቋ ሀገሪቱን ወይም ደንቦችን አይለውጥም.","Monthly household income basis before weighting, NOK":"ከክብደት በፊት ወርሃዊ የቤተሰብ ገቢ መሰረት፣ NOK","Use the gross monthly basis Husbanken applies, including any applicable wealth supplement and tax-free rental income. Exclude items Husbanken says do not count. See its income guide before relying on a result.":"ሂስባንከን የሚያመለክተውን ጠቅላላ ወርሃዊ ተጠቀም፣ ማንኛውም የሚመለከተው የሀብት ማሟያ እና ከቀረጥ ነፃ የኪራይ ገቢን ጨምሮ። Husbanken አትቁጠሩ ይላል ንጥሎችን አግልል. በውጤቱ ላይ ከመታመንዎ በፊት የገቢ መመሪያውን ይመልከቱ።","Monthly housing costs already approved under Husbanken rules, NOK":"ወርሃዊ የመኖሪያ ቤት ወጪዎች በHusbanken ህግጋት፣ ኖክ","Do not add every housing bill. Approved costs differ for rental, shared-cost and detached housing; enter the monthly amount under current Husbanken rules. A household and municipality cap is applied below.":"እያንዳንዱን የመኖሪያ ቤት ሂሳብ አይጨምሩ። የተፈቀደላቸው ወጪዎች ለኪራይ ፣ ለጋራ-ወጭ እና ለግል መኖሪያ ቤቶች ይለያያሉ ። አሁን ባለው Husbanken ደንቦች መሠረት ወርሃዊውን መጠን ያስገቡ። የቤትና የማዘጋጃ ቤት ካፕ ከዚህ በታች ተተግብሯል።","Household members aged 18 or older":"የቤተሰብ አባላት ዕድሜያቸው 18 ወይም ከዚያ በላይ","Household members under 18":"የቤት አባላት በ18 ስር","2026 municipality cap group":"2026 የማዘጋጃ ቤት ካፕ ቡድን","Other municipalities":"ሌሎች ማዘጋጃ ቤቶች","Oslo":"ኦስሎ","Bergen, Trondheim, Tromsø, Stavanger or Bærum":"በርገን፣ ትሮንደሄም፣ ትሮምሶ፣ ስታቫንገር ወይም ቤሩም","Kristiansand, Skedsmo, Frogn, Lørenskog, Nordre Follo, Asker, Nesodden, Sola or Sandnes":"ክርስቲያኖች እና ስኬድሞ፣ እንቁራሪት፣ ሎረንስኮግ፣ ኖርድሬ ፎሎ፣ አስከር፣ ኔሶደን፣ ሶላ ወይም ሳንድስ","Estimate monthly amount":"የወሩን መጠን ግምት","Clear entries":"ግቤቶችን አጽዳ","Enter the household’s monthly income basis, approved housing costs and composition.":"የቤተሰቡን ወርሃዊ ገቢ መሰረት፣የተፈቀደለትን የመኖሪያ ቤት ወጪ እና ስብጥር ያስገቡ።","Scenario calculated on this device. Husbanken decides actual cases.":"ሁኔታ በዚህ መሣሪያ ላይ ይሰላል። Husbanken ትክክለኛ ጉዳዮችን ይወስናል።","Entries cleared.":"ግቤቶች ጸድተዋል።","Check the monthly amounts, household counts and municipality group.":"የወሩን መጠን፣የቤት ቆጠራን እና የማዘጋጃ ቤቱን ቡድን ይመልከቱ።","Standard monthly scenario":"መደበኛ ወርሃዊ ሁኔታ","Estimated monthly housing benefit":"የሚገመተው ወርሃዊ የቤት ጥቅማ ጥቅም","Monthly household income entered":"የወሩ የቤተሰብ ገቢ ገብቷል።","Household income weight":"የቤት ገቢ ክብደት","Weighted monthly income":"የተመዘነ ወርሃዊ ገቢ","Estimated monthly own contribution":"የሚገመተው ወርሃዊ የራሱ አስተዋጽዖ","Approved housing costs entered":"የተፈቀዱ የቤት ወጪዎች ገብተዋል።","Monthly housing-cost cap":"ወርሃዊ የመኖሪያ ቤት ዋጋ ካፕ","Approved costs used after cap":"ከካፕ በኋላ ጥቅም ላይ የሚውሉ የጸደቁ ወጪዎች","Costs remaining after own contribution":"ወጪዎች ከራሳቸው አስተዋጽዖ በኋላ ይቀራሉ","Coverage rate":"የሽፋን መጠን","Assumptions used":"ጥቅም ላይ የዋሉ ግምቶች","The standard contribution thresholds and housing-cost caps use Husbanken’s 2026 rates checked 17 October 2026.":"የመደበኛ መዋጮ ገደቦች እና የመኖሪያ ቤት ወጪዎች የ Husbanken's 2026 ተመኖች ተረጋግጠዋል 17 ጥቅምት 2026 ይጠቀማሉ።","Estimated benefit = max(0, approved costs after cap − own contribution) × 73.7%. Weighted income uses 1.00 for the first member, 0.13 for each additional member aged 18 or older and 0.15 for each additional member under 18.":"የተገመተው ጥቅም = ከፍተኛ (0, ከካፒታል በኋላ የተፈቀደ ወጪዎች - የራሱ አስተዋፅኦ) × 73.7%. የተመጣጠነ ገቢ 1.00ን ለመጀመሪያው አባል ይጠቀማል, 0.13 ለእያንዳንዱ ተጨማሪ አባል እድሜ 18 ወይም ከዚያ በላይ እና 0.15 ለእያንዳንዱ ተጨማሪ አባል በ 18.","The entered income must already follow Husbanken’s income rules. Special thresholds, the separate household income ceiling, payout floor and personal eligibility are not calculated.":"የገባው ገቢ የHusbankenን የገቢ ደንቦችን መከተል አለበት። ልዩ ገደቦች፣ የተለየ የቤተሰብ ገቢ ጣሪያ፣ የክፍያ ወለል እና የግል ብቁነት አይሰሉም።","Private, local calculation. No figures are uploaded or stored by this page.":"የግል፣ የአካባቢ ስሌት። በዚህ ገጽ ምንም ቁጥሮች አልተሰቀሉም ወይም አልተቀመጡም።","Husbanken: calculation":"Husbanken: ስሌት","Husbanken: income basis":"Husbanken፡ የገቢ መሰረት","Husbanken: 2026 own-contribution rates":"Husbanken: 2026 የራሱ አስተዋጽዖ ተመኖች","Husbanken: 2026 housing-cost caps":"Husbanken: 2026 የመኖሪያ ቤት-ወጪ ጣራዎች","Open Husbanken’s official calculator":"የHusbanken ይፋዊ ካልኩሌተርን ክፈት"},"ar":{"Norway Housing Benefit Estimator":"مقدّر مزايا الإسكان في النرويج","Norway Housing Benefit Calculator 2026 — Monthly Scenario":"حاسبة إعانة الإسكان في النرويج 2026 — السيناريو الشهري","Estimate a standard monthly Norwegian housing-benefit scenario from the household income basis, approved housing costs, household size and municipality group. See the 2026 assumptions and continue to Husbanken for a current eligibility check.":"قم بتقدير السيناريو الشهري القياسي لمزايا الإسكان النرويجي من أساس دخل الأسرة، وتكاليف السكن المعتمدة، وحجم الأسرة، ومجموعة البلدية. راجع افتراضات 2026 وتابع إلى Husbanken للتحقق من الأهلية الحالية.","Use this private scenario to understand how Norway’s housing-benefit formula combines approved housing costs, weighted household income and the 2026 coverage rate. The interface language never changes the Norwegian rules.":"استخدم هذا السيناريو الخاص لفهم كيف تجمع صيغة إعانات الإسكان في النرويج بين تكاليف الإسكان المعتمدة ودخل الأسرة المرجح ومعدل التغطية 2026. لغة الواجهة لا تغير القواعد النرويجية أبدًا.","Calculations run in this browser. Entries are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"يتم تشغيل العمليات الحسابية في هذا المتصفح. لا يتم إرسال الإدخالات إلى الخادم أو حفظها بواسطة هذه الأداة.","Example":"مثال","For one household member with no income and NOK 8,000 in monthly approved housing costs, the 2026 standard own contribution is about NOK 2,215 per month. The estimated benefit is about NOK 4,032 after applying the 73.7% rate.":"بالنسبة لفرد واحد من أفراد الأسرة ليس لديه دخل ويتحمل 8,000 كرونة نرويجية في تكاليف السكن الشهرية المعتمدة، تبلغ مساهمة 2026 القياسية الخاصة حوالي 2,215 كرونة نرويجية شهريًا. تبلغ الفائدة المقدرة حوالي NOK 4,032 بعد تطبيق معدل 73.7%.","How the scenario works":"كيفية عمل السيناريو","The tool divides household income by the official household weight, calculates the standard own contribution from weighted annual income, limits approved housing costs by the household-size and municipality cap, subtracts the monthly own contribution and applies 73.7%.":"تقسم الأداة دخل الأسرة على وزن الأسرة الرسمي، وتحسب المساهمة القياسية الخاصة من الدخل السنوي المرجح، وتحدد تكاليف السكن المعتمدة حسب حجم الأسرة والحد الأقصى للبلدية، وتطرح المساهمة الشهرية الخاصة وتطبق 73.7%.","Common questions":"الأسئلة الشائعة","Is this an official award or eligibility decision?":"هل هذا قرار رسمي بالجائزة أو الأهلية؟","No. It is a standard-case scenario, not an application or decision. Husbanken’s official calculator applies current eligibility limits, personal rules and the month being checked.":"رقم. إنه سيناريو حالة قياسية، وليس تطبيقًا أو قرارًا. تطبق الآلة الحاسبة الرسمية لـ Husbanken حدود الأهلية الحالية والقواعد الشخصية والشهر الذي يتم التحقق منه.","What should I enter as household income?":"ما الذي يجب علي إدخاله كدخل للأسرة؟","Enter the monthly household income basis used by Husbanken before household weighting. It may include taxable monthly income, reportable annual income converted to a month, applicable wealth supplement and tax-free rental income. Children’s income and several named benefits are excluded. Check Husbanken’s income guidance.":"أدخل أساس دخل الأسرة الشهري الذي يستخدمه Husbanken قبل ترجيح الأسرة. وقد يشمل الدخل الشهري الخاضع للضريبة، والدخل السنوي الخاضع للضريبة المحول إلى شهر، وملحق الثروة المطبق، ودخل الإيجار المعفى من الضرائب. يتم استبعاد دخل الأطفال والعديد من المزايا المذكورة. تحقق من إرشادات الدخل الخاصة بـ Husbanken.","What counts as approved housing costs?":"ما هي تكاليف السكن المعتمدة؟","Husbanken counts costs differently for renters, shared-cost housing and detached homes. Enter the amount already worked out under its current rules, not every housing bill. The result is still capped by household size and municipality.":"Husbanken يحسب التكاليف بشكل مختلف بالنسبة للمستأجرين، والمساكن ذات التكلفة المشتركة، والمنازل المنفصلة. أدخل المبلغ الذي تم دفعه بالفعل بموجب قواعده الحالية، وليس كل فاتورة إسكان. ولا تزال النتيجة محددة بحجم الأسرة والبلدية.","Does changing language change the rules?":"هل تغيير اللغة يغير القواعد؟","No. This tool estimates a Norway-only 2026 scenario in every interface language.":"رقم. تقوم هذه الأداة بتقدير سيناريو 2026 للنرويج فقط في كل لغة واجهة.","Scope and limits":"النطاق والحدود","Norway only. This standard-case estimate does not decide eligibility or model the separate upper household-income limit, minimum payout, single old-age pensioner or young-disabled thresholds, special-adapted housing, transition rules, or every income and asset exception. The 2026 rates are static and must be rechecked against Husbanken. Use its official calculator for the month you are checking.":"النرويج فقط. لا يحدد تقدير الحالة المعيارية هذا الأهلية أو يضع نموذجًا للحد الأعلى المنفصل لدخل الأسرة، أو الحد الأدنى للدفع، أو متقاعد كبير السن أو عتبات الشباب المعاقين، أو الإسكان المكيف بشكل خاص، أو القواعد الانتقالية، أو كل استثناء من الدخل والأصول. أسعار 2026 ثابتة ويجب إعادة فحصها مقابل Husbanken. استخدم الآلة الحاسبة الرسمية للشهر الذي تقوم بالتحقق منه.","Estimate a standard monthly scenario":"تقدير السيناريو الشهري القياسي","Norwegian rules only · standard 2026 rates · checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country or rules.":"القواعد النرويجية فقط · أسعار 2026 القياسية · محددة 17 أكتوبر 2026 · اللغة لا تغير البلد أو القواعد.","Monthly household income basis before weighting, NOK":"أساس دخل الأسرة الشهري قبل الترجيح، NOK","Use the gross monthly basis Husbanken applies, including any applicable wealth supplement and tax-free rental income. Exclude items Husbanken says do not count. See its income guide before relying on a result.":"استخدم إجمالي الأساس الشهري الذي تطبقه Husbanken، بما في ذلك أي ملحق ثروة قابل للتطبيق ودخل إيجار معفي من الضرائب. استبعاد العناصر التي يقول Husbanken أنها لا تحتسب. راجع دليل الدخل قبل الاعتماد على النتيجة.","Monthly housing costs already approved under Husbanken rules, NOK":"تكاليف السكن الشهرية التي تمت الموافقة عليها بالفعل بموجب قواعد Husbanken، NOK","Do not add every housing bill. Approved costs differ for rental, shared-cost and detached housing; enter the monthly amount under current Husbanken rules. A household and municipality cap is applied below.":"لا تقم بإضافة كل فاتورة إسكان. تختلف التكاليف المعتمدة للإيجار والتكلفة المشتركة والسكن المنفصل؛ أدخل المبلغ الشهري بموجب قواعد Husbanken الحالية. يتم تطبيق الحد الأقصى للأسرة والبلدية أدناه.","Household members aged 18 or older":"أفراد الأسرة الذين تتراوح أعمارهم بين 18 أو أكبر","Household members under 18":"أفراد الأسرة تحت 18","2026 municipality cap group":"2026 مجموعة قبعات البلدية","Other municipalities":"بلديات أخرى","Oslo":"أوسلو","Bergen, Trondheim, Tromsø, Stavanger or Bærum":"بيرجن، أو تروندهايم، أو ترومسو، أو ستافنجر، أو باروم","Kristiansand, Skedsmo, Frogn, Lørenskog, Nordre Follo, Asker, Nesodden, Sola or Sandnes":"كريستيانساند، سكيدسمو، فروجن، لورينسكوج، نوردري فولو، أسكر، نيسودين، سولا أو ساندنيس","Estimate monthly amount":"تقدير المبلغ الشهري","Clear entries":"مسح الإدخالات","Enter the household’s monthly income basis, approved housing costs and composition.":"أدخل أساس الدخل الشهري للأسرة وتكاليف السكن المعتمدة وتكوينه.","Scenario calculated on this device. Husbanken decides actual cases.":"السيناريو المحسوب على هذا الجهاز. Husbanken يقرر القضايا الفعلية.","Entries cleared.":"تم مسح الإدخالات.","Check the monthly amounts, household counts and municipality group.":"التحقق من المبالغ الشهرية وأعداد الأسر ومجموعة البلدية.","Standard monthly scenario":"السيناريو الشهري القياسي","Estimated monthly housing benefit":"مزايا السكن الشهرية المقدرة","Monthly household income entered":"تم إدخال دخل الأسرة الشهري","Household income weight":"وزن دخل الأسرة","Weighted monthly income":"الدخل الشهري المرجح","Estimated monthly own contribution":"المساهمة الشهرية المقدرة","Approved housing costs entered":"تم إدخال تكاليف السكن المعتمدة","Monthly housing-cost cap":"الحد الأقصى لتكلفة السكن الشهرية","Approved costs used after cap":"التكاليف المعتمدة المستخدمة بعد الحد الأقصى","Costs remaining after own contribution":"التكاليف المتبقية بعد المساهمة الخاصة","Coverage rate":"معدل التغطية","Assumptions used":"الافتراضات المستخدمة","The standard contribution thresholds and housing-cost caps use Husbanken’s 2026 rates checked 17 October 2026.":"تستخدم عتبات المساهمة القياسية والحدود القصوى لتكلفة الإسكان معدلات 2026 الخاصة بـ Husbanken والتي تم التحقق منها في 17 في أكتوبر 2026.","Estimated benefit = max(0, approved costs after cap − own contribution) × 73.7%. Weighted income uses 1.00 for the first member, 0.13 for each additional member aged 18 or older and 0.15 for each additional member under 18.":"الفائدة المقدرة = الحد الأقصى (0، التكاليف المعتمدة بعد الحد الأقصى - المساهمة الخاصة) × 73.7%. يستخدم الدخل المرجح 1.00 للعضو الأول، و0.13 لكل عضو إضافي عمره 18 أو أكبر و0.15 لكل عضو إضافي ضمن 18.","The entered income must already follow Husbanken’s income rules. Special thresholds, the separate household income ceiling, payout floor and personal eligibility are not calculated.":"يجب أن يتبع الدخل المُدخل بالفعل قواعد الدخل الخاصة بـ Husbanken. لا يتم حساب الحدود الخاصة وسقف دخل الأسرة المنفصل والحد الأدنى للدفع والأهلية الشخصية.","Private, local calculation. No figures are uploaded or stored by this page.":"حساب محلي خاص. لا يتم تحميل أو تخزين أي أرقام بواسطة هذه الصفحة.","Husbanken: calculation":"Husbanken: الحساب","Husbanken: income basis":"Husbanken: أساس الدخل","Husbanken: 2026 own-contribution rates":"Husbanken: معدلات المساهمة الخاصة 2026","Husbanken: 2026 housing-cost caps":"Husbanken: 2026 الحدود القصوى لتكاليف السكن","Open Husbanken’s official calculator":"افتح الآلة الحاسبة الرسمية لـ Husbanken"},"bg":{"Norway Housing Benefit Estimator":"Оценка на жилищните обезщетения в Норвегия","Norway Housing Benefit Calculator 2026 — Monthly Scenario":"Калкулатор за жилищни помощи в Норвегия 2026 — месечен сценарий","Estimate a standard monthly Norwegian housing-benefit scenario from the household income basis, approved housing costs, household size and municipality group. See the 2026 assumptions and continue to Husbanken for a current eligibility check.":"Оценете стандартен месечен норвежки сценарий за жилищни помощи въз основа на доходите на домакинството, одобрените жилищни разходи, размера на домакинството и общинската група. Вижте предположенията 2026 и продължете към Husbanken за текуща проверка за допустимост.","Use this private scenario to understand how Norway’s housing-benefit formula combines approved housing costs, weighted household income and the 2026 coverage rate. The interface language never changes the Norwegian rules.":"Използвайте този частен сценарий, за да разберете как норвежката формула за жилищни помощи съчетава одобрените жилищни разходи, претегления доход на домакинството и процента на покритие 2026. Езикът на интерфейса никога не променя норвежките правила.","Calculations run in this browser. Entries are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"Изчисленията се изпълняват в този браузър. Записите не се изпращат до сървър или се запазват от този инструмент.","Example":"Пример","For one household member with no income and NOK 8,000 in monthly approved housing costs, the 2026 standard own contribution is about NOK 2,215 per month. The estimated benefit is about NOK 4,032 after applying the 73.7% rate.":"За един член на домакинството без доход и 8,000 норвежки крони одобрени месечни жилищни разходи, стандартният собствен принос 2026 е около 2,215 норвежки крони на месец. Очакваната полза е около NOK 4,032 след прилагане на ставката 73.7%.","How the scenario works":"Как работи сценарият","The tool divides household income by the official household weight, calculates the standard own contribution from weighted annual income, limits approved housing costs by the household-size and municipality cap, subtracts the monthly own contribution and applies 73.7%.":"Инструментът разделя дохода на домакинството на официалното тегло на домакинството, изчислява стандартния собствен принос от претегления годишен доход, ограничава одобрените жилищни разходи според размера на домакинството и тавана на общината, изважда месечния собствен принос и прилага 73.7%.","Common questions":"Често срещани въпроси","Is this an official award or eligibility decision?":"Това официална награда ли е или решение за допустимост?","No. It is a standard-case scenario, not an application or decision. Husbanken’s official calculator applies current eligibility limits, personal rules and the month being checked.":"Бр. Това е стандартен сценарий, а не приложение или решение. Официалният калкулатор на Husbanken прилага текущите лимити за допустимост, личните правила и месеца, който се проверява.","What should I enter as household income?":"Какво трябва да въведа като доход на домакинство?","Enter the monthly household income basis used by Husbanken before household weighting. It may include taxable monthly income, reportable annual income converted to a month, applicable wealth supplement and tax-free rental income. Children’s income and several named benefits are excluded. Check Husbanken’s income guidance.":"Въведете базата на месечния доход на домакинството, използвана от Husbanken преди претеглянето на домакинството. Може да включва облагаем месечен доход, отчетен годишен доход, преобразуван в месец, приложима добавка към богатство и необлагаем доход от наем. Доходите на деца и няколко посочени обезщетения са изключени. Проверете насоките за доходите на Husbanken.","What counts as approved housing costs?":"Какво се счита за одобрени жилищни разходи?","Husbanken counts costs differently for renters, shared-cost housing and detached homes. Enter the amount already worked out under its current rules, not every housing bill. The result is still capped by household size and municipality.":"Husbanken отчита разходите по различен начин за наематели, жилища със споделени разходи и самостоятелни жилища. Въведете сумата, която вече е разработена съгласно настоящите правила, а не всяка жилищна сметка. Резултатът все още е ограничен от размера на домакинството и общината.","Does changing language change the rules?":"Промяната на езика променя ли правилата?","No. This tool estimates a Norway-only 2026 scenario in every interface language.":"Бр. Този инструмент оценява сценарий 2026 само за Норвегия на всеки интерфейсен език.","Scope and limits":"Обхват и ограничения","Norway only. This standard-case estimate does not decide eligibility or model the separate upper household-income limit, minimum payout, single old-age pensioner or young-disabled thresholds, special-adapted housing, transition rules, or every income and asset exception. The 2026 rates are static and must be rechecked against Husbanken. Use its official calculator for the month you are checking.":"Само за Норвегия. Тази оценка за стандартен случай не определя допустимостта или моделира отделната горна граница на дохода на домакинството, минимално изплащане, прагове за единични пенсионери или млади хора с увреждания, специално адаптирано жилище, преходни правила или изключения за всеки доход и имущество. Курсовете 2026 са статични и трябва да бъдат проверени отново спрямо Husbanken. Използвайте официалния му калкулатор за месеца, който проверявате.","Estimate a standard monthly scenario":"Оценете стандартен месечен сценарий","Norwegian rules only · standard 2026 rates · checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country or rules.":"Само норвежки правила · стандартни тарифи 2026 · проверени 17 октомври 2026 · езикът не променя държавата или правилата.","Monthly household income basis before weighting, NOK":"Месечен доход на домакинство преди претегляне, NOK","Use the gross monthly basis Husbanken applies, including any applicable wealth supplement and tax-free rental income. Exclude items Husbanken says do not count. See its income guide before relying on a result.":"Използвайте брутната месечна база, прилагана от Husbanken, включително всички приложими добавки за богатство и необлагаемия доход от наем. Изключете елементите, които Husbanken казва, че не се броят. Вижте неговото ръководство за доходи, преди да разчитате на резултат.","Monthly housing costs already approved under Husbanken rules, NOK":"Месечните жилищни разходи вече са одобрени съгласно правилата на Husbanken, NOK","Do not add every housing bill. Approved costs differ for rental, shared-cost and detached housing; enter the monthly amount under current Husbanken rules. A household and municipality cap is applied below.":"Не добавяйте всяка жилищна сметка. Одобрените разходи се различават за жилища под наем, жилища със споделени разходи и самостоятелни жилища; въведете месечната сума съгласно настоящите правила на Husbanken. По-долу се прилага таван за домакинство и община.","Household members aged 18 or older":"Членове на домакинството на възраст 18 или повече","Household members under 18":"Членове на домакинството под 18","2026 municipality cap group":"2026 общинска горна група","Other municipalities":"Други общини","Oslo":"Осло","Bergen, Trondheim, Tromsø, Stavanger or Bærum":"Берген, Трондхайм, Тромсьо, Ставангер или Берум","Kristiansand, Skedsmo, Frogn, Lørenskog, Nordre Follo, Asker, Nesodden, Sola or Sandnes":"Kristiansand, Skedsmo, Frogn, Lørenskog, Nordre Follo, Asker, Nesodden, Sola или Sandnes","Estimate monthly amount":"Приблизителна месечна сума","Clear entries":"Изчистване на записите","Enter the household’s monthly income basis, approved housing costs and composition.":"Въведете базата на месечния доход на домакинството, одобрените жилищни разходи и състава.","Scenario calculated on this device. Husbanken decides actual cases.":"Сценарий, изчислен на това устройство. Husbanken решава действителни случаи.","Entries cleared.":"Записите са изчистени.","Check the monthly amounts, household counts and municipality group.":"Проверете месечните суми, броя на домакинствата и групата на общината.","Standard monthly scenario":"Стандартен месечен сценарий","Estimated monthly housing benefit":"Прогнозна месечна помощ за жилище","Monthly household income entered":"Въведен месечен доход на домакинство","Household income weight":"Тегло на дохода на домакинството","Weighted monthly income":"Претеглен месечен доход","Estimated monthly own contribution":"Очакван месечен собствен принос","Approved housing costs entered":"Въведени са одобрени жилищни разходи","Monthly housing-cost cap":"Месечен таван на жилищните разходи","Approved costs used after cap":"Одобрени разходи, използвани след кап","Costs remaining after own contribution":"Оставащи разходи след собствен принос","Coverage rate":"Процент на покритие","Assumptions used":"Използвани предположения","The standard contribution thresholds and housing-cost caps use Husbanken’s 2026 rates checked 17 October 2026.":"Стандартните прагове на вноските и горните граници на жилищните разходи използват проверените 2026 ставки на Husbanken 17 октомври 2026.","Estimated benefit = max(0, approved costs after cap − own contribution) × 73.7%. Weighted income uses 1.00 for the first member, 0.13 for each additional member aged 18 or older and 0.15 for each additional member under 18.":"Прогнозна полза = макс.(0, одобрени разходи след ограничение − собствен принос) × 73.7%. Претегленият доход използва 1.00 за първия член, 0.13 за всеки допълнителен член на възраст 18 или по-възрастен и 0.15 за всеки допълнителен член под 18.","The entered income must already follow Husbanken’s income rules. Special thresholds, the separate household income ceiling, payout floor and personal eligibility are not calculated.":"Въведеният доход вече трябва да следва правилата за доходи на Husbanken. Специалните прагове, отделният таван на дохода на домакинството, прагът на изплащане и личната допустимост не се изчисляват.","Private, local calculation. No figures are uploaded or stored by this page.":"Лично, локално изчисление. От тази страница не се качват или съхраняват фигури.","Husbanken: calculation":"Husbanken: изчисление","Husbanken: income basis":"Husbanken: основа на дохода","Husbanken: 2026 own-contribution rates":"Husbanken: 2026 проценти на собствени вноски","Husbanken: 2026 housing-cost caps":"Husbanken: 2026 тавани на жилищните разходи","Open Husbanken’s official calculator":"Отворете официалния калкулатор на Husbanken"},"bn":{"Norway Housing Benefit Estimator":"নরওয়ে হাউজিং বেনিফিট এস্টিমেটর","Norway Housing Benefit Calculator 2026 — Monthly Scenario":"নরওয়ে হাউজিং বেনিফিট ক্যালকুলেটর 2026 — মাসিক দৃশ্যকল্প","Estimate a standard monthly Norwegian housing-benefit scenario from the household income basis, approved housing costs, household size and municipality group. See the 2026 assumptions and continue to Husbanken for a current eligibility check.":"পরিবারের আয়ের ভিত্তিতে, অনুমোদিত আবাসন খরচ, পরিবারের আকার এবং পৌরসভা গোষ্ঠী থেকে একটি আদর্শ মাসিক নরওয়েজিয়ান হাউজিং-বেনিফিট পরিস্থিতি অনুমান করুন। 2026 অনুমান দেখুন এবং বর্তমান যোগ্যতা যাচাইয়ের জন্য Husbanken-এ চালিয়ে যান।","Use this private scenario to understand how Norway’s housing-benefit formula combines approved housing costs, weighted household income and the 2026 coverage rate. The interface language never changes the Norwegian rules.":"নরওয়ের হাউজিং-বেনিফিট সূত্র কীভাবে অনুমোদিত আবাসন খরচ, ওজনযুক্ত পারিবারিক আয় এবং 2026 কভারেজ রেটকে একত্রিত করে তা বোঝার জন্য এই ব্যক্তিগত দৃশ্যটি ব্যবহার করুন। ইন্টারফেস ভাষা কখনই নরওয়েজিয়ান নিয়ম পরিবর্তন করে না।","Calculations run in this browser. Entries are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"গণনা এই ব্রাউজারে চলে। এন্ট্রি একটি সার্ভারে পাঠানো বা এই টুল দ্বারা সংরক্ষিত করা হয় না.","Example":"উদাহরণ","For one household member with no income and NOK 8,000 in monthly approved housing costs, the 2026 standard own contribution is about NOK 2,215 per month. The estimated benefit is about NOK 4,032 after applying the 73.7% rate.":"একজন পরিবারের সদস্য যাদের আয় নেই এবং মাসিক অনুমোদিত আবাসন খরচে NOK 8,000, 2026 স্ট্যান্ডার্ড নিজস্ব অবদান প্রতি মাসে প্রায় NOK 2,215। 73.7% হার প্রয়োগ করার পরে আনুমানিক সুবিধা প্রায় NOK 4,032।","How the scenario works":"কিভাবে দৃশ্যকল্প কাজ করে","The tool divides household income by the official household weight, calculates the standard own contribution from weighted annual income, limits approved housing costs by the household-size and municipality cap, subtracts the monthly own contribution and applies 73.7%.":"টুলটি পারিবারিক আয়কে অফিসিয়াল পরিবারের ওজন দ্বারা ভাগ করে, ওজনযুক্ত বার্ষিক আয় থেকে মানক নিজস্ব অবদান গণনা করে, পরিবারের আকার এবং পৌরসভা ক্যাপ দ্বারা অনুমোদিত আবাসন খরচ সীমিত করে, মাসিক নিজস্ব অবদান বিয়োগ করে এবং 73.7% প্রয়োগ করে৷","Common questions":"সাধারণ প্রশ্ন","Is this an official award or eligibility decision?":"এটি কি একটি অফিসিয়াল পুরস্কার বা যোগ্যতার সিদ্ধান্ত?","No. It is a standard-case scenario, not an application or decision. Husbanken’s official calculator applies current eligibility limits, personal rules and the month being checked.":"না। এটি একটি আদর্শ-কেস দৃশ্যকল্প, একটি আবেদন বা সিদ্ধান্ত নয়। Husbanken-এর অফিসিয়াল ক্যালকুলেটর বর্তমান যোগ্যতা সীমা, ব্যক্তিগত নিয়ম এবং পরীক্ষা করা মাস প্রযোজ্য।","What should I enter as household income?":"পরিবারের আয় হিসাবে আমার কী প্রবেশ করা উচিত?","Enter the monthly household income basis used by Husbanken before household weighting. It may include taxable monthly income, reportable annual income converted to a month, applicable wealth supplement and tax-free rental income. Children’s income and several named benefits are excluded. Check Husbanken’s income guidance.":"পরিবারের ওজন নির্ধারণের আগে Husbanken দ্বারা ব্যবহৃত মাসিক পারিবারিক আয়ের ভিত্তিতে প্রবেশ করুন৷ এতে করযোগ্য মাসিক আয়, রিপোর্টযোগ্য বার্ষিক আয় এক মাসে রূপান্তরিত, প্রযোজ্য সম্পদ সম্পূরক এবং করমুক্ত ভাড়া আয় অন্তর্ভুক্ত থাকতে পারে। শিশুদের আয় এবং বেশ কিছু নামকৃত সুবিধা বাদ দেওয়া হয়েছে। Husbanken এর আয় নির্দেশিকা পরীক্ষা করুন।","What counts as approved housing costs?":"অনুমোদিত আবাসন খরচ হিসাবে কি গণনা করা হয়?","Husbanken counts costs differently for renters, shared-cost housing and detached homes. Enter the amount already worked out under its current rules, not every housing bill. The result is still capped by household size and municipality.":"Husbanken ভাড়া, শেয়ার্ড-কস্ট হাউজিং এবং বিচ্ছিন্ন বাড়ির জন্য আলাদাভাবে খরচ গণনা করে। প্রতিটি হাউজিং বিল নয়, বর্তমান নিয়মের অধীনে ইতিমধ্যে কাজ করা পরিমাণ লিখুন। ফলাফল এখনও পরিবারের আকার এবং পৌরসভা দ্বারা সীমাবদ্ধ.","Does changing language change the rules?":"ভাষা পরিবর্তন করলে কি নিয়ম পরিবর্তন হয়?","No. This tool estimates a Norway-only 2026 scenario in every interface language.":"না। এই টুলটি প্রতিটি ইন্টারফেস ভাষায় নরওয়ে-শুধুমাত্র 2026 দৃশ্যকল্প অনুমান করে।","Scope and limits":"পরিধি এবং সীমা","Norway only. This standard-case estimate does not decide eligibility or model the separate upper household-income limit, minimum payout, single old-age pensioner or young-disabled thresholds, special-adapted housing, transition rules, or every income and asset exception. The 2026 rates are static and must be rechecked against Husbanken. Use its official calculator for the month you are checking.":"শুধু নরওয়ে। এই স্ট্যান্ডার্ড-কেস অনুমান যোগ্যতা নির্ধারণ করে না বা আলাদা উচ্চ পরিবারের-আয় সীমা, ন্যূনতম অর্থপ্রদান, একক বৃদ্ধ বয়সী পেনশনভোগী বা তরুণ-অক্ষম থ্রেশহোল্ড, বিশেষ-অভিযোজিত আবাসন, ট্রানজিশন নিয়ম, বা প্রতিটি আয় এবং সম্পদের ব্যতিক্রম নির্ধারণ করে না। 2026 হারগুলি স্থির এবং Husbanken এর বিরুদ্ধে পুনরায় পরীক্ষা করা আবশ্যক৷ আপনি যে মাসে পরীক্ষা করছেন তার অফিসিয়াল ক্যালকুলেটর ব্যবহার করুন।","Estimate a standard monthly scenario":"একটি আদর্শ মাসিক পরিস্থিতি অনুমান করুন","Norwegian rules only · standard 2026 rates · checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country or rules.":"শুধু নরওয়েজিয়ান নিয়ম · মান 2026 হার · চেক করা 17 অক্টোবর 2026 · ভাষা দেশ বা নিয়ম পরিবর্তন করে না।","Monthly household income basis before weighting, NOK":"ওজন নির্ধারণের আগে মাসিক পারিবারিক আয়ের ভিত্তিতে, NOK","Use the gross monthly basis Husbanken applies, including any applicable wealth supplement and tax-free rental income. Exclude items Husbanken says do not count. See its income guide before relying on a result.":"যেকোন প্রযোজ্য সম্পদের পরিপূরক এবং কর-মুক্ত ভাড়া আয় সহ Husbanken প্রযোজ্য স্থূল মাসিক ভিত্তিতে ব্যবহার করুন। বাদ আইটেম Husbanken বলেছেন গণনা করবেন না. ফলাফলের উপর নির্ভর করার আগে এর আয় নির্দেশিকা দেখুন।","Monthly housing costs already approved under Husbanken rules, NOK":"মাসিক আবাসন খরচ ইতিমধ্যে Husbanken নিয়মের অধীনে অনুমোদিত, NOK","Do not add every housing bill. Approved costs differ for rental, shared-cost and detached housing; enter the monthly amount under current Husbanken rules. A household and municipality cap is applied below.":"প্রতিটি হাউজিং বিল যোগ করবেন না। অনুমোদিত খরচ ভাড়া, ভাগ করা খরচ এবং বিচ্ছিন্ন আবাসনের জন্য আলাদা; বর্তমান Husbanken নিয়মের অধীনে মাসিক পরিমাণ লিখুন। একটি পরিবার এবং পৌরসভা ক্যাপ নীচে প্রয়োগ করা হয়েছে।","Household members aged 18 or older":"পরিবারের সদস্যদের বয়স 18 বা তার বেশি","Household members under 18":"18 এর অধীনে পরিবারের সদস্যরা","2026 municipality cap group":"2026 পৌরসভা ক্যাপ গ্রুপ","Other municipalities":"অন্যান্য পৌরসভা","Oslo":"অসলো","Bergen, Trondheim, Tromsø, Stavanger or Bærum":"Bergen, Trondheim, Tromsø, Stavanger or Bærum","Kristiansand, Skedsmo, Frogn, Lørenskog, Nordre Follo, Asker, Nesodden, Sola or Sandnes":"Kristiansand, Skedsmo, Frogn, Lørenskog, Nordre Follo, Asker, Nesodden, Sola or Sandnes","Estimate monthly amount":"আনুমানিক মাসিক পরিমাণ","Clear entries":"এন্ট্রি সাফ করুন","Enter the household’s monthly income basis, approved housing costs and composition.":"পরিবারের মাসিক আয়ের ভিত্তিতে, অনুমোদিত আবাসন খরচ এবং রচনা লিখুন।","Scenario calculated on this device. Husbanken decides actual cases.":"এই ডিভাইসে গণনা করা দৃশ্যকল্প। Husbanken প্রকৃত মামলার সিদ্ধান্ত নেয়।","Entries cleared.":"এন্ট্রিগুলি সাফ করা হয়েছে৷","Check the monthly amounts, household counts and municipality group.":"মাসিক পরিমাণ, পরিবারের সংখ্যা এবং পৌরসভা গোষ্ঠী পরীক্ষা করুন।","Standard monthly scenario":"মানিক মাসিক দৃশ্যকল্প","Estimated monthly housing benefit":"আনুমানিক মাসিক আবাসন সুবিধা","Monthly household income entered":"মাসিক পারিবারিক আয় প্রবেশ করানো হয়েছে৷","Household income weight":"গৃহস্থালী আয়ের ওজন","Weighted monthly income":"ভারিত মাসিক আয়","Estimated monthly own contribution":"আনুমানিক মাসিক নিজস্ব অবদান","Approved housing costs entered":"অনুমোদিত আবাসন খরচ প্রবেশ করানো হয়েছে","Monthly housing-cost cap":"মাসিক হাউজিং-কস্ট ক্যাপ","Approved costs used after cap":"ক্যাপের পরে ব্যবহৃত অনুমোদিত খরচ","Costs remaining after own contribution":"নিজের অবদানের পরে অবশিষ্ট খরচ","Coverage rate":"কভারেজ রেট","Assumptions used":"অনুমান ব্যবহার করা হয়েছে","The standard contribution thresholds and housing-cost caps use Husbanken’s 2026 rates checked 17 October 2026.":"মানক অবদানের থ্রেশহোল্ড এবং হাউজিং-কস্ট ক্যাপ ব্যবহার করে Husbanken-এর 2026 হার চেক করা 17 অক্টোবর 2026।","Estimated benefit = max(0, approved costs after cap − own contribution) × 73.7%. Weighted income uses 1.00 for the first member, 0.13 for each additional member aged 18 or older and 0.15 for each additional member under 18.":"আনুমানিক সুবিধা = সর্বোচ্চ(0, ক্যাপ − নিজস্ব অবদানের পরে অনুমোদিত খরচ) × 73.7%। ওজনযুক্ত আয় প্রথম সদস্যের জন্য 1.00, 18 বা তার বেশি বয়সী প্রতিটি অতিরিক্ত সদস্যের জন্য 0.13 এবং 18 এর অধীনে প্রতিটি অতিরিক্ত সদস্যের জন্য 0.15 ব্যবহার করে।","The entered income must already follow Husbanken’s income rules. Special thresholds, the separate household income ceiling, payout floor and personal eligibility are not calculated.":"প্রবেশ করা আয়কে অবশ্যই Husbanken-এর আয়ের নিয়ম অনুসরণ করতে হবে। বিশেষ থ্রেশহোল্ড, পৃথক পরিবারের আয়ের সিলিং, পে-আউট মেঝে এবং ব্যক্তিগত যোগ্যতা গণনা করা হয় না।","Private, local calculation. No figures are uploaded or stored by this page.":"ব্যক্তিগত, স্থানীয় গণনা। এই পৃষ্ঠার দ্বারা কোন পরিসংখ্যান আপলোড বা সংরক্ষণ করা হয় না।","Husbanken: calculation":"Husbanken: গণনা","Husbanken: income basis":"Husbanken: আয়ের ভিত্তিতে","Husbanken: 2026 own-contribution rates":"Husbanken: 2026 নিজস্ব অবদানের হার","Husbanken: 2026 housing-cost caps":"Husbanken: 2026 হাউজিং-কস্ট ক্যাপস","Open Husbanken’s official calculator":"Husbanken-এর অফিসিয়াল ক্যালকুলেটর খুলুন"},"ca":{"Norway Housing Benefit Estimator":"Estimador de beneficis per a l'habitatge de Noruega","Norway Housing Benefit Calculator 2026 — Monthly Scenario":"Calculadora de beneficis per a l'habitatge de Noruega 2026 — Escenari mensual","Estimate a standard monthly Norwegian housing-benefit scenario from the household income basis, approved housing costs, household size and municipality group. See the 2026 assumptions and continue to Husbanken for a current eligibility check.":"Estimeu un escenari mensual estàndard de prestacions per a l'habitatge noruec a partir de la base d'ingressos familiars, els costos d'habitatge aprovats, la mida de la llar i el grup de municipis. Consulteu els supòsits 2026 i continueu cap a Husbanken per comprovar l'elegibilitat actual.","Use this private scenario to understand how Norway’s housing-benefit formula combines approved housing costs, weighted household income and the 2026 coverage rate. The interface language never changes the Norwegian rules.":"Utilitzeu aquest escenari privat per entendre com la fórmula de prestacions per a l'habitatge de Noruega combina els costos d'habitatge aprovats, els ingressos familiars ponderats i la taxa de cobertura 2026. L'idioma de la interfície mai canvia les regles noruegues.","Calculations run in this browser. Entries are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"Els càlculs s'executen en aquest navegador. Les entrades no s'envien a un servidor ni es desen amb aquesta eina.","Example":"Exemple","For one household member with no income and NOK 8,000 in monthly approved housing costs, the 2026 standard own contribution is about NOK 2,215 per month. The estimated benefit is about NOK 4,032 after applying the 73.7% rate.":"Per a un membre de la llar sense ingressos i NOK 8,000 en costos d'habitatge aprovats mensualment, la contribució pròpia estàndard 2026 és d'aproximadament NOK 2,215 al mes. El benefici estimat és d'aproximadament NOK 4,032 després d'aplicar la taxa 73.7%.","How the scenario works":"Com funciona l'escenari","The tool divides household income by the official household weight, calculates the standard own contribution from weighted annual income, limits approved housing costs by the household-size and municipality cap, subtracts the monthly own contribution and applies 73.7%.":"L'eina divideix els ingressos de la llar pel pes oficial de la llar, calcula la contribució pròpia estàndard a partir dels ingressos anuals ponderats, limita els costos d'habitatge aprovats per la mida de la llar i el límit municipal, resta la contribució pròpia mensual i aplica 73.7%.","Common questions":"Preguntes habituals","Is this an official award or eligibility decision?":"És un premi oficial o una decisió d'elegibilitat?","No. It is a standard-case scenario, not an application or decision. Husbanken’s official calculator applies current eligibility limits, personal rules and the month being checked.":"Núm. És un escenari estàndard, no una sol·licitud o decisió. La calculadora oficial de Husbanken aplica els límits d'elegibilitat actuals, les regles personals i el mes que es revisa.","What should I enter as household income?":"Què he d'introduir com a ingressos familiars?","Enter the monthly household income basis used by Husbanken before household weighting. It may include taxable monthly income, reportable annual income converted to a month, applicable wealth supplement and tax-free rental income. Children’s income and several named benefits are excluded. Check Husbanken’s income guidance.":"Introduïu la base d'ingressos mensuals de la llar utilitzada per Husbanken abans de la ponderació de la llar. Pot incloure ingressos mensuals imposables, ingressos anuals declarables convertits en un mes, suplement patrimonial aplicable i ingressos de lloguer lliures d'impostos. Queden exclosos els ingressos dels fills i diverses prestacions amb nom. Consulteu la guia d'ingressos de Husbanken.","What counts as approved housing costs?":"Què compta com a despeses d'habitatge aprovades?","Husbanken counts costs differently for renters, shared-cost housing and detached homes. Enter the amount already worked out under its current rules, not every housing bill. The result is still capped by household size and municipality.":"Husbanken compta els costos de manera diferent per als llogaters, els habitatges de cost compartit i els habitatges unifamiliars. Introduïu l'import que ja s'ha calculat segons les seves normes actuals, no totes les factures d'habitatge. El resultat encara està limitat per la mida de la llar i el municipi.","Does changing language change the rules?":"Canviar l'idioma canvia les regles?","No. This tool estimates a Norway-only 2026 scenario in every interface language.":"Núm. Aquesta eina estima un escenari 2026 només per a Noruega en tots els idiomes de la interfície.","Scope and limits":"Àmbit i límits","Norway only. This standard-case estimate does not decide eligibility or model the separate upper household-income limit, minimum payout, single old-age pensioner or young-disabled thresholds, special-adapted housing, transition rules, or every income and asset exception. The 2026 rates are static and must be rechecked against Husbanken. Use its official calculator for the month you are checking.":"Només a Noruega. Aquesta estimació de cas estàndard no decideix l'elegibilitat ni modela el límit superior d'ingressos de la llar, el pagament mínim, els llindars de pensionista únic o de joves discapacitats, l'habitatge especial adaptat, les normes de transició o totes les excepcions d'ingressos i actius. Les tarifes 2026 són estàtiques i s'han de tornar a comprovar amb Husbanken. Utilitzeu la seva calculadora oficial per al mes que comproveu.","Estimate a standard monthly scenario":"Estima un escenari mensual estàndard","Norwegian rules only · standard 2026 rates · checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country or rules.":"Només regles noruegues · tarifes 2026 estàndard · 17 marcades Octubre 2026 · l'idioma no canvia el país ni les regles.","Monthly household income basis before weighting, NOK":"Base d'ingressos familiars mensuals abans de la ponderació, NOK","Use the gross monthly basis Husbanken applies, including any applicable wealth supplement and tax-free rental income. Exclude items Husbanken says do not count. See its income guide before relying on a result.":"Utilitzeu la base mensual bruta que aplica Husbanken, inclòs qualsevol suplement patrimonial aplicable i els ingressos de lloguer lliures d'impostos. Exclou els articles que Husbanken diu que no compten. Consulteu la seva guia d'ingressos abans de confiar en un resultat.","Monthly housing costs already approved under Husbanken rules, NOK":"Els costos mensuals de l'habitatge ja s'han aprovat segons les normes de Husbanken, NOK","Do not add every housing bill. Approved costs differ for rental, shared-cost and detached housing; enter the monthly amount under current Husbanken rules. A household and municipality cap is applied below.":"No afegiu totes les factures d'habitatge. Els costos aprovats difereixen per a l'habitatge de lloguer, de cost compartit i unifamiliar; introduïu l'import mensual segons les regles actuals de Husbanken. A continuació s'aplica un límit per a la llar i el municipi.","Household members aged 18 or older":"Membres de la llar de 18 o més","Household members under 18":"Membres de la llar amb menys de 18","2026 municipality cap group":"2026 grup de cap municipal","Other municipalities":"Altres municipis","Oslo":"Oslo","Bergen, Trondheim, Tromsø, Stavanger or Bærum":"Bergen, Trondheim, Tromsø, Stavanger o Bærum","Kristiansand, Skedsmo, Frogn, Lørenskog, Nordre Follo, Asker, Nesodden, Sola or Sandnes":"Kristiansand, Skedsmo, Frogn, Lørenskog, Nordre Follo, Asker, Nesodden, Sola o Sandnes","Estimate monthly amount":"Import mensual estimat","Clear entries":"Esborra les entrades","Enter the household’s monthly income basis, approved housing costs and composition.":"Introduïu la base d'ingressos mensuals de la llar, els costos aprovats de l'habitatge i la composició.","Scenario calculated on this device. Husbanken decides actual cases.":"Escenari calculat en aquest dispositiu. Husbanken decideix casos reals.","Entries cleared.":"Entrades esborrades.","Check the monthly amounts, household counts and municipality group.":"Consulta els imports mensuals, el recompte de les llars i el grup de municipis.","Standard monthly scenario":"Escenari mensual estàndard","Estimated monthly housing benefit":"Prestació mensual estimada per a l'habitatge","Monthly household income entered":"Ingressos familiars mensuals introduïts","Household income weight":"Pes dels ingressos de la llar","Weighted monthly income":"Ingressos mensuals ponderats","Estimated monthly own contribution":"Aportació pròpia mensual estimada","Approved housing costs entered":"S'han introduït els costos d'habitatge aprovats","Monthly housing-cost cap":"Top mensual del cost de l'habitatge","Approved costs used after cap":"Costos aprovats utilitzats després del límit","Costs remaining after own contribution":"Costos restants després de l'aportació pròpia","Coverage rate":"Taxa de cobertura","Assumptions used":"Hipotecs utilitzats","The standard contribution thresholds and housing-cost caps use Husbanken’s 2026 rates checked 17 October 2026.":"Els llindars de contribució estàndard i els límits de costos de l'habitatge utilitzen les taxes 2026 de Husbanken verificades 17 d'octubre 2026.","Estimated benefit = max(0, approved costs after cap − own contribution) × 73.7%. Weighted income uses 1.00 for the first member, 0.13 for each additional member aged 18 or older and 0.15 for each additional member under 18.":"Benefici estimat = màxim (0, costos aprovats després del límit − contribució pròpia) × 73.7%. Els ingressos ponderats fan servir 1.00 per al primer membre, 0.13 per a cada membre addicional de 18 o més i 0.15 per a cada membre addicional de 18.","The entered income must already follow Husbanken’s income rules. Special thresholds, the separate household income ceiling, payout floor and personal eligibility are not calculated.":"Els ingressos introduïts ja han de seguir les regles d'ingressos de Husbanken. No es calculen els llindars especials, el sostre d'ingressos de la llar per separat, el sòl de pagament i l'elegibilitat personal.","Private, local calculation. No figures are uploaded or stored by this page.":"Càlcul local, privat. Aquesta pàgina no carrega ni emmagatzema cap xifra.","Husbanken: calculation":"Husbanken: càlcul","Husbanken: income basis":"Husbanken: base d'ingressos","Husbanken: 2026 own-contribution rates":"Husbanken: 2026 taxes de contribució pròpia","Husbanken: 2026 housing-cost caps":"Husbanken: límits de costos d'habitatge 2026","Open Husbanken’s official calculator":"Obre la calculadora oficial de Husbanken"},"de":{"Norway Housing Benefit Estimator":"Norwegischer Wohngeldschätzer","Norway Housing Benefit Calculator 2026 — Monthly Scenario":"Norwegischer Wohngeldrechner 2026 – Monatsszenario","Estimate a standard monthly Norwegian housing-benefit scenario from the household income basis, approved housing costs, household size and municipality group. See the 2026 assumptions and continue to Husbanken for a current eligibility check.":"Schätzen Sie ein standardmäßiges monatliches norwegisches Wohngeldszenario anhand der Haushaltseinkommensbasis, der genehmigten Wohnkosten, der Haushaltsgröße und der Gemeindegruppe. Sehen Sie sich die 2026-Annahmen an und fahren Sie mit Husbanken fort, um eine aktuelle Berechtigungsprüfung durchzuführen.","Use this private scenario to understand how Norway’s housing-benefit formula combines approved housing costs, weighted household income and the 2026 coverage rate. The interface language never changes the Norwegian rules.":"Verwenden Sie dieses private Szenario, um zu verstehen, wie Norwegens Wohngeldformel genehmigte Wohnkosten, gewichtetes Haushaltseinkommen und den 2026-Deckungssatz kombiniert. Die Sprache der Benutzeroberfläche ändert niemals die norwegischen Regeln.","Calculations run in this browser. Entries are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"Berechnungen werden in diesem Browser ausgeführt. Einträge werden von diesem Tool nicht an einen Server gesendet oder gespeichert.","Example":"Beispiel","For one household member with no income and NOK 8,000 in monthly approved housing costs, the 2026 standard own contribution is about NOK 2,215 per month. The estimated benefit is about NOK 4,032 after applying the 73.7% rate.":"Für ein Haushaltsmitglied ohne Einkommen und NOK 8,000 an monatlich genehmigten Wohnkosten beträgt der 2026 Standard-Eigenbeitrag etwa NOK 2,215 pro Monat. Der geschätzte Nutzen liegt bei etwa NOK 4,032 nach Anwendung des 73.7 %-Satzes.","How the scenario works":"So funktioniert das Szenario","The tool divides household income by the official household weight, calculates the standard own contribution from weighted annual income, limits approved housing costs by the household-size and municipality cap, subtracts the monthly own contribution and applies 73.7%.":"Das Tool dividiert das Haushaltseinkommen durch das offizielle Haushaltsgewicht, berechnet den Standardeigenbeitrag aus dem gewichteten Jahreseinkommen, begrenzt die genehmigten Wohnkosten durch die Haushaltsgröße und die Gemeindeobergrenze, subtrahiert den monatlichen Eigenbeitrag und wendet 73.7 % an.","Common questions":"Häufige Fragen","Is this an official award or eligibility decision?":"Ist dies eine offizielle Vergabe- oder Zulassungsentscheidung?","No. It is a standard-case scenario, not an application or decision. Husbanken’s official calculator applies current eligibility limits, personal rules and the month being checked.":"Nr. Es handelt sich um ein Standardfallszenario, nicht um einen Antrag oder eine Entscheidung. Der offizielle Rechner von Husbanken berücksichtigt die aktuellen Berechtigungsgrenzen, persönlichen Regeln und den zu prüfenden Monat.","What should I enter as household income?":"Was soll ich als Haushaltseinkommen eingeben?","Enter the monthly household income basis used by Husbanken before household weighting. It may include taxable monthly income, reportable annual income converted to a month, applicable wealth supplement and tax-free rental income. Children’s income and several named benefits are excluded. Check Husbanken’s income guidance.":"Geben Sie die von Husbanken verwendete monatliche Haushaltseinkommensbasis vor der Haushaltsgewichtung ein. Dazu können steuerpflichtiges Monatseinkommen, meldepflichtiges Jahreseinkommen umgerechnet in einen Monat, geltender Vermögenszuschlag und steuerfreie Mieteinnahmen gehören. Kindereinkommen und einige der genannten Leistungen sind ausgeschlossen. Sehen Sie sich die Einkommensprognose von Husbanken an.","What counts as approved housing costs?":"Was zählt zu den genehmigten Wohnkosten?","Husbanken counts costs differently for renters, shared-cost housing and detached homes. Enter the amount already worked out under its current rules, not every housing bill. The result is still capped by household size and municipality.":"Husbanken berechnet die Kosten für Mieter, Wohnungen mit Kostenbeteiligung und Einfamilienhäuser unterschiedlich. Geben Sie den Betrag ein, der bereits nach den aktuellen Regeln berechnet wurde, nicht jede Wohnungsrechnung. Das Ergebnis ist weiterhin nach Haushaltsgröße und Gemeinde gedeckelt.","Does changing language change the rules?":"Ändert eine Änderung der Sprache die Regeln?","No. This tool estimates a Norway-only 2026 scenario in every interface language.":"Nr. Dieses Tool schätzt ein nur für Norwegen gültiges 2026-Szenario in jeder Schnittstellensprache.","Scope and limits":"Umfang und Grenzen","Norway only. This standard-case estimate does not decide eligibility or model the separate upper household-income limit, minimum payout, single old-age pensioner or young-disabled thresholds, special-adapted housing, transition rules, or every income and asset exception. The 2026 rates are static and must be rechecked against Husbanken. Use its official calculator for the month you are checking.":"Nur Norwegen. Diese Standardfallschätzung entscheidet nicht über die Anspruchsberechtigung und modelliert nicht die separate Obergrenze des Haushaltseinkommens, die Mindestauszahlung, die Schwellenwerte für alleinstehende Altersrentner oder junge Behinderte, speziell angepasste Wohnverhältnisse, Übergangsregeln oder jede Einkommens- und Vermögensausnahme. Die 2026-Kurse sind statisch und müssen erneut mit Husbanken überprüft werden. Verwenden Sie den offiziellen Rechner für den Monat, den Sie überprüfen.","Estimate a standard monthly scenario":"Schätzen Sie ein monatliches Standardszenario","Norwegian rules only · standard 2026 rates · checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country or rules.":"Nur norwegische Regeln · Standard-2026-Tarife · geprüft 17 Oktober 2026 · Sprache ändert weder das Land noch die Regeln.","Monthly household income basis before weighting, NOK":"Basis des monatlichen Haushaltseinkommens vor Gewichtung, NOK","Use the gross monthly basis Husbanken applies, including any applicable wealth supplement and tax-free rental income. Exclude items Husbanken says do not count. See its income guide before relying on a result.":"Verwenden Sie die monatliche Bruttobasis, die Husbanken anwendet, einschließlich etwaiger Vermögenszuschläge und steuerfreier Mieteinnahmen. Artikel ausschließen, laut Husbanken nicht zählen. Sehen Sie sich den Einkommensleitfaden an, bevor Sie sich auf ein Ergebnis verlassen.","Monthly housing costs already approved under Husbanken rules, NOK":"Monatliche Wohnkosten bereits nach den Husbanken-Regeln genehmigt, NOK","Do not add every housing bill. Approved costs differ for rental, shared-cost and detached housing; enter the monthly amount under current Husbanken rules. A household and municipality cap is applied below.":"Fügen Sie nicht jede Wohnungsrechnung hinzu. Die genehmigten Kosten unterscheiden sich für Miet-, Teilkosten- und Einfamilienhäuser. Geben Sie den monatlichen Betrag gemäß den aktuellen Husbanken-Regeln ein. Nachfolgend gilt eine Haushalts- und Gemeindeobergrenze.","Household members aged 18 or older":"Haushaltsmitglieder im Alter von 18 oder älter","Household members under 18":"Haushaltsmitglieder unter 18","2026 municipality cap group":"2026 Gemeindeobergrenzengruppe","Other municipalities":"Andere Gemeinden","Oslo":"Oslo","Bergen, Trondheim, Tromsø, Stavanger or Bærum":"Bergen, Trondheim, Tromsø, Stavanger oder Bærum","Kristiansand, Skedsmo, Frogn, Lørenskog, Nordre Follo, Asker, Nesodden, Sola or Sandnes":"Kristiansand, Skedsmo, Frogn, Lørenskog, Nordre Follo, Asker, Nesodden, Sola oder Sandnes","Estimate monthly amount":"Schätzen Sie den monatlichen Betrag","Clear entries":"Einträge löschen","Enter the household’s monthly income basis, approved housing costs and composition.":"Geben Sie die monatliche Einkommensbasis, die genehmigten Wohnkosten und die Zusammensetzung des Haushalts ein.","Scenario calculated on this device. Husbanken decides actual cases.":"Szenario auf diesem Gerät berechnet. Husbanken entscheidet über konkrete Fälle.","Entries cleared.":"Einträge gelöscht.","Check the monthly amounts, household counts and municipality group.":"Überprüfen Sie die monatlichen Beträge, die Anzahl der Haushalte und die Gemeindegruppe.","Standard monthly scenario":"Standardmonatsszenario","Estimated monthly housing benefit":"Geschätztes monatliches Wohngeld","Monthly household income entered":"Monatliches Haushaltseinkommen eingegeben","Household income weight":"Gewicht des Haushaltseinkommens","Weighted monthly income":"Gewichtetes monatliches Einkommen","Estimated monthly own contribution":"Geschätzter monatlicher Eigenbeitrag","Approved housing costs entered":"Genehmigte Wohnkosten eingegeben","Monthly housing-cost cap":"Monatliche Wohnkostenobergrenze","Approved costs used after cap":"Genehmigte Kosten nach Obergrenze verwendet","Costs remaining after own contribution":"Verbleibende Kosten nach Eigenbeteiligung","Coverage rate":"Abdeckungsrate","Assumptions used":"Verwendete Annahmen","The standard contribution thresholds and housing-cost caps use Husbanken’s 2026 rates checked 17 October 2026.":"Die Standardbeitragsgrenzen und Wohnkostenobergrenzen basieren auf den 2026-Sätzen von Husbanken, geprüft 17 Oktober 2026.","Estimated benefit = max(0, approved costs after cap − own contribution) × 73.7%. Weighted income uses 1.00 for the first member, 0.13 for each additional member aged 18 or older and 0.15 for each additional member under 18.":"Geschätzter Nutzen = max(0, genehmigte Kosten nach Obergrenze − Eigenbeitrag) × 73.7 %. Das gewichtete Einkommen verwendet 1.00 für das erste Mitglied, 0.13 für jedes weitere Mitglied im Alter von 18 oder älter und 0.15 für jedes weitere Mitglied unter 18.","The entered income must already follow Husbanken’s income rules. Special thresholds, the separate household income ceiling, payout floor and personal eligibility are not calculated.":"Das eingegebene Einkommen muss bereits den Einkommensregeln von Husbanken entsprechen. Besondere Schwellenwerte, die separate Haushaltseinkommensobergrenze, die Auszahlungsuntergrenze und die persönliche Anspruchsberechtigung werden nicht berechnet.","Private, local calculation. No figures are uploaded or stored by this page.":"Private, lokale Berechnung. Von dieser Seite werden keine Zahlen hochgeladen oder gespeichert.","Husbanken: calculation":"Husbanken: Berechnung","Husbanken: income basis":"Husbanken: Einkommensbasis","Husbanken: 2026 own-contribution rates":"Husbanken: 2026 Eigenbeitragssätze","Husbanken: 2026 housing-cost caps":"Husbanken: 2026 Wohnkostenobergrenzen","Open Husbanken’s official calculator":"Öffnen Sie den offiziellen Rechner von Husbanken"},"el":{"Norway Housing Benefit Estimator":"Εκτιμητής στεγαστικών παροχών Νορβηγίας","Norway Housing Benefit Calculator 2026 — Monthly Scenario":"Υπολογιστής παροχών στέγασης Νορβηγίας 2026 — Μηνιαίο σενάριο","Estimate a standard monthly Norwegian housing-benefit scenario from the household income basis, approved housing costs, household size and municipality group. See the 2026 assumptions and continue to Husbanken for a current eligibility check.":"Υπολογίστε ένα τυπικό μηνιαίο νορβηγικό σενάριο παροχής στέγης με βάση το εισόδημα του νοικοκυριού, το εγκεκριμένο κόστος στέγασης, το μέγεθος του νοικοκυριού και την ομάδα δήμου. Δείτε τις υποθέσεις 2026 και συνεχίστε στο Husbanken για έναν τρέχοντα έλεγχο καταλληλότητας.","Use this private scenario to understand how Norway’s housing-benefit formula combines approved housing costs, weighted household income and the 2026 coverage rate. The interface language never changes the Norwegian rules.":"Χρησιμοποιήστε αυτό το ιδιωτικό σενάριο για να κατανοήσετε πώς ο τύπος στέγασης-παροχών της Νορβηγίας συνδυάζει το εγκεκριμένο κόστος στέγασης, το σταθμισμένο εισόδημα των νοικοκυριών και το ποσοστό κάλυψης 2026. Η γλώσσα διεπαφής δεν αλλάζει ποτέ τους νορβηγικούς κανόνες.","Calculations run in this browser. Entries are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"Οι υπολογισμοί εκτελούνται σε αυτό το πρόγραμμα περιήγησης. Οι καταχωρήσεις δεν αποστέλλονται σε διακομιστή ούτε αποθηκεύονται από αυτό το εργαλείο.","Example":"Παράδειγμα","For one household member with no income and NOK 8,000 in monthly approved housing costs, the 2026 standard own contribution is about NOK 2,215 per month. The estimated benefit is about NOK 4,032 after applying the 73.7% rate.":"Για ένα μέλος του νοικοκυριού χωρίς εισόδημα και NOK 8,000 σε μηνιαία εγκεκριμένα έξοδα στέγασης, η τυπική ίδια συνεισφορά 2026 είναι περίπου NOK 2,215 ανά μήνα. Το εκτιμώμενο όφελος είναι περίπου NOK 4,032 μετά την εφαρμογή του ποσοστού 73.7%.","How the scenario works":"Πώς λειτουργεί το σενάριο","The tool divides household income by the official household weight, calculates the standard own contribution from weighted annual income, limits approved housing costs by the household-size and municipality cap, subtracts the monthly own contribution and applies 73.7%.":"Το εργαλείο διαιρεί το εισόδημα του νοικοκυριού με το επίσημο βάρος του νοικοκυριού, υπολογίζει την τυπική ίδια συνεισφορά από το σταθμισμένο ετήσιο εισόδημα, περιορίζει το εγκεκριμένο κόστος στέγασης με βάση το μέγεθος του νοικοκυριού και το ανώτατο όριο του δήμου, αφαιρεί τη μηνιαία ίδια συνεισφορά και εφαρμόζει 73.7%.","Common questions":"Συνήθεις ερωτήσεις","Is this an official award or eligibility decision?":"Αποτελεί επίσημη απονομή ή απόφαση επιλεξιμότητας;","No. It is a standard-case scenario, not an application or decision. Husbanken’s official calculator applies current eligibility limits, personal rules and the month being checked.":"Αρ. Είναι ένα τυπικό σενάριο, όχι αίτηση ή απόφαση. Η επίσημη αριθμομηχανή της Husbanken εφαρμόζει τα τρέχοντα όρια καταλληλότητας, τους προσωπικούς κανόνες και τον μήνα που ελέγχεται.","What should I enter as household income?":"Τι πρέπει να καταχωρίσω ως εισόδημα νοικοκυριού;","Enter the monthly household income basis used by Husbanken before household weighting. It may include taxable monthly income, reportable annual income converted to a month, applicable wealth supplement and tax-free rental income. Children’s income and several named benefits are excluded. Check Husbanken’s income guidance.":"Εισαγάγετε τη βάση του μηνιαίου εισοδήματος του νοικοκυριού που χρησιμοποιείται από τη Husbanken πριν από τη στάθμιση του νοικοκυριού. Μπορεί να περιλαμβάνει φορολογητέο μηνιαίο εισόδημα, δηλωτέο ετήσιο εισόδημα που μετατρέπεται σε μήνα, ισχύον συμπλήρωμα περιουσίας και αφορολόγητο εισόδημα από ενοίκια. Το εισόδημα των παιδιών και πολλά επώνυμα επιδόματα εξαιρούνται. Ελέγξτε την καθοδήγηση εισοδήματος του Husbanken.","What counts as approved housing costs?":"Τι υπολογίζεται ως εγκεκριμένο κόστος στέγασης;\nΤο","Husbanken counts costs differently for renters, shared-cost housing and detached homes. Enter the amount already worked out under its current rules, not every housing bill. The result is still capped by household size and municipality.":"Το Husbanken υπολογίζει διαφορετικά τα κόστη για ενοικιαστές, στέγαση κοινόχρηστου κόστους και μονοκατοικίες. Εισαγάγετε το ποσό που έχει ήδη υπολογιστεί σύμφωνα με τους ισχύοντες κανόνες, όχι κάθε λογαριασμό στέγασης. Το αποτέλεσμα εξακολουθεί να καλύπτεται από το μέγεθος του νοικοκυριού και τον δήμο.","Does changing language change the rules?":"Η αλλαγή γλώσσας αλλάζει τους κανόνες;","No. This tool estimates a Norway-only 2026 scenario in every interface language.":"Αρ. Αυτό το εργαλείο υπολογίζει ένα σενάριο 2026 μόνο για τη Νορβηγία σε κάθε γλώσσα διεπαφής.","Scope and limits":"Εύρος και όρια","Norway only. This standard-case estimate does not decide eligibility or model the separate upper household-income limit, minimum payout, single old-age pensioner or young-disabled thresholds, special-adapted housing, transition rules, or every income and asset exception. The 2026 rates are static and must be rechecked against Husbanken. Use its official calculator for the month you are checking.":"Μόνο Νορβηγία. Αυτή η εκτίμηση τυπικής περίπτωσης δεν καθορίζει την καταλληλότητα ούτε μοντελοποιεί το ξεχωριστό ανώτατο όριο εισοδήματος του νοικοκυριού, την ελάχιστη πληρωμή, τα κατώφλια για άγαμο συνταξιούχο γήρατος ή νεαρά άτομα με αναπηρία, τη στέγαση με ειδική προσαρμογή, τους κανόνες μετάβασης ή κάθε εξαίρεση εισοδήματος και περιουσιακών στοιχείων. Τα επιτόκια 2026 είναι στατικά και πρέπει να επανελεγχθούν έναντι της Husbanken. Χρησιμοποιήστε την επίσημη αριθμομηχανή του για τον μήνα που ελέγχετε.","Estimate a standard monthly scenario":"Εκτιμήστε ένα τυπικό μηνιαίο σενάριο","Norwegian rules only · standard 2026 rates · checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country or rules.":"Μόνο για νορβηγικούς κανόνες · τυπικές τιμές 2026 · ελεγμένο 17 Οκτώβριος 2026 · η γλώσσα δεν αλλάζει τη χώρα ή τους κανόνες.","Monthly household income basis before weighting, NOK":"Μηνιαία βάση εισοδήματος νοικοκυριού πριν από τη στάθμιση, NOK","Use the gross monthly basis Husbanken applies, including any applicable wealth supplement and tax-free rental income. Exclude items Husbanken says do not count. See its income guide before relying on a result.":"Χρησιμοποιήστε την ακαθάριστη μηνιαία βάση που εφαρμόζει η Husbanken, συμπεριλαμβανομένου τυχόν ισχύοντος συμπληρώματος περιουσίας και αφορολόγητου εισοδήματος από ενοίκια. Εξαιρέστε τα στοιχεία που λέει ο Husbanken δεν υπολογίζονται. Δείτε τον οδηγό εισοδήματός του πριν βασιστείτε σε ένα αποτέλεσμα.","Monthly housing costs already approved under Husbanken rules, NOK":"Μηνιαίες δαπάνες στέγασης έχουν ήδη εγκριθεί σύμφωνα με τους κανόνες Husbanken, NOK","Do not add every housing bill. Approved costs differ for rental, shared-cost and detached housing; enter the monthly amount under current Husbanken rules. A household and municipality cap is applied below.":"Μην προσθέτετε κάθε λογαριασμό στέγασης. Το εγκεκριμένο κόστος διαφέρει για ενοικίαση, κοινόχρηστη και μονοκατοικία. εισαγάγετε το μηνιαίο ποσό σύμφωνα με τους ισχύοντες κανόνες Husbanken. Ακολουθεί όριο νοικοκυριού και δήμου.","Household members aged 18 or older":"Μέλη νοικοκυριού ηλικίας 18 ή μεγαλύτερα","Household members under 18":"Μέλη νοικοκυριού κάτω από 18","2026 municipality cap group":"2026 ομάδα κεφαλαίων δήμου","Other municipalities":"Άλλοι δήμοι","Oslo":"Όσλο","Bergen, Trondheim, Tromsø, Stavanger or Bærum":"Bergen, Trondheim, Tromsø, Stavanger ή Bærum","Kristiansand, Skedsmo, Frogn, Lørenskog, Nordre Follo, Asker, Nesodden, Sola or Sandnes":"Kristiansand, Skedsmo, Frogn, Lørenskog, Nordre Follo, Asker, Nesodden, Sola ή Sandnes","Estimate monthly amount":"Εκτιμήστε το μηνιαίο ποσό","Clear entries":"Διαγραφή καταχωρήσεων","Enter the household’s monthly income basis, approved housing costs and composition.":"Εισαγάγετε τη μηνιαία βάση εισοδήματος του νοικοκυριού, το εγκεκριμένο κόστος στέγασης και τη σύνθεση.","Scenario calculated on this device. Husbanken decides actual cases.":"Το σενάριο υπολογίζεται σε αυτήν τη συσκευή. Ο Husbanken αποφασίζει για τις πραγματικές υποθέσεις.","Entries cleared.":"Οι καταχωρήσεις διαγράφηκαν.","Check the monthly amounts, household counts and municipality group.":"Ελέγξτε τα μηνιαία ποσά, τον αριθμό των νοικοκυριών και την ομάδα δήμου.","Standard monthly scenario":"Τυπικό μηνιαίο σενάριο","Estimated monthly housing benefit":"Εκτιμώμενο μηνιαίο επίδομα στέγασης","Monthly household income entered":"Καταχωρίστηκε μηνιαίο εισόδημα νοικοκυριού","Household income weight":"Βάρος εισοδήματος νοικοκυριού","Weighted monthly income":"Σταθμισμένο μηνιαίο εισόδημα","Estimated monthly own contribution":"Εκτιμώμενη μηνιαία ίδια συνεισφορά","Approved housing costs entered":"Καταχωρίστηκε το εγκεκριμένο κόστος στέγασης","Monthly housing-cost cap":"Μηνιαίο ανώτατο όριο κόστους στέγασης","Approved costs used after cap":"Εγκεκριμένες δαπάνες που χρησιμοποιούνται μετά το όριο","Costs remaining after own contribution":"Κόστος που απομένει μετά την ίδια συνεισφορά","Coverage rate":"Ποσοστό κάλυψης","Assumptions used":"Υποθέσεις που χρησιμοποιούνται","The standard contribution thresholds and housing-cost caps use Husbanken’s 2026 rates checked 17 October 2026.":"Τα τυπικά όρια συνεισφοράς και τα ανώτατα όρια κόστους στέγασης χρησιμοποιούν τα επιτόκια 2026 της Husbanken που ελέγχθηκαν 17 Οκτώβριος 2026.","Estimated benefit = max(0, approved costs after cap − own contribution) × 73.7%. Weighted income uses 1.00 for the first member, 0.13 for each additional member aged 18 or older and 0.15 for each additional member under 18.":"Εκτιμώμενο όφελος = μέγ.(0, εγκεκριμένο κόστος μετά το ανώτατο όριο − ίδια συνεισφορά) × 73.7%. Το σταθμισμένο εισόδημα χρησιμοποιεί 1.00 για το πρώτο μέλος, 0.13 για κάθε επιπλέον μέλος ηλικίας 18 ή μεγαλύτερο και 0.15 για κάθε επιπλέον μέλος κάτω από το 18.","The entered income must already follow Husbanken’s income rules. Special thresholds, the separate household income ceiling, payout floor and personal eligibility are not calculated.":"Το εισαγόμενο εισόδημα πρέπει ήδη να ακολουθεί τους εισοδηματικούς κανόνες της Husbanken. Δεν υπολογίζονται τα ειδικά κατώτατα όρια, το χωριστό ανώτατο όριο εισοδήματος του νοικοκυριού, το κατώτατο όριο πληρωμών και η προσωπική καταλληλότητα.","Private, local calculation. No figures are uploaded or stored by this page.":"Ιδιωτικός, τοπικός υπολογισμός. Δεν μεταφορτώνονται ή αποθηκεύονται αριθμοί από αυτήν τη σελίδα.","Husbanken: calculation":"Husbanken: υπολογισμός","Husbanken: income basis":"Husbanken: βάση εισοδήματος","Husbanken: 2026 own-contribution rates":"Husbanken: 2026 ποσοστά ίδιας συνεισφοράς","Husbanken: 2026 housing-cost caps":"Husbanken: 2026 ανώτατα όρια κόστους στέγασης","Open Husbanken’s official calculator":"Ανοίξτε την επίσημη αριθμομηχανή της Husbanken"},"es":{"Norway Housing Benefit Estimator":"Estimador de beneficios de vivienda en Noruega","Norway Housing Benefit Calculator 2026 — Monthly Scenario":"Calculadora de beneficios de vivienda de Noruega 2026 — Escenario mensual","Estimate a standard monthly Norwegian housing-benefit scenario from the household income basis, approved housing costs, household size and municipality group. See the 2026 assumptions and continue to Husbanken for a current eligibility check.":"Estime un escenario estándar mensual de beneficios de vivienda noruegos a partir de la base de ingresos del hogar, los costos de vivienda aprobados, el tamaño del hogar y el grupo municipal. Consulte los supuestos 2026 y continúe hasta Husbanken para realizar una verificación de elegibilidad actual.","Use this private scenario to understand how Norway’s housing-benefit formula combines approved housing costs, weighted household income and the 2026 coverage rate. The interface language never changes the Norwegian rules.":"Utilice este escenario privado para comprender cómo la fórmula de beneficios de vivienda de Noruega combina los costos de vivienda aprobados, el ingreso familiar ponderado y la tasa de cobertura 2026. El idioma de la interfaz nunca cambia las reglas noruegas.","Calculations run in this browser. Entries are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"Los cálculos se ejecutan en este navegador. Esta herramienta no envía las entradas a un servidor ni las guarda.","Example":"Ejemplo","For one household member with no income and NOK 8,000 in monthly approved housing costs, the 2026 standard own contribution is about NOK 2,215 per month. The estimated benefit is about NOK 4,032 after applying the 73.7% rate.":"Para un miembro del hogar sin ingresos y NOK 8,000 en costos de vivienda mensuales aprobados, la contribución propia estándar 2026 es de aproximadamente NOK 2,215 por mes. El beneficio estimado es de aproximadamente NOK 4,032 después de aplicar la tasa 73.7%.","How the scenario works":"Cómo funciona el escenario","The tool divides household income by the official household weight, calculates the standard own contribution from weighted annual income, limits approved housing costs by the household-size and municipality cap, subtracts the monthly own contribution and applies 73.7%.":"La herramienta divide los ingresos del hogar por la ponderación oficial del hogar, calcula la contribución propia estándar a partir del ingreso anual ponderado, limita los costos de vivienda aprobados por el tamaño del hogar y el límite municipal, resta la contribución propia mensual y aplica 73.7%.","Common questions":"Preguntas comunes","Is this an official award or eligibility decision?":"¿Es este un premio oficial o una decisión de elegibilidad?","No. It is a standard-case scenario, not an application or decision. Husbanken’s official calculator applies current eligibility limits, personal rules and the month being checked.":"No. Es un escenario de caso estándar, no una solicitud o decisión. La calculadora oficial de Husbanken aplica los límites de elegibilidad actuales, las reglas personales y el mes que se verifica.","What should I enter as household income?":"¿Qué debo ingresar como ingreso del hogar?","Enter the monthly household income basis used by Husbanken before household weighting. It may include taxable monthly income, reportable annual income converted to a month, applicable wealth supplement and tax-free rental income. Children’s income and several named benefits are excluded. Check Husbanken’s income guidance.":"Ingrese la base de ingresos mensuales del hogar utilizada por Husbanken antes de la ponderación del hogar. Puede incluir ingresos mensuales sujetos a impuestos, ingresos anuales declarables convertidos a un mes, suplemento patrimonial aplicable e ingresos por alquileres libres de impuestos. Se excluyen los ingresos de los niños y varios beneficios nombrados. Consulte la orientación de ingresos de Husbanken.","What counts as approved housing costs?":"¿Qué cuenta como costos de vivienda aprobados?","Husbanken counts costs differently for renters, shared-cost housing and detached homes. Enter the amount already worked out under its current rules, not every housing bill. The result is still capped by household size and municipality.":"Husbanken cuenta los costos de manera diferente para inquilinos, viviendas de costos compartidos y viviendas independientes. Ingrese la cantidad ya calculada según las reglas actuales, no todas las facturas de vivienda. El resultado todavía está limitado por el tamaño del hogar y el municipio.","Does changing language change the rules?":"¿Cambiar el idioma cambia las reglas?","No. This tool estimates a Norway-only 2026 scenario in every interface language.":"No. Esta herramienta estima un escenario 2026 exclusivo de Noruega en cada idioma de interfaz.","Scope and limits":"Alcance y límites","Norway only. This standard-case estimate does not decide eligibility or model the separate upper household-income limit, minimum payout, single old-age pensioner or young-disabled thresholds, special-adapted housing, transition rules, or every income and asset exception. The 2026 rates are static and must be rechecked against Husbanken. Use its official calculator for the month you are checking.":"Solo Noruega. Esta estimación de caso estándar no decide la elegibilidad ni modela el límite superior de ingresos del hogar por separado, el pago mínimo, los umbrales para jubilados solteros o jóvenes discapacitados, viviendas especialmente adaptadas, reglas de transición o todas las excepciones de ingresos y activos. Las tasas 2026 son estáticas y deben cotejarse nuevamente con Husbanken. Utilice su calculadora oficial para el mes que esté consultando.","Estimate a standard monthly scenario":"Estimar un escenario mensual estándar","Norwegian rules only · standard 2026 rates · checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country or rules.":"Solo reglas noruegas · tarifas estándar 2026 · revisado 17 octubre 2026 · el idioma no cambia el país ni las reglas.","Monthly household income basis before weighting, NOK":"Base de ingresos mensuales del hogar antes de ponderación, NOK","Use the gross monthly basis Husbanken applies, including any applicable wealth supplement and tax-free rental income. Exclude items Husbanken says do not count. See its income guide before relying on a result.":"Utilice la base mensual bruta que aplica Husbanken, incluido cualquier complemento patrimonial aplicable y los ingresos por alquiler libres de impuestos. Excluya los artículos que Husbanken dice que no cuentan. Consulte su guía de ingresos antes de confiar en un resultado.","Monthly housing costs already approved under Husbanken rules, NOK":"Costos mensuales de vivienda ya aprobados según las reglas de Husbanken, NOK","Do not add every housing bill. Approved costs differ for rental, shared-cost and detached housing; enter the monthly amount under current Husbanken rules. A household and municipality cap is applied below.":"No agregue todas las facturas de vivienda. Los costos aprobados difieren para alquiler, costo compartido y vivienda independiente; introduzca el importe mensual según las normas actuales de Husbanken. A continuación se aplica un límite de hogar y municipio.","Household members aged 18 or older":"Miembros del hogar de edad 18 o más","Household members under 18":"Miembros del hogar bajo 18","2026 municipality cap group":"2026 grupo de límites de municipio","Other municipalities":"Otros municipios","Oslo":"Oslo","Bergen, Trondheim, Tromsø, Stavanger or Bærum":"Bergen, Trondheim, Tromsø, Stavanger o Bærum","Kristiansand, Skedsmo, Frogn, Lørenskog, Nordre Follo, Asker, Nesodden, Sola or Sandnes":"Kristiansand, Skedsmo, Frogn, Lørenskog, Nordre Follo, Asker, Nesodden, Sola o Sandnes","Estimate monthly amount":"Monto mensual estimado","Clear entries":"Borrar entradas","Enter the household’s monthly income basis, approved housing costs and composition.":"Ingrese la base de ingresos mensuales del hogar, los costos de vivienda aprobados y la composición.","Scenario calculated on this device. Husbanken decides actual cases.":"Escenario calculado en este dispositivo. Husbanken decide casos reales.","Entries cleared.":"Entradas borradas.","Check the monthly amounts, household counts and municipality group.":"Consulta los montos mensuales, conteo de hogares y grupo de municipios.","Standard monthly scenario":"Escenario mensual estándar","Estimated monthly housing benefit":"Beneficio de vivienda mensual estimado","Monthly household income entered":"Ingreso mensual del hogar ingresado","Household income weight":"Peso de ingresos del hogar","Weighted monthly income":"Ingreso mensual ponderado","Estimated monthly own contribution":"Contribución propia mensual estimada","Approved housing costs entered":"Costos de vivienda aprobados ingresados","Monthly housing-cost cap":"Límite mensual del coste de la vivienda","Approved costs used after cap":"Costos aprobados utilizados después del límite","Costs remaining after own contribution":"Costes restantes después de la contribución propia","Coverage rate":"Tasa de cobertura","Assumptions used":"Supuestos utilizados","The standard contribution thresholds and housing-cost caps use Husbanken’s 2026 rates checked 17 October 2026.":"Los umbrales de contribución estándar y los topes de costos de vivienda utilizan las tasas 2026 de Husbanken verificadas 17 Octubre 2026.","Estimated benefit = max(0, approved costs after cap − own contribution) × 73.7%. Weighted income uses 1.00 for the first member, 0.13 for each additional member aged 18 or older and 0.15 for each additional member under 18.":"Beneficio estimado = max(0, costos aprobados después del límite − contribución propia) × 73.7%. Los ingresos ponderados utilizan 1.00 para el primer miembro, 0.13 para cada miembro adicional de edad 18 o mayor y 0.15 para cada miembro adicional bajo 18.","The entered income must already follow Husbanken’s income rules. Special thresholds, the separate household income ceiling, payout floor and personal eligibility are not calculated.":"Los ingresos ingresados ​​ya deben seguir las reglas de ingresos de Husbanken. No se calculan los umbrales especiales, el techo de ingresos del hogar separado, el piso de pago ni la elegibilidad personal.","Private, local calculation. No figures are uploaded or stored by this page.":"Cálculo local privado. Esta página no carga ni almacena cifras.","Husbanken: calculation":"Husbanken: cálculo","Husbanken: income basis":"Husbanken: base de ingresos","Husbanken: 2026 own-contribution rates":"Husbanken: 2026 tasas de contribución propia","Husbanken: 2026 housing-cost caps":"Husbanken: 2026 límites de costos de vivienda","Open Husbanken’s official calculator":"Abrir la calculadora oficial de Husbanken"},"fa":{"Norway Housing Benefit Estimator":"برآورنده مزایای مسکن نروژ","Norway Housing Benefit Calculator 2026 — Monthly Scenario":"ماشین حساب مزایای مسکن نروژ 2026 — سناریوی ماهانه","Estimate a standard monthly Norwegian housing-benefit scenario from the household income basis, approved housing costs, household size and municipality group. See the 2026 assumptions and continue to Husbanken for a current eligibility check.":"سناریوی استاندارد ماهانه مزایای مسکن نروژی را بر اساس درآمد خانوار، هزینه های مسکن تایید شده، اندازه خانوار و گروه شهرداری تخمین بزنید. مفروضات 2026 را ببینید و برای بررسی صلاحیت فعلی به Husbanken بروید.","Use this private scenario to understand how Norway’s housing-benefit formula combines approved housing costs, weighted household income and the 2026 coverage rate. The interface language never changes the Norwegian rules.":"از این سناریوی خصوصی برای درک اینکه چگونه فرمول سود مسکن نروژ هزینه های مسکن تایید شده، درآمد وزنی خانوار و نرخ پوشش 2026 را ترکیب می کند، استفاده کنید. زبان رابط هرگز قوانین نروژی را تغییر نمی دهد.","Calculations run in this browser. Entries are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"محاسبات در این مرورگر اجرا می شود. ورودی ها به سرور ارسال نمی شوند یا توسط این ابزار ذخیره نمی شوند.","Example":"مثال","For one household member with no income and NOK 8,000 in monthly approved housing costs, the 2026 standard own contribution is about NOK 2,215 per month. The estimated benefit is about NOK 4,032 after applying the 73.7% rate.":"برای یک عضو خانوار بدون درآمد و NOK 8,000 در هزینه های مسکن مصوب ماهانه، سهم خود استاندارد 2026 حدود NOK 2,215 در ماه است. سود تخمینی پس از اعمال نرخ 73.7 در حدود NOK 4,032 است.","How the scenario works":"چگونه سناریو کار می کند","The tool divides household income by the official household weight, calculates the standard own contribution from weighted annual income, limits approved housing costs by the household-size and municipality cap, subtracts the monthly own contribution and applies 73.7%.":"این ابزار درآمد خانوار را بر وزن رسمی خانوار تقسیم می‌کند، سهم استاندارد خود را از درآمد موزون سالانه محاسبه می‌کند، هزینه‌های مسکن مصوب را با اندازه خانوار و سقف شهرداری محدود می‌کند، سهم ماهانه خود را کم می‌کند و 73.7٪ را اعمال می‌کند.","Common questions":"سوالات رایج","Is this an official award or eligibility decision?":"آیا این یک جایزه رسمی یا تصمیم واجد شرایط بودن است؟","No. It is a standard-case scenario, not an application or decision. Husbanken’s official calculator applies current eligibility limits, personal rules and the month being checked.":"شماره. این یک سناریوی موردی استاندارد است، نه یک درخواست یا تصمیم. ماشین حساب رسمی Husbanken محدودیت های فعلی واجد شرایط بودن، قوانین شخصی و ماه مورد بررسی را اعمال می کند.","What should I enter as household income?":"چه چیزی را به عنوان درآمد خانوار وارد کنم؟","Enter the monthly household income basis used by Husbanken before household weighting. It may include taxable monthly income, reportable annual income converted to a month, applicable wealth supplement and tax-free rental income. Children’s income and several named benefits are excluded. Check Husbanken’s income guidance.":"مبنای درآمد ماهانه خانوار مورد استفاده توسط Husbanken را قبل از وزن دهی خانوار وارد کنید. ممکن است شامل درآمد ماهانه مشمول مالیات، درآمد سالانه قابل گزارش تبدیل به یک ماه، مکمل دارایی قابل اجرا و درآمد اجاره بدون مالیات باشد. درآمد فرزندان و چندین مزیت نام برده مستثنی شده است. راهنمای درآمد Husbanken را بررسی کنید.","What counts as approved housing costs?":"چه چیزی به عنوان هزینه های مسکن تایید شده به حساب می آید؟","Husbanken counts costs differently for renters, shared-cost housing and detached homes. Enter the amount already worked out under its current rules, not every housing bill. The result is still capped by household size and municipality.":"Husbanken هزینه‌های متفاوتی را برای اجاره‌کنندگان، مسکن با هزینه مشترک و خانه‌های مجزا محاسبه می‌کند. مبلغی را که قبلاً طبق قوانین فعلی آن محاسبه شده است، وارد کنید، نه هر قبض مسکن. نتیجه هنوز با اندازه خانوار و شهرداری محدود است.","Does changing language change the rules?":"آیا تغییر زبان قوانین را تغییر می‌دهد؟","No. This tool estimates a Norway-only 2026 scenario in every interface language.":"شماره. این ابزار یک سناریوی 2026 فقط برای نروژ را در هر زبان رابط تخمین می‌زند.","Scope and limits":"دامنه و محدودیت ها","Norway only. This standard-case estimate does not decide eligibility or model the separate upper household-income limit, minimum payout, single old-age pensioner or young-disabled thresholds, special-adapted housing, transition rules, or every income and asset exception. The 2026 rates are static and must be rechecked against Husbanken. Use its official calculator for the month you are checking.":"فقط نروژ. این تخمین موردی استاندارد واجد شرایط بودن را تعیین نمی‌کند یا حد بالای درآمد خانوار، حداقل پرداخت، آستانه‌های بازنشستگی مجرد یا معلولان جوان، مسکن ویژه، قوانین انتقال، یا هر استثنای درآمد و دارایی را مدل‌سازی نمی‌کند. نرخ‌های 2026 ثابت هستند و باید با Husbanken دوباره بررسی شوند. از ماشین حساب رسمی آن برای ماه مورد بررسی استفاده کنید.","Estimate a standard monthly scenario":"یک سناریوی استاندارد ماهانه را تخمین بزنید","Norwegian rules only · standard 2026 rates · checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country or rules.":"فقط قوانین نروژی · نرخ استاندارد 2026 · بررسی 17 اکتبر 2026 · زبان کشور یا قوانین را تغییر نمی دهد.","Monthly household income basis before weighting, NOK":"مبنای درآمد ماهانه خانوار قبل از وزن دهی، NOK","Use the gross monthly basis Husbanken applies, including any applicable wealth supplement and tax-free rental income. Exclude items Husbanken says do not count. See its income guide before relying on a result.":"از مبنای ناخالص ماهانه که Husbanken اعمال می‌کند، استفاده کنید، از جمله هرگونه مکمل دارایی قابل اعمال و درآمد اجاره بدون مالیات. مواردی را که هاسبانکن می گوید به حساب نمی آیند حذف کنید. قبل از تکیه بر نتیجه، راهنمای درآمد آن را ببینید.","Monthly housing costs already approved under Husbanken rules, NOK":"هزینه‌های ماهانه مسکن که قبلاً تحت قوانین Husbanken تأیید شده است، NOK","Do not add every housing bill. Approved costs differ for rental, shared-cost and detached housing; enter the monthly amount under current Husbanken rules. A household and municipality cap is applied below.":"هر قبض مسکن را اضافه نکنید. هزینه های تایید شده برای اجاره، هزینه مشترک و مسکن مجزا متفاوت است. مبلغ ماهانه را تحت قوانین فعلی Husbanken وارد کنید. سقف خانوار و شهرداری در زیر اعمال می شود.","Household members aged 18 or older":"اعضای خانوار 18 یا بزرگتر","Household members under 18":"اعضای خانوار تحت 18\nگروه کلاهک شهرداری","2026 municipality cap group":"2026","Other municipalities":"شهرداری های دیگر","Oslo":"اسلو","Bergen, Trondheim, Tromsø, Stavanger or Bærum":"برگن، تروندهایم، ترومسو، استاوانگر یا باروم","Kristiansand, Skedsmo, Frogn, Lørenskog, Nordre Follo, Asker, Nesodden, Sola or Sandnes":"Kristiansand، Skedsmo، Frogn، Lørenskog، Nordre Follo، Asker، Nesodden، Sola یا Sandnes","Estimate monthly amount":"مبلغ ماهانه را برآورد کنید","Clear entries":"پاک کردن ورودی ها","Enter the household’s monthly income basis, approved housing costs and composition.":"مبنای درآمد ماهانه خانوار، هزینه های مسکن تایید شده و ترکیب را وارد کنید.","Scenario calculated on this device. Husbanken decides actual cases.":"سناریو بر روی این دستگاه محاسبه شده است. Husbanken در مورد پرونده های واقعی تصمیم گیری می کند.","Entries cleared.":"ورودی ها پاک شدند.","Check the monthly amounts, household counts and municipality group.":"مقدار ماهانه، تعداد خانوار و گروه شهرداری را بررسی کنید.","Standard monthly scenario":"سناریوی استاندارد ماهانه","Estimated monthly housing benefit":"مزایای مسکن ماهانه تخمینی","Monthly household income entered":"درآمد ماهانه خانوار وارد شده است","Household income weight":"وزن درآمد خانوار","Weighted monthly income":"درآمد ماهانه وزنی","Estimated monthly own contribution":"کمک مالی تخمینی ماهانه","Approved housing costs entered":"هزینه های مسکن مصوب وارد شد","Monthly housing-cost cap":"سقف هزینه مسکن ماهانه","Approved costs used after cap":"هزینه های تایید شده پس از سقف استفاده می شود","Costs remaining after own contribution":"هزینه های باقی مانده پس از مشارکت شخصی","Coverage rate":"نرخ پوشش","Assumptions used":"فرض های مورد استفاده","The standard contribution thresholds and housing-cost caps use Husbanken’s 2026 rates checked 17 October 2026.":"آستانه های استاندارد مشارکت و سقف هزینه مسکن از نرخ های 2026 Husbanken استفاده می کند که 17 اکتبر 2026 بررسی شده است.","Estimated benefit = max(0, approved costs after cap − own contribution) × 73.7%. Weighted income uses 1.00 for the first member, 0.13 for each additional member aged 18 or older and 0.15 for each additional member under 18.":"مزایای تخمینی = حداکثر (0، هزینه‌های تایید شده پس از سقف - سهم خود) × 73.7%. درآمد وزنی از 1.00 برای اولین عضو، 0.13 برای هر عضو اضافی با سن 18 یا بزرگتر و 0.15 برای هر عضو اضافی زیر 18 استفاده می کند.","The entered income must already follow Husbanken’s income rules. Special thresholds, the separate household income ceiling, payout floor and personal eligibility are not calculated.":"درآمد وارد شده باید قبلاً از قوانین درآمدی Husbanken پیروی کند. آستانه های ویژه، سقف درآمد جداگانه خانوار، کف پرداخت و صلاحیت شخصی محاسبه نمی شود.","Private, local calculation. No figures are uploaded or stored by this page.":"محاسبه خصوصی، محلی. هیچ رقمی توسط این صفحه آپلود یا ذخیره نمی شود.","Husbanken: calculation":"Husbanken: محاسبه","Husbanken: income basis":"Husbanken: مبنای درآمد","Husbanken: 2026 own-contribution rates":"Husbanken: 2026 نرخ مشارکت شخصی","Husbanken: 2026 housing-cost caps":"Husbanken: 2026 سقف هزینه مسکن","Open Husbanken’s official calculator":"ماشین حساب رسمی Husbanken را باز کنید"},"fr":{"Norway Housing Benefit Estimator":"Estimateur des allocations de logement en Norvège","Norway Housing Benefit Calculator 2026 — Monthly Scenario":"Calculateur d'allocations de logement en Norvège 2026 — Scénario mensuel","Estimate a standard monthly Norwegian housing-benefit scenario from the household income basis, approved housing costs, household size and municipality group. See the 2026 assumptions and continue to Husbanken for a current eligibility check.":"Estimez un scénario mensuel standard d'aide au logement en Norvège à partir du revenu du ménage, des coûts de logement approuvés, de la taille du ménage et du groupe de municipalités. Consultez les hypothèses 2026 et continuez vers Husbanken pour un contrôle d'éligibilité actuel.","Use this private scenario to understand how Norway’s housing-benefit formula combines approved housing costs, weighted household income and the 2026 coverage rate. The interface language never changes the Norwegian rules.":"Utilisez ce scénario privé pour comprendre comment la formule norvégienne d'allocation de logement combine les coûts de logement approuvés, le revenu pondéré du ménage et le taux de couverture 2026. La langue de l'interface ne change jamais les règles norvégiennes.","Calculations run in this browser. Entries are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"Les calculs sont exécutés dans ce navigateur. Les entrées ne sont pas envoyées à un serveur ni enregistrées par cet outil.","Example":"Exemple","For one household member with no income and NOK 8,000 in monthly approved housing costs, the 2026 standard own contribution is about NOK 2,215 per month. The estimated benefit is about NOK 4,032 after applying the 73.7% rate.":"Pour un membre du ménage sans revenu et avec un 8,000 NOK de frais de logement mensuels approuvés, la contribution propre standard 2026 est d'environ 2,215 NOK par mois. Le bénéfice estimé est d’environ NOK 4,032 après application du taux 73.7%.","How the scenario works":"Fonctionnement du scénario","The tool divides household income by the official household weight, calculates the standard own contribution from weighted annual income, limits approved housing costs by the household-size and municipality cap, subtracts the monthly own contribution and applies 73.7%.":"L'outil divise le revenu du ménage par le poids officiel du ménage, calcule la contribution propre standard à partir du revenu annuel pondéré, limite les coûts de logement approuvés en fonction de la taille du ménage et du plafond de la commune, soustrait la contribution propre mensuelle et applique 73.7%.","Common questions":"Questions courantes","Is this an official award or eligibility decision?":"S'agit-il d'une récompense officielle ou d'une décision d'éligibilité ?","No. It is a standard-case scenario, not an application or decision. Husbanken’s official calculator applies current eligibility limits, personal rules and the month being checked.":"Non. Il s’agit d’un scénario standard, et non d’une demande ou d’une décision. Le calculateur officiel de Husbanken applique les limites d’éligibilité actuelles, les règles personnelles et le mois vérifié.","What should I enter as household income?":"Que dois-je saisir comme revenu du ménage ?","Enter the monthly household income basis used by Husbanken before household weighting. It may include taxable monthly income, reportable annual income converted to a month, applicable wealth supplement and tax-free rental income. Children’s income and several named benefits are excluded. Check Husbanken’s income guidance.":"Entrez la base de revenu mensuel du ménage utilisée par Husbanken avant la pondération des ménages. Il peut comprendre un revenu mensuel imposable, un revenu annuel déclarable converti en mois, un supplément de patrimoine applicable et des revenus de location exonérés d'impôt. Le revenu des enfants et plusieurs prestations désignées sont exclus. Consultez les prévisions de revenus de Husbanken.","What counts as approved housing costs?":"Qu'est-ce qui compte comme frais de logement approuvés ?","Husbanken counts costs differently for renters, shared-cost housing and detached homes. Enter the amount already worked out under its current rules, not every housing bill. The result is still capped by household size and municipality.":"Husbanken compte les coûts différemment pour les locataires, les logements à frais partagés et les maisons individuelles. Entrez le montant déjà calculé selon ses règles actuelles, pas chaque facture de logement. Le résultat est toujours plafonné par la taille du ménage et la commune.","Does changing language change the rules?":"Changer de langue change-t-il les règles ?","No. This tool estimates a Norway-only 2026 scenario in every interface language.":"Non. Cet outil estime un scénario 2026 réservé à la Norvège dans chaque langue de l'interface.","Scope and limits":"Portée et limites","Norway only. This standard-case estimate does not decide eligibility or model the separate upper household-income limit, minimum payout, single old-age pensioner or young-disabled thresholds, special-adapted housing, transition rules, or every income and asset exception. The 2026 rates are static and must be rechecked against Husbanken. Use its official calculator for the month you are checking.":"Norvège uniquement. Cette estimation du cas standard ne détermine pas l’éligibilité ni ne modélise le plafond supérieur distinct du revenu des ménages, le versement minimum, les seuils de retraités célibataires ou de jeunes handicapés, les logements spécialement adaptés, les règles de transition ou toute exception en matière de revenu et de patrimoine. Les taux 2026 sont statiques et doivent être revérifiés par rapport à Husbanken. Utilisez sa calculatrice officielle pour le mois que vous vérifiez.","Estimate a standard monthly scenario":"Estimer un scénario mensuel standard","Norwegian rules only · standard 2026 rates · checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country or rules.":"Règles norvégiennes uniquement · Tarifs standard 2026 · vérifié 17 octobre 2026 · la langue ne modifie pas le pays ni les règles.","Monthly household income basis before weighting, NOK":"Base de revenu mensuel des ménages avant pondération, NOK","Use the gross monthly basis Husbanken applies, including any applicable wealth supplement and tax-free rental income. Exclude items Husbanken says do not count. See its income guide before relying on a result.":"Utilisez la base mensuelle brute appliquée par Husbanken, y compris tout supplément de patrimoine applicable et les revenus de location exonérés d'impôt. Exclure les éléments que Husbanken dit ne pas compter. Consultez son guide des revenus avant de vous fier à un résultat.","Monthly housing costs already approved under Husbanken rules, NOK":"Frais de logement mensuels déjà approuvés selon les règles de Husbanken, NOK","Do not add every housing bill. Approved costs differ for rental, shared-cost and detached housing; enter the monthly amount under current Husbanken rules. A household and municipality cap is applied below.":"N'ajoutez pas toutes les factures de logement. Les coûts approuvés diffèrent pour les logements locatifs, à frais partagés et individuels ; saisissez le montant mensuel selon les règles actuelles de Husbanken. Un plafond par ménage et commune est appliqué ci-dessous.","Household members aged 18 or older":"Membres du ménage âgés de 18 ou plus","Household members under 18":"Membres du ménage sous 18","2026 municipality cap group":"2026 groupe de casquettes de municipalité","Other municipalities":"Autres communes","Oslo":"Oslo","Bergen, Trondheim, Tromsø, Stavanger or Bærum":"Bergen, Trondheim, Tromsø, Stavanger ou Bærum","Kristiansand, Skedsmo, Frogn, Lørenskog, Nordre Follo, Asker, Nesodden, Sola or Sandnes":"Kristiansand, Skedsmo, Frogn, Lørenskog, Nordre Follo, Asker, Nesodden, Sola ou Sandnes","Estimate monthly amount":"Montant mensuel estimé","Clear entries":"Effacer les entrées","Enter the household’s monthly income basis, approved housing costs and composition.":"Saisissez la base de revenu mensuel du ménage, les frais de logement approuvés et la composition.","Scenario calculated on this device. Husbanken decides actual cases.":"Scénario calculé sur cet appareil. Husbanken tranche les cas concrets.","Entries cleared.":"Entrées effacées.","Check the monthly amounts, household counts and municipality group.":"Vérifiez les montants mensuels, le nombre de ménages et le groupe de communes.","Standard monthly scenario":"Scénario mensuel standard","Estimated monthly housing benefit":"Allocation de logement mensuelle estimée","Monthly household income entered":"Revenu mensuel du ménage saisi","Household income weight":"Pondération du revenu des ménages","Weighted monthly income":"Revenu mensuel pondéré","Estimated monthly own contribution":"Contribution propre mensuelle estimée","Approved housing costs entered":"Frais de logement approuvés saisis","Monthly housing-cost cap":"Plafond mensuel des frais de logement","Approved costs used after cap":"Coûts approuvés utilisés après le plafond","Costs remaining after own contribution":"Frais restants après contribution propre","Coverage rate":"Taux de couverture","Assumptions used":"Hypothèses utilisées","The standard contribution thresholds and housing-cost caps use Husbanken’s 2026 rates checked 17 October 2026.":"Les seuils de contribution standard et les plafonds de frais de logement utilisent les taux 2026 de Husbanken vérifiés 17 octobre 2026.","Estimated benefit = max(0, approved costs after cap − own contribution) × 73.7%. Weighted income uses 1.00 for the first member, 0.13 for each additional member aged 18 or older and 0.15 for each additional member under 18.":"Bénéfice estimé = max(0, coûts approuvés après plafond − contribution propre) × 73.7%. Le revenu pondéré utilise 1.00 pour le premier membre, 0.13 pour chaque membre supplémentaire âgé de 18 ou plus et 0.15 pour chaque membre supplémentaire sous 18.","The entered income must already follow Husbanken’s income rules. Special thresholds, the separate household income ceiling, payout floor and personal eligibility are not calculated.":"Les revenus saisis doivent déjà respecter les règles de revenus de Husbanken. Les seuils spéciaux, le plafond de revenu distinct des ménages, le plancher de versement et l'éligibilité personnelle ne sont pas calculés.","Private, local calculation. No figures are uploaded or stored by this page.":"Calcul privé et local. Aucun chiffre n'est téléchargé ou stocké par cette page.","Husbanken: calculation":"Husbanken : calcul","Husbanken: income basis":"Husbanken : base de revenu","Husbanken: 2026 own-contribution rates":"Husbanken : taux de contribution propre 2026","Husbanken: 2026 housing-cost caps":"Husbanken : plafonds de coût du logement 2026","Open Husbanken’s official calculator":"Ouvrir la calculatrice officielle de Husbanken"},"gu":{"Norway Housing Benefit Estimator":"નોર્વે હાઉસિંગ બેનિફિટ એસ્ટીમેટર","Norway Housing Benefit Calculator 2026 — Monthly Scenario":"નોર્વે હાઉસિંગ બેનિફિટ કેલ્ક્યુલેટર 2026 — માસિક દૃશ્ય","Estimate a standard monthly Norwegian housing-benefit scenario from the household income basis, approved housing costs, household size and municipality group. See the 2026 assumptions and continue to Husbanken for a current eligibility check.":"પારિવારિક આવકના આધારે, મંજૂર હાઉસિંગ ખર્ચ, ઘરનું કદ અને મ્યુનિસિપાલિટી જૂથ પરથી પ્રમાણભૂત માસિક નોર્વેજીયન હાઉસિંગ-બેનિફિટ દૃશ્યનો અંદાજ કાઢો. 2026 ધારણાઓ જુઓ અને વર્તમાન પાત્રતા તપાસ માટે Husbanken પર ચાલુ રાખો.","Use this private scenario to understand how Norway’s housing-benefit formula combines approved housing costs, weighted household income and the 2026 coverage rate. The interface language never changes the Norwegian rules.":"નોર્વેના હાઉસિંગ-બેનિફિટ ફોર્મ્યુલામાં મંજૂર હાઉસિંગ ખર્ચ, ભારિત ઘરની આવક અને 2026 કવરેજ રેટ કેવી રીતે જોડાય છે તે સમજવા માટે આ ખાનગી દૃશ્યનો ઉપયોગ કરો. ઇન્ટરફેસ ભાષા ક્યારેય નોર્વેજીયન નિયમોમાં ફેરફાર કરતી નથી.","Calculations run in this browser. Entries are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"આ બ્રાઉઝરમાં ગણતરીઓ ચાલે છે. એન્ટ્રીઓ સર્વર પર મોકલવામાં આવતી નથી અથવા આ સાધન દ્વારા સાચવવામાં આવતી નથી.","Example":"ઉદાહરણ","For one household member with no income and NOK 8,000 in monthly approved housing costs, the 2026 standard own contribution is about NOK 2,215 per month. The estimated benefit is about NOK 4,032 after applying the 73.7% rate.":"આવક વગરના એક ઘરના સભ્ય અને માસિક મંજૂર હાઉસિંગ ખર્ચમાં NOK 8,000 માટે, 2026 માનક પોતાનું યોગદાન દર મહિને NOK 2,215 જેટલું છે. 73.7% દર લાગુ કર્યા પછી અંદાજિત લાભ લગભગ NOK 4,032 છે.","How the scenario works":"પરિદ્રશ્ય કેવી રીતે કામ કરે છે","The tool divides household income by the official household weight, calculates the standard own contribution from weighted annual income, limits approved housing costs by the household-size and municipality cap, subtracts the monthly own contribution and applies 73.7%.":"ટૂલ ઘરની આવકને સત્તાવાર ઘરગથ્થુ વજન દ્વારા વિભાજિત કરે છે, ભારાંકિત વાર્ષિક આવકમાંથી પ્રમાણભૂત પોતાના યોગદાનની ગણતરી કરે છે, ઘરના કદ અને મ્યુનિસિપાલિટી કેપ દ્વારા મંજૂર આવાસ ખર્ચને મર્યાદિત કરે છે, માસિક પોતાના યોગદાનને બાદ કરે છે અને 73.7% લાગુ કરે છે.","Common questions":"સામાન્ય પ્રશ્નો","Is this an official award or eligibility decision?":"શું આ એક અધિકૃત પુરસ્કાર કે પાત્રતાનો નિર્ણય છે?","No. It is a standard-case scenario, not an application or decision. Husbanken’s official calculator applies current eligibility limits, personal rules and the month being checked.":"નં. તે પ્રમાણભૂત-કેસ દૃશ્ય છે, એપ્લિકેશન અથવા નિર્ણય નથી. Husbanken નું અધિકૃત કેલ્ક્યુલેટર વર્તમાન પાત્રતા મર્યાદા, વ્યક્તિગત નિયમો અને તપાસવામાં આવેલ મહિનો લાગુ કરે છે.","What should I enter as household income?":"મારે ઘરની આવક તરીકે શું દાખલ કરવું જોઈએ?","Enter the monthly household income basis used by Husbanken before household weighting. It may include taxable monthly income, reportable annual income converted to a month, applicable wealth supplement and tax-free rental income. Children’s income and several named benefits are excluded. Check Husbanken’s income guidance.":"હાઉસહોલ્ડ વેઇટીંગ પહેલાં Husbanken દ્વારા ઉપયોગમાં લેવાતો માસિક પારિવારિક આવકનો આધાર દાખલ કરો. તેમાં કરપાત્ર માસિક આવક, એક મહિનામાં રૂપાંતરિત અહેવાલપાત્ર વાર્ષિક આવક, લાગુ પડતી સંપત્તિ પૂરક અને કરમુક્ત ભાડાની આવકનો સમાવેશ થઈ શકે છે. બાળકોની આવક અને કેટલાક નામના લાભો બાકાત રાખવામાં આવ્યા છે. Husbanken ની આવક માર્ગદર્શન તપાસો.","What counts as approved housing costs?":"મંજૂર હાઉસિંગ ખર્ચ તરીકે શું ગણવામાં આવે છે?","Husbanken counts costs differently for renters, shared-cost housing and detached homes. Enter the amount already worked out under its current rules, not every housing bill. The result is still capped by household size and municipality.":"Husbanken ભાડે આપનારાઓ, વહેંચાયેલ ખર્ચના આવાસ અને અલગ ઘરો માટે અલગ અલગ રીતે ખર્ચની ગણતરી કરે છે. તેના વર્તમાન નિયમો હેઠળ પહેલેથી જ કામ કરેલ રકમ દાખલ કરો, દરેક હાઉસિંગ બિલ નહીં. પરિણામ હજુ પણ ઘરના કદ અને નગરપાલિકા દ્વારા મર્યાદિત છે.","Does changing language change the rules?":"શું ભાષા બદલવાથી નિયમો બદલાય છે?","No. This tool estimates a Norway-only 2026 scenario in every interface language.":"નં. આ સાધન દરેક ઈન્ટરફેસ ભાષામાં નોર્વે-માત્ર 2026 દૃશ્યનો અંદાજ લગાવે છે.","Scope and limits":"અવકાશ અને મર્યાદા","Norway only. This standard-case estimate does not decide eligibility or model the separate upper household-income limit, minimum payout, single old-age pensioner or young-disabled thresholds, special-adapted housing, transition rules, or every income and asset exception. The 2026 rates are static and must be rechecked against Husbanken. Use its official calculator for the month you are checking.":"ફક્ત નોર્વે. આ પ્રમાણભૂત-કેસ અંદાજ પાત્રતા નક્કી કરતું નથી અથવા અલગ ઉપલી ઘરગથ્થુ-આવક મર્યાદા, લઘુત્તમ ચૂકવણી, એકલ વૃદ્ધાવસ્થા પેન્શનર અથવા યુવાન-વિકલાંગ થ્રેશોલ્ડ, વિશેષ-અનુકૂલિત આવાસ, સંક્રમણ નિયમો અથવા દરેક આવક અને સંપત્તિ અપવાદને નક્કી કરતું નથી. 2026 દરો સ્થિર છે અને Husbanken સામે ફરીથી તપાસવા જોઈએ. તમે જે મહિનાની તપાસ કરી રહ્યા છો તેના માટે તેના સત્તાવાર કેલ્ક્યુલેટરનો ઉપયોગ કરો.","Estimate a standard monthly scenario":"માનક માસિક દૃશ્યનો અંદાજ કાઢો","Norwegian rules only · standard 2026 rates · checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country or rules.":"ફક્ત નોર્વેજીયન નિયમો · પ્રમાણભૂત 2026 દરો · 17 ઓક્ટોબર 2026 ચકાસાયેલ · ભાષા દેશ અથવા નિયમોને બદલતી નથી.","Monthly household income basis before weighting, NOK":"વેઇટીંગ પહેલા માસિક પારિવારિક આવકનો આધાર, NOK","Use the gross monthly basis Husbanken applies, including any applicable wealth supplement and tax-free rental income. Exclude items Husbanken says do not count. See its income guide before relying on a result.":"Husbanken લાગુ પડે છે, કોઈપણ લાગુ સંપત્તિ પૂરક અને કરમુક્ત ભાડાની આવક સહિત કુલ માસિક ધોરણનો ઉપયોગ કરો. બાકાત વસ્તુઓ Husbanken કહે ગણતરી નથી. પરિણામ પર આધાર રાખતા પહેલા તેની આવક માર્ગદર્શિકા જુઓ.","Monthly housing costs already approved under Husbanken rules, NOK":"હસબેંકન નિયમો હેઠળ માસિક આવાસ ખર્ચ પહેલેથી જ મંજૂર, NOK","Do not add every housing bill. Approved costs differ for rental, shared-cost and detached housing; enter the monthly amount under current Husbanken rules. A household and municipality cap is applied below.":"દરેક હાઉસિંગ બિલ ઉમેરશો નહીં. ભાડા, વહેંચાયેલ ખર્ચ અને અલગ હાઉસિંગ માટે મંજૂર ખર્ચ અલગ છે; વર્તમાન Husbanken નિયમો હેઠળ માસિક રકમ દાખલ કરો. નીચે એક ઘરગથ્થુ અને મ્યુનિસિપાલિટી કેપ લાગુ કરવામાં આવી છે.","Household members aged 18 or older":"18 અથવા તેથી વધુ ઉંમરના ઘરના સભ્યો","Household members under 18":"18 હેઠળ ઘરના સભ્યો","2026 municipality cap group":"2026 મ્યુનિસિપાલિટી કેપ ગ્રુપ","Other municipalities":"અન્ય નગરપાલિકાઓ","Oslo":"ઓસ્લો","Bergen, Trondheim, Tromsø, Stavanger or Bærum":"બર્ગન, ટ્રોન્ડહેમ, ટ્રોમ્સ, સ્ટેવેન્જર અથવા બેરમ","Kristiansand, Skedsmo, Frogn, Lørenskog, Nordre Follo, Asker, Nesodden, Sola or Sandnes":"ક્રિસ્ટિયનસૅન્ડ, સ્કેડ્સમો, ફ્રોગન, લોરેન્સકોગ, નોર્ડે ફોલો, એસ્કર, નેસોડન, સોલા અથવા સેન્ડનેસ","Estimate monthly amount":"માસિક રકમનો અંદાજ કાઢો","Clear entries":"પ્રવેશો સાફ કરો","Enter the household’s monthly income basis, approved housing costs and composition.":"ઘરની માસિક આવકનો આધાર, મંજૂર આવાસ ખર્ચ અને રચના દાખલ કરો.","Scenario calculated on this device. Husbanken decides actual cases.":"આ ઉપકરણ પર ગણતરી કરેલ દૃશ્ય. હસબંકન વાસ્તવિક કેસોનો નિર્ણય કરે છે.","Entries cleared.":"પ્રવેશો સાફ.","Check the monthly amounts, household counts and municipality group.":"માસિક રકમ, ઘરની ગણતરીઓ અને મ્યુનિસિપાલિટી જૂથ તપાસો.","Standard monthly scenario":"પ્રમાણભૂત માસિક દૃશ્ય","Estimated monthly housing benefit":"અંદાજિત માસિક આવાસ લાભ","Monthly household income entered":"માસિક ઘરની આવક દાખલ કરી","Household income weight":"ઘરગથ્થુ આવકનું વજન","Weighted monthly income":"ભારિત માસિક આવક","Estimated monthly own contribution":"અંદાજિત માસિક પોતાનું યોગદાન","Approved housing costs entered":"મંજૂર હાઉસિંગ ખર્ચ દાખલ કર્યો","Monthly housing-cost cap":"માસિક હાઉસિંગ-કોસ્ટ કેપ","Approved costs used after cap":"કેપ પછી ઉપયોગમાં લેવાતા મંજૂર ખર્ચ","Costs remaining after own contribution":"પોતાના યોગદાન પછી બાકી રહેલ ખર્ચ","Coverage rate":"કવરેજ દર","Assumptions used":"ઉપયોગી ધારણાઓ","The standard contribution thresholds and housing-cost caps use Husbanken’s 2026 rates checked 17 October 2026.":"માનક યોગદાન થ્રેશોલ્ડ અને હાઉસિંગ-કોસ્ટ કેપ્સ Husbanken ના 2026 રેટનો ઉપયોગ કરે છે 17 ઓક્ટોબર 2026.","Estimated benefit = max(0, approved costs after cap − own contribution) × 73.7%. Weighted income uses 1.00 for the first member, 0.13 for each additional member aged 18 or older and 0.15 for each additional member under 18.":"અંદાજિત લાભ = મહત્તમ(0, કેપ − પોતાના યોગદાન પછી મંજૂર ખર્ચ) × 73.7%. ભારિત આવક પ્રથમ સભ્ય માટે 1.00, 18 અથવા તેથી વધુ વયના દરેક વધારાના સભ્ય માટે 0.13 અને 18 હેઠળના દરેક વધારાના સભ્ય માટે 0.15 નો ઉપયોગ કરે છે.","The entered income must already follow Husbanken’s income rules. Special thresholds, the separate household income ceiling, payout floor and personal eligibility are not calculated.":"દાખલ કરેલ આવક પહેલાથી જ Husbanken ના આવક નિયમોનું પાલન કરતી હોવી જોઈએ. વિશેષ થ્રેશોલ્ડ, અલગ ઘરની આવકની ટોચમર્યાદા, ચૂકવણીનું માળખું અને વ્યક્તિગત પાત્રતાની ગણતરી કરવામાં આવતી નથી.","Private, local calculation. No figures are uploaded or stored by this page.":"ખાનગી, સ્થાનિક ગણતરી. આ પૃષ્ઠ દ્વારા કોઈ આંકડાઓ અપલોડ અથવા સંગ્રહિત નથી.","Husbanken: calculation":"Husbanken: ગણતરી","Husbanken: income basis":"Husbanken: આવકનો આધાર","Husbanken: 2026 own-contribution rates":"Husbanken: 2026 પોતાના યોગદાન દરો","Husbanken: 2026 housing-cost caps":"Husbanken: 2026 હાઉસિંગ-કોસ્ટ કેપ્સ","Open Husbanken’s official calculator":"Husbankenનું સત્તાવાર કેલ્ક્યુલેટર ખોલો"},"ha":{"Norway Housing Benefit Estimator":"Ƙididdigar Amfanin Gidajen Norway","Norway Housing Benefit Calculator 2026 — Monthly Scenario":"Ƙididdigar Amfanin Gidajen Norway 2026 - Yanayin kowane wata","Estimate a standard monthly Norwegian housing-benefit scenario from the household income basis, approved housing costs, household size and municipality group. See the 2026 assumptions and continue to Husbanken for a current eligibility check.":"Yi ƙididdige madaidaicin yanayin fa'idar gidaje na Norway na wata-wata daga tushen samun kudin shiga na gida, farashin gidaje da aka yarda, girman gida da ƙungiyar gunduma. Dubi zato na 2026 kuma ci gaba da Husbanken don duba cancanta na yanzu.","Use this private scenario to understand how Norway’s housing-benefit formula combines approved housing costs, weighted household income and the 2026 coverage rate. The interface language never changes the Norwegian rules.":"Yi amfani da wannan yanayin mai zaman kansa don fahimtar yadda tsarin fa'idar gidaje na Norway ya haɗa farashin gidaje da aka amince da shi, kuɗin shiga gida mai nauyi da ƙimar ɗaukar hoto na 2026. Harshen mu'amala ba zai taɓa canza dokokin Norwegian ba.","Calculations run in this browser. Entries are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"Lissafi suna gudana a cikin wannan mai binciken. Ba a aika shigarwar zuwa uwar garken ko adana ta wannan kayan aikin ba.","Example":"Misali","For one household member with no income and NOK 8,000 in monthly approved housing costs, the 2026 standard own contribution is about NOK 2,215 per month. The estimated benefit is about NOK 4,032 after applying the 73.7% rate.":"Ga wani memba na gida wanda ba shi da kudin shiga da kuma NOK 8,000 a cikin farashin gidaje da aka amince da shi a kowane wata, gudunmawar gudunmawar 2026 daidai yake da NOK 2,215 kowace wata. Amfanin da aka kiyasta shine game da NOK 4,032 bayan amfani da ƙimar 73.7%.","How the scenario works":"Yadda yanayin ke aiki","The tool divides household income by the official household weight, calculates the standard own contribution from weighted annual income, limits approved housing costs by the household-size and municipality cap, subtracts the monthly own contribution and applies 73.7%.":"Kayan aiki yana raba kudin shiga gida da nauyin gidan hukuma, yana ƙididdige madaidaicin gudummawar kansa daga ma'auni na shekara-shekara, yana iyakance farashin gidaje da aka yarda da girman gida da babban yanki, yana cire gudummawar kansa na wata-wata kuma yana amfani da 73.7%.","Common questions":"Tambayoyi gama gari","Is this an official award or eligibility decision?":"Wannan kyauta ce ta hukuma ko shawarar cancanta?","No. It is a standard-case scenario, not an application or decision. Husbanken’s official calculator applies current eligibility limits, personal rules and the month being checked.":"A'a. Yanayi daidaitaccen yanayi, ba aikace-aikace ko yanke shawara ba. Husbanken's kalkuleta na hukuma yana aiki da iyakokin cancanta na yanzu, dokokin sirri da kuma watan da ake dubawa.","What should I enter as household income?":"Menene zan shigar a matsayin kudin shiga na gida?","Enter the monthly household income basis used by Husbanken before household weighting. It may include taxable monthly income, reportable annual income converted to a month, applicable wealth supplement and tax-free rental income. Children’s income and several named benefits are excluded. Check Husbanken’s income guidance.":"Shigar da tushen kuɗin shiga gida na wata-wata wanda Husbanken ke amfani da shi kafin aunawa gida. Yana iya haɗawa da kuɗin shiga na wata-wata mai haraji, samun rahoton shekara-shekara wanda aka canza zuwa wata, ƙarin dukiya da kuɗin haya mara haraji. Ba a cire kuɗin shiga na yara da fa'idodi da yawa masu suna. Duba jagorar samun kudin shiga Husbanken.","What counts as approved housing costs?":"Menene ƙididdiga azaman ƙimar gidaje da aka yarda?","Husbanken counts costs differently for renters, shared-cost housing and detached homes. Enter the amount already worked out under its current rules, not every housing bill. The result is still capped by household size and municipality.":"Husbanken kirga farashi daban-daban na masu haya, gidaje masu tsada da gidajen keɓe. Shigar da adadin da aka riga aka yi aiki a ƙarƙashin dokokinsa na yanzu, ba kowane lissafin gidaje ba. Sakamakon har yanzu yana cikin girman gida da gunduma.","Does changing language change the rules?":"Shin canza harshe yana canza dokoki?","No. This tool estimates a Norway-only 2026 scenario in every interface language.":"No. Wannan kayan aikin yana ƙididdige yanayin 2026 na Norway-kawai a cikin kowane yare mai mu'amala.","Scope and limits":"Mai iyaka da iyaka","Norway only. This standard-case estimate does not decide eligibility or model the separate upper household-income limit, minimum payout, single old-age pensioner or young-disabled thresholds, special-adapted housing, transition rules, or every income and asset exception. The 2026 rates are static and must be rechecked against Husbanken. Use its official calculator for the month you are checking.":"Norway kawai. Wannan ma'auni na ƙididdigewa ba zai yanke shawarar cancanta ba ko ƙirar keɓan iyakar samun kudin shiga na gida, mafi ƙarancin biyan kuɗi, ɗan fansho guda ɗaya ko naƙasassu matasa, ƙayyadaddun gidaje na musamman, dokokin miƙa mulki, ko kowane samun shiga da keɓanta kadara. Farashin 2026 yana tsaye kuma dole ne a sake duba shi akan Husbanken. Yi amfani da kalkuleta na hukuma don watan da kuke dubawa.","Estimate a standard monthly scenario":"Ƙimar daidaitaccen yanayin kowane wata","Norwegian rules only · standard 2026 rates · checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country or rules.":"Dokokin Norwegian kawai · daidaitattun ƙimar 2026 · duba 17 Oktoba 2026 · harshe baya canza ƙasa ko dokoki.","Monthly household income basis before weighting, NOK":"Tushen samun kuɗin gida na wata-wata kafin auna nauyi, NOK","Use the gross monthly basis Husbanken applies, including any applicable wealth supplement and tax-free rental income. Exclude items Husbanken says do not count. See its income guide before relying on a result.":"Yi amfani da jimlar kuɗin da Husbanken ke nema na kowane wata, gami da duk wani ƙarin dukiya da kuɗin shiga na haya mara haraji. Ban da abubuwa Husbanken ya ce kar a ƙidaya. Duba jagorar samun kudin shiga kafin dogaro da sakamako.","Monthly housing costs already approved under Husbanken rules, NOK":"An riga an amince da farashin gidaje na wata-wata a ƙarƙashin dokokin Husbanken, NOK","Do not add every housing bill. Approved costs differ for rental, shared-cost and detached housing; enter the monthly amount under current Husbanken rules. A household and municipality cap is applied below.":"Kada ku ƙara kowane lissafin gidaje. Kudin da aka amince da su sun bambanta don haya, farashi-tsari da keɓe gidaje; shigar da adadin kowane wata a ƙarƙashin dokokin Husbanken na yanzu. Ana amfani da madaidaicin gida da gunduma a ƙasa.","Household members aged 18 or older":"Mambobin gida shekaru 18 ko fiye","Household members under 18":"Mambobin gida a ƙarƙashin 18","2026 municipality cap group":"2026 babban rukuni na gundumar","Other municipalities":"Sauran gundumomi","Oslo":"Oslo","Bergen, Trondheim, Tromsø, Stavanger or Bærum":"Bergen, Trondheim, Tromsø, Stavanger ko Bærum","Kristiansand, Skedsmo, Frogn, Lørenskog, Nordre Follo, Asker, Nesodden, Sola or Sandnes":"Kristiansand, Skedsmo, Frogn, Lørenskog, Nordre Follo, Asker, Nesodden, Sola ko Sandnes","Estimate monthly amount":"Kiyasta adadin kowane wata","Clear entries":"Share abubuwan shigarwa","Enter the household’s monthly income basis, approved housing costs and composition.":"Shigar da tushen samun kudin shiga na wata-wata, farashin gidaje da aka amince da su da abun da ke ciki.","Scenario calculated on this device. Husbanken decides actual cases.":"Halin da aka lissafta akan wannan na'urar. Husbanken yana yanke hukunci na ainihi.","Entries cleared.":"An share abubuwan shiga","Check the monthly amounts, household counts and municipality group.":"Bincika adadin kowane wata, ƙidayar gida da ƙungiyar gunduma.","Standard monthly scenario":"Daidaitaccen yanayin kowane wata","Estimated monthly housing benefit":"Kimanin fa'idar gidaje kowane wata","Monthly household income entered":"Kudin shiga gida na wata-wata ya shiga","Household income weight":"Nauyin kudin shiga na gida","Weighted monthly income":"Kuɗin shiga kowane wata","Estimated monthly own contribution":"Kimanin gudunmawar kansa na wata-wata","Approved housing costs entered":"An shigar da farashin gidaje da aka yarda","Monthly housing-cost cap":"Kudin gidaje na wata-wata","Approved costs used after cap":"An yarda da farashin da aka yi amfani da shi bayan hula","Costs remaining after own contribution":"Farashin ya rage bayan gudummawar kansa","Coverage rate":"Yawan ɗaukar hoto","Assumptions used":"Ana amfani da zato","The standard contribution thresholds and housing-cost caps use Husbanken’s 2026 rates checked 17 October 2026.":"Matsakaicin madaidaicin gudunmawar gudunmawar da farashin gidaje na amfani da Husbanken's 2026 farashin da aka duba 17 Oktoba 2026.","Estimated benefit = max(0, approved costs after cap − own contribution) × 73.7%. Weighted income uses 1.00 for the first member, 0.13 for each additional member aged 18 or older and 0.15 for each additional member under 18.":"Ƙimar fa'ida = max (0, farashin da aka amince bayan tafiya - gudunmawar kansa) × 73.7%. Kudin shiga mai nauyi yana amfani da 1.00 don memba na farko, 0.13 ga kowane ƙarin memba mai shekaru 18 ko tsofaffi da 0.15 ga kowane ƙarin memba a ƙarƙashin 18.","The entered income must already follow Husbanken’s income rules. Special thresholds, the separate household income ceiling, payout floor and personal eligibility are not calculated.":"Kudin shiga dole ne ya riga ya bi ka'idodin samun kudin shiga na Husbanken. Ba a ƙididdige ƙofa na musamman, rufin kuɗin shiga na gida daban, bene na biyan kuɗi da cancantar mutum.","Private, local calculation. No figures are uploaded or stored by this page.":"Mai zaman kansa, lissafin gida. Babu wani adadi da wannan shafin ya loda ko adana shi.","Husbanken: calculation":"Husbanken: lissafi","Husbanken: income basis":"Husbanken: tushen samun kudin shiga","Husbanken: 2026 own-contribution rates":"Husbanken: 2026 ƙimar gudummawar kansa","Husbanken: 2026 housing-cost caps":"Husbanken: 2026 farashin gidaje","Open Husbanken’s official calculator":"Buɗe Husbanken's kalkuleta"},"hi":{"Norway Housing Benefit Estimator":"नॉर्वे आवास लाभ अनुमानक","Norway Housing Benefit Calculator 2026 — Monthly Scenario":"नॉर्वे हाउसिंग बेनिफिट कैलकुलेटर 2026 — मासिक परिदृश्य","Estimate a standard monthly Norwegian housing-benefit scenario from the household income basis, approved housing costs, household size and municipality group. See the 2026 assumptions and continue to Husbanken for a current eligibility check.":"घरेलू आय के आधार, अनुमोदित आवास लागत, घरेलू आकार और नगर पालिका समूह से एक मानक मासिक नॉर्वेजियन आवास-लाभ परिदृश्य का अनुमान लगाएं। 2026 मान्यताओं को देखें और वर्तमान पात्रता जांच के लिए हस्बैंकन को जारी रखें।","Use this private scenario to understand how Norway’s housing-benefit formula combines approved housing costs, weighted household income and the 2026 coverage rate. The interface language never changes the Norwegian rules.":"इस निजी परिदृश्य का उपयोग यह समझने के लिए करें कि नॉर्वे का आवास-लाभ फॉर्मूला अनुमोदित आवास लागत, भारित घरेलू आय और 2026 कवरेज दर को कैसे जोड़ता है। इंटरफ़ेस भाषा नॉर्वेजियन नियमों को कभी नहीं बदलती।","Calculations run in this browser. Entries are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"गणना इस ब्राउज़र में चलती है। प्रविष्टियाँ किसी सर्वर पर नहीं भेजी जाती हैं या इस टूल द्वारा सहेजी नहीं जाती हैं।","Example":"उदाहरण","For one household member with no income and NOK 8,000 in monthly approved housing costs, the 2026 standard own contribution is about NOK 2,215 per month. The estimated benefit is about NOK 4,032 after applying the 73.7% rate.":"बिना आय वाले घर के एक सदस्य और मासिक स्वीकृत आवास लागत में NOK 8,000 के लिए, 2026 मानक स्वयं का योगदान लगभग NOK 2,215 प्रति माह है। 73.7% दर लागू करने के बाद अनुमानित लाभ लगभग NOK 4,032 है।","How the scenario works":"परिदृश्य कैसे काम करता है","The tool divides household income by the official household weight, calculates the standard own contribution from weighted annual income, limits approved housing costs by the household-size and municipality cap, subtracts the monthly own contribution and applies 73.7%.":"उपकरण घरेलू आय को आधिकारिक घरेलू वजन से विभाजित करता है, भारित वार्षिक आय से मानक स्वयं के योगदान की गणना करता है, घरेलू आकार और नगरपालिका सीमा द्वारा अनुमोदित आवास लागत को सीमित करता है, मासिक स्वयं के योगदान को घटाता है और 73.7% लागू करता है।","Common questions":"सामान्य प्रश्न","Is this an official award or eligibility decision?":"क्या यह एक आधिकारिक पुरस्कार या पात्रता निर्णय है?","No. It is a standard-case scenario, not an application or decision. Husbanken’s official calculator applies current eligibility limits, personal rules and the month being checked.":"नहीं। यह एक मानक-मामला परिदृश्य है, कोई आवेदन या निर्णय नहीं। हसबैंकन का आधिकारिक कैलकुलेटर वर्तमान पात्रता सीमा, व्यक्तिगत नियम और जाँच किए जा रहे महीने को लागू करता है।","What should I enter as household income?":"मुझे घरेलू आय के रूप में क्या दर्ज करना चाहिए?","Enter the monthly household income basis used by Husbanken before household weighting. It may include taxable monthly income, reportable annual income converted to a month, applicable wealth supplement and tax-free rental income. Children’s income and several named benefits are excluded. Check Husbanken’s income guidance.":"घरेलू भारांक से पहले हस्बैंकन द्वारा उपयोग किया जाने वाला मासिक घरेलू आय आधार दर्ज करें। इसमें कर योग्य मासिक आय, एक महीने में परिवर्तित रिपोर्ट योग्य वार्षिक आय, लागू धन पूरक और कर-मुक्त किराये की आय शामिल हो सकती है। बच्चों की आय और कई नामित लाभों को बाहर रखा गया है। हसबैंकन के आय मार्गदर्शन की जाँच करें।","What counts as approved housing costs?":"अनुमोदित आवास लागत के रूप में क्या गिना जाता है?","Husbanken counts costs differently for renters, shared-cost housing and detached homes. Enter the amount already worked out under its current rules, not every housing bill. The result is still capped by household size and municipality.":"हस्बैंकन किराएदारों, साझा-लागत वाले आवास और अलग घरों के लिए लागतों की अलग-अलग गणना करता है। इसके मौजूदा नियमों के तहत पहले से तय की गई राशि दर्ज करें, न कि प्रत्येक आवास बिल। परिणाम अभी भी घरेलू आकार और नगर पालिका द्वारा सीमित है।","Does changing language change the rules?":"क्या भाषा बदलने से नियम बदल जाते हैं?","No. This tool estimates a Norway-only 2026 scenario in every interface language.":"नहीं। यह टूल प्रत्येक इंटरफ़ेस भाषा में केवल नॉर्वे 2026 परिदृश्य का अनुमान लगाता है।","Scope and limits":"दायरा और सीमाएँ","Norway only. This standard-case estimate does not decide eligibility or model the separate upper household-income limit, minimum payout, single old-age pensioner or young-disabled thresholds, special-adapted housing, transition rules, or every income and asset exception. The 2026 rates are static and must be rechecked against Husbanken. Use its official calculator for the month you are checking.":"केवल नॉर्वे। यह मानक-मामला अनुमान पात्रता तय नहीं करता है या अलग-अलग ऊपरी घरेलू-आय सीमा, न्यूनतम भुगतान, एकल वृद्धावस्था पेंशनभोगी या युवा-विकलांग सीमा, विशेष-अनुकूलित आवास, संक्रमण नियम, या प्रत्येक आय और संपत्ति अपवाद को मॉडल नहीं करता है। 2026 दरें स्थिर हैं और इन्हें हस्बैंकन के विरुद्ध दोबारा जांचा जाना चाहिए। जिस महीने की आप जांच कर रहे हैं उसके लिए इसके आधिकारिक कैलकुलेटर का उपयोग करें।","Estimate a standard monthly scenario":"एक मानक मासिक परिदृश्य का अनुमान लगाएं","Norwegian rules only · standard 2026 rates · checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country or rules.":"केवल नॉर्वेजियन नियम · मानक 2026 दरें · 17 अक्टूबर 2026 की जाँच की · भाषा देश या नियम नहीं बदलती।","Monthly household income basis before weighting, NOK":"भारांकन से पहले मासिक घरेलू आय का आधार, NOK","Use the gross monthly basis Husbanken applies, including any applicable wealth supplement and tax-free rental income. Exclude items Husbanken says do not count. See its income guide before relying on a result.":"हस्बैंकन द्वारा लागू सकल मासिक आधार का उपयोग करें, जिसमें कोई भी लागू धन अनुपूरक और कर-मुक्त किराये की आय शामिल है। हस्बैंकन का कहना है कि आइटमों को गिनें नहीं। किसी परिणाम पर भरोसा करने से पहले इसकी आय मार्गदर्शिका देखें।","Monthly housing costs already approved under Husbanken rules, NOK":"मासिक आवास लागत हस्बैंकन नियमों के तहत पहले ही स्वीकृत है, NOK","Do not add every housing bill. Approved costs differ for rental, shared-cost and detached housing; enter the monthly amount under current Husbanken rules. A household and municipality cap is applied below.":"हर आवास बिल न जोड़ें। किराये, साझा-लागत और अलग आवास के लिए स्वीकृत लागत अलग-अलग हैं; मौजूदा हसबैंकन नियमों के तहत मासिक राशि दर्ज करें। घरेलू और नगर पालिका सीमा नीचे लागू की गई है।","Household members aged 18 or older":"घरेलू सदस्य जिनकी आयु 18 या उससे अधिक है","Household members under 18":"18 के अंतर्गत घरेलू सदस्य","2026 municipality cap group":"2026 नगर पालिका कैप समूह","Other municipalities":"अन्य नगर पालिकाएँ","Oslo":"ओस्लो","Bergen, Trondheim, Tromsø, Stavanger or Bærum":"बर्गेन, ट्रॉनहैम, ट्रोम्सो, स्टवान्गर या बेरम","Kristiansand, Skedsmo, Frogn, Lørenskog, Nordre Follo, Asker, Nesodden, Sola or Sandnes":"क्रिस्टियानसैंड, स्केड्स्मो, फ्रोगन, लोरेन्सकोग, नॉर्ड्रे फोलो, आस्कर, नेसोडेन, सोला या सैंडनेस","Estimate monthly amount":"मासिक राशि का अनुमान लगाएं","Clear entries":"प्रविष्टियाँ साफ़ करें","Enter the household’s monthly income basis, approved housing costs and composition.":"परिवार की मासिक आय का आधार, स्वीकृत आवास लागत और संरचना दर्ज करें।","Scenario calculated on this device. Husbanken decides actual cases.":"इस डिवाइस पर परिदृश्य की गणना की गई। हस्बैंकन वास्तविक मामलों का निर्णय करता है।","Entries cleared.":"प्रविष्टियाँ साफ़ की गईं।","Check the monthly amounts, household counts and municipality group.":"मासिक राशि, घरेलू गणना और नगर पालिका समूह की जाँच करें।","Standard monthly scenario":"मानक मासिक परिदृश्य","Estimated monthly housing benefit":"अनुमानित मासिक आवास लाभ","Monthly household income entered":"मासिक घरेलू आय दर्ज की गई","Household income weight":"घरेलू आय भार","Weighted monthly income":"भारित मासिक आय","Estimated monthly own contribution":"अनुमानित मासिक स्वयं का योगदान","Approved housing costs entered":"स्वीकृत आवास लागत दर्ज की गई","Monthly housing-cost cap":"मासिक आवास-लागत सीमा","Approved costs used after cap":"सीमा के बाद प्रयुक्त स्वीकृत लागत","Costs remaining after own contribution":"स्वयं के योगदान के बाद शेष लागत","Coverage rate":"कवरेज दर","Assumptions used":"प्रयुक्त धारणाएँ","The standard contribution thresholds and housing-cost caps use Husbanken’s 2026 rates checked 17 October 2026.":"मानक अंशदान सीमाएँ और आवास-लागत सीमा हसबैंकन की 2026 दरों की जाँच की गई 17 अक्टूबर 2026 का उपयोग करती हैं।","Estimated benefit = max(0, approved costs after cap − own contribution) × 73.7%. Weighted income uses 1.00 for the first member, 0.13 for each additional member aged 18 or older and 0.15 for each additional member under 18.":"अनुमानित लाभ = अधिकतम(0, सीमा के बाद स्वीकृत लागत - स्वयं का योगदान) × 73.7%। भारित आय पहले सदस्य के लिए 1.00, 18 या उससे अधिक उम्र के प्रत्येक अतिरिक्त सदस्य के लिए 0.13 और 18 के तहत प्रत्येक अतिरिक्त सदस्य के लिए 0.15 का उपयोग करती है।","The entered income must already follow Husbanken’s income rules. Special thresholds, the separate household income ceiling, payout floor and personal eligibility are not calculated.":"दर्ज की गई आय को पहले से ही हस्बैंकन के आय नियमों का पालन करना चाहिए। विशेष सीमाएँ, अलग घरेलू आय सीमा, भुगतान सीमा और व्यक्तिगत पात्रता की गणना नहीं की जाती है।","Private, local calculation. No figures are uploaded or stored by this page.":"निजी, स्थानीय गणना। इस पृष्ठ द्वारा कोई आंकड़े अपलोड या संग्रहीत नहीं किए जाते हैं।","Husbanken: calculation":"हस्बैंकन: गणना","Husbanken: income basis":"हस्बैंकन: आय आधार","Husbanken: 2026 own-contribution rates":"हस्बैंकन: 2026 स्वयं-योगदान दरें","Husbanken: 2026 housing-cost caps":"हस्बैंकन: 2026 आवास-लागत सीमा","Open Husbanken’s official calculator":"हस्बैंकन का आधिकारिक कैलकुलेटर खोलें"},"id":{"Norway Housing Benefit Estimator":"Penaksir Manfaat Perumahan Norwegia","Norway Housing Benefit Calculator 2026 — Monthly Scenario":"Kalkulator Manfaat Perumahan Norwegia 2026 — Skenario Bulanan","Estimate a standard monthly Norwegian housing-benefit scenario from the household income basis, approved housing costs, household size and municipality group. See the 2026 assumptions and continue to Husbanken for a current eligibility check.":"Perkirakan skenario manfaat perumahan bulanan standar Norwegia berdasarkan pendapatan rumah tangga, biaya perumahan yang disetujui, ukuran rumah tangga dan kelompok kota. Lihat asumsi 2026 dan lanjutkan ke Husbanken untuk pemeriksaan kelayakan saat ini.","Use this private scenario to understand how Norway’s housing-benefit formula combines approved housing costs, weighted household income and the 2026 coverage rate. The interface language never changes the Norwegian rules.":"Gunakan skenario pribadi ini untuk memahami bagaimana formula manfaat perumahan di Norwegia menggabungkan biaya perumahan yang disetujui, pendapatan rumah tangga tertimbang, dan tingkat cakupan 2026. Bahasa antarmuka tidak pernah mengubah aturan Norwegia.","Calculations run in this browser. Entries are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"Perhitungan dijalankan di browser ini. Entri tidak dikirim ke server atau disimpan oleh alat ini.","Example":"Contoh","For one household member with no income and NOK 8,000 in monthly approved housing costs, the 2026 standard own contribution is about NOK 2,215 per month. The estimated benefit is about NOK 4,032 after applying the 73.7% rate.":"Untuk satu anggota rumah tangga tanpa penghasilan dan NOK 8,000 dalam biaya perumahan bulanan yang disetujui, kontribusi standar 2026 adalah sekitar NOK 2,215 per bulan. Perkiraan manfaatnya adalah sekitar NOK 4,032 setelah menerapkan tarif 73.7%.","How the scenario works":"Cara kerja skenario","The tool divides household income by the official household weight, calculates the standard own contribution from weighted annual income, limits approved housing costs by the household-size and municipality cap, subtracts the monthly own contribution and applies 73.7%.":"Alat ini membagi pendapatan rumah tangga dengan bobot resmi rumah tangga, menghitung kontribusi standar sendiri dari pendapatan tahunan tertimbang, membatasi biaya perumahan yang disetujui berdasarkan ukuran rumah tangga dan batas kota, mengurangi kontribusi bulanan sendiri dan menerapkan 73.7%.","Common questions":"Pertanyaan umum","Is this an official award or eligibility decision?":"Apakah ini merupakan penghargaan resmi atau keputusan kelayakan?","No. It is a standard-case scenario, not an application or decision. Husbanken’s official calculator applies current eligibility limits, personal rules and the month being checked.":"Tidak. Ini adalah skenario kasus standar, bukan aplikasi atau keputusan. Kalkulator resmi Husbanken menerapkan batas kelayakan saat ini, aturan pribadi, dan bulan yang diperiksa.","What should I enter as household income?":"Berapa yang harus saya masukkan sebagai pendapatan rumah tangga?","Enter the monthly household income basis used by Husbanken before household weighting. It may include taxable monthly income, reportable annual income converted to a month, applicable wealth supplement and tax-free rental income. Children’s income and several named benefits are excluded. Check Husbanken’s income guidance.":"Masukkan dasar pendapatan rumah tangga bulanan yang digunakan oleh Husbanken sebelum pembobotan rumah tangga. Ini mungkin termasuk pendapatan bulanan kena pajak, pendapatan tahunan yang dapat dilaporkan dikonversi ke bulan, suplemen kekayaan yang berlaku, dan pendapatan sewa bebas pajak. Pendapatan anak-anak dan beberapa tunjangan tidak termasuk. Periksa panduan pendapatan Husbanken.","What counts as approved housing costs?":"Apa yang dihitung sebagai biaya perumahan yang disetujui?","Husbanken counts costs differently for renters, shared-cost housing and detached homes. Enter the amount already worked out under its current rules, not every housing bill. The result is still capped by household size and municipality.":"Husbanken menghitung biaya secara berbeda untuk penyewa, perumahan biaya bersama, dan rumah terpisah. Masukkan jumlah yang sudah dihitung berdasarkan peraturan saat ini, bukan setiap tagihan perumahan. Hasilnya masih dibatasi oleh ukuran rumah tangga dan kota.","Does changing language change the rules?":"Apakah mengubah bahasa mengubah aturan?","No. This tool estimates a Norway-only 2026 scenario in every interface language.":"Tidak. Alat ini memperkirakan skenario 2026 khusus Norwegia dalam setiap bahasa antarmuka.","Scope and limits":"Cakupan dan batasan","Norway only. This standard-case estimate does not decide eligibility or model the separate upper household-income limit, minimum payout, single old-age pensioner or young-disabled thresholds, special-adapted housing, transition rules, or every income and asset exception. The 2026 rates are static and must be rechecked against Husbanken. Use its official calculator for the month you are checking.":"Khusus Norwegia. Perkiraan kasus standar ini tidak menentukan kelayakan atau memodelkan batas atas pendapatan rumah tangga yang terpisah, pembayaran minimum, ambang batas pensiunan hari tua tunggal atau penyandang cacat muda, perumahan yang disesuaikan secara khusus, peraturan transisi, atau setiap pengecualian pendapatan dan aset. Tarif 2026 bersifat statis dan harus diperiksa ulang terhadap Husbanken. Gunakan kalkulator resminya untuk bulan yang Anda periksa.","Estimate a standard monthly scenario":"Perkirakan skenario bulanan standar","Norwegian rules only · standard 2026 rates · checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country or rules.":"Hanya aturan Norwegia · tarif standar 2026 · diperiksa 17 Oktober 2026 · bahasa tidak mengubah negara atau aturan.","Monthly household income basis before weighting, NOK":"Dasar pendapatan rumah tangga bulanan sebelum pembobotan, NOK","Use the gross monthly basis Husbanken applies, including any applicable wealth supplement and tax-free rental income. Exclude items Husbanken says do not count. See its income guide before relying on a result.":"Gunakan basis bulanan kotor yang berlaku Husbanken, termasuk suplemen kekayaan yang berlaku dan pendapatan sewa bebas pajak. Kecualikan item yang menurut Husbanken tidak dihitung. Lihat panduan pendapatannya sebelum mengandalkan hasilnya.","Monthly housing costs already approved under Husbanken rules, NOK":"Biaya perumahan bulanan telah disetujui berdasarkan aturan Husbanken, NOK","Do not add every housing bill. Approved costs differ for rental, shared-cost and detached housing; enter the monthly amount under current Husbanken rules. A household and municipality cap is applied below.":"Jangan tambahkan setiap tagihan perumahan. Biaya yang disetujui berbeda untuk perumahan sewa, biaya bersama, dan perumahan terpisah; masukkan jumlah bulanan berdasarkan aturan Husbanken saat ini. Batasan rumah tangga dan kotamadya diterapkan di bawah ini.","Household members aged 18 or older":"Anggota rumah tangga berusia 18 atau lebih","Household members under 18":"Anggota rumah tangga di bawah 18\nKelompok topi kotamadya","2026 municipality cap group":"2026","Other municipalities":"Kota lainnya","Oslo":"Oslo","Bergen, Trondheim, Tromsø, Stavanger or Bærum":"Bergen, Trondheim, Tromsø, Stavanger atau Bærum","Kristiansand, Skedsmo, Frogn, Lørenskog, Nordre Follo, Asker, Nesodden, Sola or Sandnes":"Kristiansand, Skedsmo, Frogn, Lørenskog, Nordre Follo, Asker, Nesodden, Sola atau Sandnes","Estimate monthly amount":"Perkirakan jumlah bulanan","Clear entries":"Hapus entri","Enter the household’s monthly income basis, approved housing costs and composition.":"Masukkan pendapatan bulanan rumah tangga, biaya dan komposisi perumahan yang disetujui.","Scenario calculated on this device. Husbanken decides actual cases.":"Skenario dihitung pada perangkat ini. Husbanken memutuskan kasus aktual.","Entries cleared.":"Entri dihapus.","Check the monthly amounts, household counts and municipality group.":"Periksa jumlah bulanan, jumlah rumah tangga dan kelompok kotamadya.","Standard monthly scenario":"Skenario bulanan standar","Estimated monthly housing benefit":"Perkiraan manfaat perumahan bulanan","Monthly household income entered":"Pendapatan rumah tangga bulanan dimasukkan","Household income weight":"Bobot pendapatan rumah tangga","Weighted monthly income":"Pendapatan bulanan tertimbang","Estimated monthly own contribution":"Perkiraan kontribusi bulanan sendiri","Approved housing costs entered":"Biaya perumahan yang disetujui dimasukkan","Monthly housing-cost cap":"Batasan biaya perumahan bulanan","Approved costs used after cap":"Biaya yang disetujui digunakan setelah batas","Costs remaining after own contribution":"Sisa biaya setelah kontribusi sendiri","Coverage rate":"Tingkat cakupan","Assumptions used":"Asumsi yang digunakan","The standard contribution thresholds and housing-cost caps use Husbanken’s 2026 rates checked 17 October 2026.":"Ambang batas kontribusi standar dan batas biaya perumahan menggunakan tarif 2026 Husbanken yang diperiksa 17 Oktober 2026.","Estimated benefit = max(0, approved costs after cap − own contribution) × 73.7%. Weighted income uses 1.00 for the first member, 0.13 for each additional member aged 18 or older and 0.15 for each additional member under 18.":"Perkiraan manfaat = maks(0, biaya yang disetujui setelah batas − kontribusi sendiri) × 73.7%. Pendapatan tertimbang menggunakan 1.00 untuk anggota pertama, 0.13 untuk setiap anggota tambahan berusia 18 atau lebih tua dan 0.15 untuk setiap anggota tambahan di bawah 18.","The entered income must already follow Husbanken’s income rules. Special thresholds, the separate household income ceiling, payout floor and personal eligibility are not calculated.":"Pendapatan yang dimasukkan harus sudah mengikuti aturan pendapatan Husbanken. Ambang batas khusus, batas atas pendapatan rumah tangga yang terpisah, batas bawah pembayaran, dan kelayakan pribadi tidak dihitung.","Private, local calculation. No figures are uploaded or stored by this page.":"Perhitungan lokal pribadi. Tidak ada angka yang diunggah atau disimpan oleh halaman ini.","Husbanken: calculation":"Husbanken: perhitungan","Husbanken: income basis":"Husbanken: dasar pendapatan","Husbanken: 2026 own-contribution rates":"Husbanken: 2026 tarif kontribusi sendiri","Husbanken: 2026 housing-cost caps":"Husbanken: Batas biaya perumahan 2026","Open Husbanken’s official calculator":"Buka kalkulator resmi Husbanken"},"it":{"Norway Housing Benefit Estimator":"Stima dei benefici abitativi in Norvegia","Norway Housing Benefit Calculator 2026 — Monthly Scenario":"Calcolatore del sussidio abitativo in Norvegia 2026 — Scenario mensile","Estimate a standard monthly Norwegian housing-benefit scenario from the household income basis, approved housing costs, household size and municipality group. See the 2026 assumptions and continue to Husbanken for a current eligibility check.":"Stima di uno scenario standard mensile di sussidi abitativi norvegesi in base al reddito familiare, ai costi abitativi approvati, alle dimensioni del nucleo familiare e al gruppo di comuni. Consulta le ipotesi 2026 e prosegui verso Husbanken per un controllo di idoneità attuale.","Use this private scenario to understand how Norway’s housing-benefit formula combines approved housing costs, weighted household income and the 2026 coverage rate. The interface language never changes the Norwegian rules.":"Utilizza questo scenario privato per comprendere in che modo la formula norvegese dei sussidi abitativi combina i costi abitativi approvati, il reddito familiare ponderato e il tasso di copertura 2026. La lingua dell'interfaccia non cambia mai le regole norvegesi.","Calculations run in this browser. Entries are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"I calcoli vengono eseguiti in questo browser. Le voci non vengono inviate a un server o salvate da questo strumento.","Example":"Esempio","For one household member with no income and NOK 8,000 in monthly approved housing costs, the 2026 standard own contribution is about NOK 2,215 per month. The estimated benefit is about NOK 4,032 after applying the 73.7% rate.":"Per un membro della famiglia senza reddito e NOK 8,000 in costi abitativi mensili approvati, il contributo proprio standard 2026 è di circa NOK 2,215 al mese. Il vantaggio stimato è di circa NOK 4,032 dopo aver applicato la tariffa 73.7%.","How the scenario works":"Come funziona lo scenario","The tool divides household income by the official household weight, calculates the standard own contribution from weighted annual income, limits approved housing costs by the household-size and municipality cap, subtracts the monthly own contribution and applies 73.7%.":"Lo strumento divide il reddito familiare per il peso ufficiale del nucleo familiare, calcola il contributo proprio standard dal reddito annuo ponderato, limita i costi abitativi approvati in base alle dimensioni del nucleo familiare e al limite comunale, sottrae il contributo proprio mensile e applica 73.7%.","Common questions":"Domande comuni","Is this an official award or eligibility decision?":"Si tratta di un premio ufficiale o di una decisione di idoneità?","No. It is a standard-case scenario, not an application or decision. Husbanken’s official calculator applies current eligibility limits, personal rules and the month being checked.":"N. Si tratta di uno scenario standard, non di una richiesta o di una decisione. Il calcolatore ufficiale di Husbanken applica i limiti di ammissibilità attuali, le regole personali e il mese da controllare.","What should I enter as household income?":"Cosa devo inserire come reddito familiare?","Enter the monthly household income basis used by Husbanken before household weighting. It may include taxable monthly income, reportable annual income converted to a month, applicable wealth supplement and tax-free rental income. Children’s income and several named benefits are excluded. Check Husbanken’s income guidance.":"Inserisci la base mensile del reddito familiare utilizzata da Husbanken prima della ponderazione della famiglia. Può includere il reddito mensile imponibile, il reddito annuale dichiarabile convertito in un mese, il supplemento patrimoniale applicabile e il reddito da locazione esentasse. Sono esclusi il reddito dei figli e alcune prestazioni nominate. Controlla la guida al reddito di Husbanken.","What counts as approved housing costs?":"Cosa conta come costo abitativo approvato?","Husbanken counts costs differently for renters, shared-cost housing and detached homes. Enter the amount already worked out under its current rules, not every housing bill. The result is still capped by household size and municipality.":"Husbanken calcola i costi in modo diverso per gli affittuari, gli alloggi a compartecipazione e le case unifamiliari. Inserisci l'importo già calcolato secondo le regole attuali, non tutte le fatture immobiliari. Il risultato è ancora limitato dalla dimensione del nucleo familiare e dal comune.","Does changing language change the rules?":"Cambia lingua cambia le regole?","No. This tool estimates a Norway-only 2026 scenario in every interface language.":"N. Questo strumento stima uno scenario 2026 solo per la Norvegia in ogni lingua dell'interfaccia.","Scope and limits":"Ambito e limiti","Norway only. This standard-case estimate does not decide eligibility or model the separate upper household-income limit, minimum payout, single old-age pensioner or young-disabled thresholds, special-adapted housing, transition rules, or every income and asset exception. The 2026 rates are static and must be rechecked against Husbanken. Use its official calculator for the month you are checking.":"Solo Norvegia. Questa stima del caso standard non decide l’ammissibilità né modella il limite superiore separato del reddito familiare, il pagamento minimo, le soglie per i pensionati di vecchiaia o i giovani disabili, gli alloggi appositamente adattati, le regole di transizione o ogni eccezione di reddito e patrimonio. I tassi 2026 sono statici e devono essere ricontrollati rispetto a Husbanken. Utilizza il suo calcolatore ufficiale per il mese che stai controllando.","Estimate a standard monthly scenario":"Stima uno scenario mensile standard","Norwegian rules only · standard 2026 rates · checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country or rules.":"Solo regole norvegesi · tariffe standard 2026 · controllato 17 ottobre 2026 · la lingua non cambia il paese o le regole.","Monthly household income basis before weighting, NOK":"Base del reddito familiare mensile prima della ponderazione, NOK","Use the gross monthly basis Husbanken applies, including any applicable wealth supplement and tax-free rental income. Exclude items Husbanken says do not count. See its income guide before relying on a result.":"Utilizzare la base mensile lorda applicata da Husbanken, compresi eventuali supplementi patrimoniali applicabili e redditi da locazione esentasse. Escludi gli elementi che secondo Husbanken non contano. Consulta la sua guida al reddito prima di fare affidamento su un risultato.","Monthly housing costs already approved under Husbanken rules, NOK":"Costi abitativi mensili già approvati secondo le regole Husbanken, NOK","Do not add every housing bill. Approved costs differ for rental, shared-cost and detached housing; enter the monthly amount under current Husbanken rules. A household and municipality cap is applied below.":"Non aggiungere tutte le fatture immobiliari. I costi approvati differiscono per l'affitto, la condivisione dei costi e gli alloggi unifamiliari; inserire l'importo mensile secondo le attuali regole di Husbanken. Di seguito viene applicato un limite per famiglie e comuni.","Household members aged 18 or older":"Membri del nucleo familiare di età pari o superiore a 18","Household members under 18":"Membri del nucleo familiare sotto 18","2026 municipality cap group":"2026 Gruppo limite comune","Other municipalities":"Altri Comuni","Oslo":"Oslo","Bergen, Trondheim, Tromsø, Stavanger or Bærum":"Bergen, Trondheim, Tromsø, Stavanger o Bærum","Kristiansand, Skedsmo, Frogn, Lørenskog, Nordre Follo, Asker, Nesodden, Sola or Sandnes":"Kristiansand, Skedsmo, Frogn, Lørenskog, Nordre Follo, Asker, Nesodden, Sola o Sandnes","Estimate monthly amount":"Importo mensile stimato","Clear entries":"Cancella voci","Enter the household’s monthly income basis, approved housing costs and composition.":"Inserisci la base del reddito mensile del nucleo familiare, i costi abitativi approvati e la composizione.","Scenario calculated on this device. Husbanken decides actual cases.":"Scenario calcolato su questo dispositivo. Husbanken decide i casi reali.","Entries cleared.":"Voci cancellate.","Check the monthly amounts, household counts and municipality group.":"Verifica importi mensili, conteggi dei nuclei familiari e gruppo di comuni.","Standard monthly scenario":"Scenario mensile standard","Estimated monthly housing benefit":"Beneficio abitativo mensile stimato","Monthly household income entered":"Reddito mensile del nucleo familiare inserito","Household income weight":"Peso del reddito familiare","Weighted monthly income":"Reddito mensile ponderato","Estimated monthly own contribution":"Contributo proprio mensile stimato","Approved housing costs entered":"Costi abitativi approvati inseriti","Monthly housing-cost cap":"Tetto mensile per i costi abitativi","Approved costs used after cap":"Costi approvati utilizzati dopo il limite massimo","Costs remaining after own contribution":"Costi rimanenti dopo il proprio contributo","Coverage rate":"Tasso di copertura","Assumptions used":"Presupposti utilizzati","The standard contribution thresholds and housing-cost caps use Husbanken’s 2026 rates checked 17 October 2026.":"Le soglie contributive standard e i limiti dei costi abitativi utilizzano i tassi 2026 di Husbanken controllati 17 ottobre 2026.","Estimated benefit = max(0, approved costs after cap − own contribution) × 73.7%. Weighted income uses 1.00 for the first member, 0.13 for each additional member aged 18 or older and 0.15 for each additional member under 18.":"Vantaggio stimato = max(0, costi approvati dopo il limite − contributo proprio) × 73.7%. Il reddito ponderato utilizza 1.00 per il primo membro, 0.13 per ogni membro aggiuntivo di età pari o superiore a 18 e 0.15 per ogni membro aggiuntivo sotto 18.","The entered income must already follow Husbanken’s income rules. Special thresholds, the separate household income ceiling, payout floor and personal eligibility are not calculated.":"Il reddito inserito deve già seguire le regole sul reddito di Husbanken. Non vengono calcolate le soglie speciali, il tetto del reddito familiare separato, la soglia minima di pagamento e l'ammissibilità personale.","Private, local calculation. No figures are uploaded or stored by this page.":"Calcolo privato, locale. Nessuna figura viene caricata o memorizzata da questa pagina.","Husbanken: calculation":"Husbanken: calcolo","Husbanken: income basis":"Husbanken: base reddituale","Husbanken: 2026 own-contribution rates":"Husbanken: 2026 aliquote di contributo proprio","Husbanken: 2026 housing-cost caps":"Husbanken: 2026 limiti ai costi abitativi","Open Husbanken’s official calculator":"Apri il calcolatore ufficiale di Husbanken"},"ja":{"Norway Housing Benefit Estimator":"ノルウェーの住宅給付金推定ツール","Norway Housing Benefit Calculator 2026 — Monthly Scenario":"ノルウェー住宅給付金計算ツール 2026 — 月次シナリオ","Estimate a standard monthly Norwegian housing-benefit scenario from the household income basis, approved housing costs, household size and municipality group. See the 2026 assumptions and continue to Husbanken for a current eligibility check.":"世帯収入ベース、承認された住宅費、世帯規模、自治体グループから、標準的なノルウェーの毎月の住宅給付シナリオを推定します。 2026 の前提条件を参照し、Husbanken に進み、現在の適格性チェックを行ってください。","Use this private scenario to understand how Norway’s housing-benefit formula combines approved housing costs, weighted household income and the 2026 coverage rate. The interface language never changes the Norwegian rules.":"このプライベート シナリオを使用して、ノルウェーの住宅手当計算式が承認された住宅費、加重世帯収入、2026 適用率をどのように組み合わせているかを理解します。インターフェイス言語によってノルウェーのルールが変更されることはありません。","Calculations run in this browser. Entries are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"計算はこのブラウザで実行されます。エントリは、このツールによってサーバーに送信されたり、保存されたりしません。","Example":"例","For one household member with no income and NOK 8,000 in monthly approved housing costs, the 2026 standard own contribution is about NOK 2,215 per month. The estimated benefit is about NOK 4,032 after applying the 73.7% rate.":"世帯員 1 人が無収入で、毎月承認される住宅費が NOK 8,000 の場合、2026 の標準的な自己拠出額は、月額約 NOK 2,215 です。 73.7% レートを適用した後の推定利益は約 NOK 4,032 です。","How the scenario works":"シナリオの仕組み","The tool divides household income by the official household weight, calculates the standard own contribution from weighted annual income, limits approved housing costs by the household-size and municipality cap, subtracts the monthly own contribution and applies 73.7%.":"このツールは、世帯収入を公式の世帯体重で除算し、加重年収から標準的な自己負担額を計算し、世帯規模と自治体の上限によって承認された住宅費を制限し、毎月の自己負担額を差し引いて、73.7% を適用します。","Common questions":"よくある質問","Is this an official award or eligibility decision?":"これは正式な賞または資格の決定ですか?","No. It is a standard-case scenario, not an application or decision. Husbanken’s official calculator applies current eligibility limits, personal rules and the month being checked.":"いいえ。これは標準的なシナリオであり、申請や決定ではありません。 Husbanken の公式計算ツールは、現在の資格制限、個人ルール、チェック対象月を適用します。","What should I enter as household income?":"世帯収入として何を入力すればよいですか?","Enter the monthly household income basis used by Husbanken before household weighting. It may include taxable monthly income, reportable annual income converted to a month, applicable wealth supplement and tax-free rental income. Children’s income and several named benefits are excluded. Check Husbanken’s income guidance.":"世帯の重み付けの前に Husbanken が使用する月次世帯収入ベースを入力します。これには、課税対象の月収、月に換算された報告対象の年間所得、適用される富の補足、および非課税の賃貸料収入が含まれる場合があります。子供の収入といくつかの指定給付金は除外されます。ハスバンケンの収入ガイダンスを確認してください。","What counts as approved housing costs?":"承認された住宅費としてカウントされるものは何ですか?","Husbanken counts costs differently for renters, shared-cost housing and detached homes. Enter the amount already worked out under its current rules, not every housing bill. The result is still capped by household size and municipality.":"ハスバンケンでは、賃貸人、共用住宅、戸建住宅の費用を異なる方法で数えています。すべての住宅請求書ではなく、現在の規則に基づいてすでに計算された金額を入力してください。この結果は依然として世帯人数と自治体によって制限されています。","Does changing language change the rules?":"言語を変更するとルールも変わりますか?","No. This tool estimates a Norway-only 2026 scenario in every interface language.":"いいえ。このツールは、すべてのインターフェイス言語でノルウェーのみの 2026 シナリオを推定します。","Scope and limits":"範囲と制限","Norway only. This standard-case estimate does not decide eligibility or model the separate upper household-income limit, minimum payout, single old-age pensioner or young-disabled thresholds, special-adapted housing, transition rules, or every income and asset exception. The 2026 rates are static and must be rechecked against Husbanken. Use its official calculator for the month you are checking.":"ノルウェーのみ。この標準的なケースの推計は、資格を決定したり、個別の世帯収入の上限、最低支払額、単身老齢年金受給者または若年障害者の基準値、特別に適応した住宅、移行規則、またはあらゆる収入および資産の例外をモデル化したものではありません。 2026 レートは静的であるため、Husbanken に対して再チェックする必要があります。チェックする月については、公式の計算ツールを使用してください。","Estimate a standard monthly scenario":"標準的な月次シナリオを見積もる","Norwegian rules only · standard 2026 rates · checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country or rules.":"ノルウェーのルールのみ · 標準 2026 料金 · チェック済み 17 10 月 2026 · 言語によって国やルールは変更されません。","Monthly household income basis before weighting, NOK":"加重前の世帯月収ベース、NOK","Use the gross monthly basis Husbanken applies, including any applicable wealth supplement and tax-free rental income. Exclude items Husbanken says do not count. See its income guide before relying on a result.":"該当する富の補足および非課税の賃貸収入を含む、Husbanken が適用する総月次ベースを使用します。フスバンケン氏がカウントしないと言っている項目は除外する。結果に頼る前に、収入ガイドを参照してください。","Monthly housing costs already approved under Husbanken rules, NOK":"毎月の住宅費はフスバンケン規則に基づいてすでに承認されています、NOK","Do not add every housing bill. Approved costs differ for rental, shared-cost and detached housing; enter the monthly amount under current Husbanken rules. A household and municipality cap is applied below.":"すべての住宅請求書を追加しないでください。賃貸住宅、共用費、戸建住宅では承認費用が異なります。現在のフスバンケン規則に基づいて月額を入力します。世帯および自治体の上限は以下に適用されます。","Household members aged 18 or older":"18 以上の世帯員","Household members under 18":"18 の下の世帯員","2026 municipality cap group":"2026 自治体キャップ グループ","Other municipalities":"その他の自治体","Oslo":"オスロ","Bergen, Trondheim, Tromsø, Stavanger or Bærum":"ベルゲン、トロンハイム、トロムソ、スタヴァンゲル、またはバイラム","Kristiansand, Skedsmo, Frogn, Lørenskog, Nordre Follo, Asker, Nesodden, Sola or Sandnes":"クリスチャンサン、スケズモ、フロッグン、ローレンスコグ、ノルドレ・フォッロ、アスカー、ネソッデン、ソラまたはサンドネス","Estimate monthly amount":"月額の見積もり","Clear entries":"エントリをクリア","Enter the household’s monthly income basis, approved housing costs and composition.":"世帯の月収ベース、承認された住居費、構成を入力します。","Scenario calculated on this device. Husbanken decides actual cases.":"シナリオはこのデバイスで計算されました。実際の訴訟についてはフスバンケンが判決を下す。","Entries cleared.":"エントリがクリアされました。","Check the monthly amounts, household counts and municipality group.":"月額、世帯数、市区町村グループを確認します。","Standard monthly scenario":"標準の月次シナリオ","Estimated monthly housing benefit":"毎月の住宅手当の見積もり","Monthly household income entered":"世帯月収を入力しました","Household income weight":"世帯収入の重量","Weighted monthly income":"加重月収","Estimated monthly own contribution":"毎月の自己負担額の見積もり","Approved housing costs entered":"承認された住宅費を入力しました","Monthly housing-cost cap":"毎月の住宅費の上限","Approved costs used after cap":"上限の後に使用される承認コスト","Costs remaining after own contribution":"自分の貢献後に残ったコスト","Coverage rate":"カバレッジ率","Assumptions used":"使用される仮定","The standard contribution thresholds and housing-cost caps use Husbanken’s 2026 rates checked 17 October 2026.":"標準拠出基準額と住宅費の上限は、Husbanken の 2026 レート (17 10 月 2026 でチェック) を使用します。","Estimated benefit = max(0, approved costs after cap − own contribution) × 73.7%. Weighted income uses 1.00 for the first member, 0.13 for each additional member aged 18 or older and 0.15 for each additional member under 18.":"推定利益 = 最大(0、上限後の承認コスト - 自己負担額) × 73.7%。加重収入は、最初のメンバーに 1.00、18 以上の追加メンバーごとに 0.13、18 未満の追加メンバーごとに 0.15 を使用します。","The entered income must already follow Husbanken’s income rules. Special thresholds, the separate household income ceiling, payout floor and personal eligibility are not calculated.":"入力された収入は、Husbanken の収入ルールにすでに準拠している必要があります。特別な基準値、個別の世帯収入上限、支払いの下限、および個人の資格は計算されません。","Private, local calculation. No figures are uploaded or stored by this page.":"プライベート、ローカル計算。このページでは図はアップロードまたは保存されません。","Husbanken: calculation":"フスバンケン: 計算","Husbanken: income basis":"フスバンケン: 収入ベース","Husbanken: 2026 own-contribution rates":"ハスバンケン: 2026 自己負担率","Husbanken: 2026 housing-cost caps":"ハスバンケン: 2026 住宅費の上限","Open Husbanken’s official calculator":"Husbanken の公式計算機を開く"},"ko":{"Norway Housing Benefit Estimator":"노르웨이 주택 혜택 추정기","Norway Housing Benefit Calculator 2026 — Monthly Scenario":"노르웨이 주택 혜택 계산기 2026 — 월별 시나리오","Estimate a standard monthly Norwegian housing-benefit scenario from the household income basis, approved housing costs, household size and municipality group. See the 2026 assumptions and continue to Husbanken for a current eligibility check.":"가계 소득 기준, 승인된 주택 비용, 가구 규모 및 자치단체 그룹을 기준으로 표준 월간 노르웨이 주택 혜택 시나리오를 추정합니다. 2026 가정을 확인하고 현재 자격 확인을 위해 Husbanken을 계속 진행하세요.","Use this private scenario to understand how Norway’s housing-benefit formula combines approved housing costs, weighted household income and the 2026 coverage rate. The interface language never changes the Norwegian rules.":"이 비공개 시나리오를 사용하여 노르웨이의 주택 혜택 공식이 승인된 주택 비용, 가중 가계 소득 및 2026 보장 비율을 결합하는 방법을 이해하세요. 인터페이스 언어는 노르웨이어 규칙을 결코 변경하지 않습니다.","Calculations run in this browser. Entries are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"계산은 이 브라우저에서 실행됩니다. 항목은 서버로 전송되거나 이 도구에 의해 저장되지 않습니다.","Example":"예","For one household member with no income and NOK 8,000 in monthly approved housing costs, the 2026 standard own contribution is about NOK 2,215 per month. The estimated benefit is about NOK 4,032 after applying the 73.7% rate.":"가구 구성원 중 소득이 없고 월 승인 주거 비용이 NOK 8,000인 경우 2026 표준 자체 부담금은 월 NOK 2,215입니다. 73.7% 비율을 적용한 후 예상 이익은 NOK 4,032 정도입니다.","How the scenario works":"시나리오 작동 방식","The tool divides household income by the official household weight, calculates the standard own contribution from weighted annual income, limits approved housing costs by the household-size and municipality cap, subtracts the monthly own contribution and applies 73.7%.":"이 도구는 가구 소득을 공식 가구 가중치로 나누고, 가중 연간 소득에서 표준 자체 기여금을 계산하고, 승인된 주택 비용을 가구 규모 및 지자체 한도로 제한하고, 월별 자체 기여금을 빼고 73.7%를 적용합니다.","Common questions":"일반적인 질문","Is this an official award or eligibility decision?":"이것은 공식적인 수상 또는 자격 결정입니까?","No. It is a standard-case scenario, not an application or decision. Husbanken’s official calculator applies current eligibility limits, personal rules and the month being checked.":"아니요. 이는 적용이나 결정이 아닌 표준 사례 시나리오입니다. Husbanken의 공식 계산기는 현재 자격 제한, 개인 규칙 및 확인되는 달을 적용합니다.","What should I enter as household income?":"가계 소득으로 무엇을 입력해야 합니까?","Enter the monthly household income basis used by Husbanken before household weighting. It may include taxable monthly income, reportable annual income converted to a month, applicable wealth supplement and tax-free rental income. Children’s income and several named benefits are excluded. Check Husbanken’s income guidance.":"가계 가중치 이전에 Husbanken에서 사용한 월별 가계 소득 기준을 입력하세요. 여기에는 과세 대상 월 소득, 보고 가능한 연간 소득(월로 환산), 적용 가능한 부보금 및 비과세 임대 소득이 포함될 수 있습니다. 아동 소득과 몇몇 명시된 혜택은 제외됩니다. Husbanken의 소득 가이던스를 확인하세요.","What counts as approved housing costs?":"승인된 주택 비용으로 간주되는 것은 무엇입니까?","Husbanken counts costs differently for renters, shared-cost housing and detached homes. Enter the amount already worked out under its current rules, not every housing bill. The result is still capped by household size and municipality.":"Husbanken은 임차인, 공유 비용 주택 및 단독 주택에 대해 비용을 다르게 계산합니다. 모든 주택 청구서가 아닌 현행 규정에 따라 이미 계산된 금액을 입력하세요. 결과는 여전히 가구 규모와 지방자치단체에 따라 제한됩니다.","Does changing language change the rules?":"언어를 바꾸면 규칙이 바뀌나요?","No. This tool estimates a Norway-only 2026 scenario in every interface language.":"아니요. 이 도구는 모든 인터페이스 언어에서 노르웨이 전용 2026 시나리오를 추정합니다.","Scope and limits":"범위 및 제한","Norway only. This standard-case estimate does not decide eligibility or model the separate upper household-income limit, minimum payout, single old-age pensioner or young-disabled thresholds, special-adapted housing, transition rules, or every income and asset exception. The 2026 rates are static and must be rechecked against Husbanken. Use its official calculator for the month you are checking.":"노르웨이에만 해당. 이 표준 사례 추정치는 자격을 결정하거나 별도의 가계 소득 상한선, 최소 지급액, 독신 노령 연금 수급자 또는 청년 장애 기준, 특별 조정 주택, 전환 규칙 또는 모든 소득 및 자산 예외를 모델링하지 않습니다. 2026 요율은 정적이므로 Husbanken과 비교하여 다시 확인해야 합니다. 확인하는 달의 공식 계산기를 사용하세요.","Estimate a standard monthly scenario":"표준 월별 시나리오 추정","Norwegian rules only · standard 2026 rates · checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country or rules.":"노르웨이어 규칙만 · 표준 2026 요금 · 확인됨 17 10월 2026 · 언어는 국가 또는 규칙을 변경하지 않습니다.","Monthly household income basis before weighting, NOK":"가중치 전 월 가계 소득 기준, NOK","Use the gross monthly basis Husbanken applies, including any applicable wealth supplement and tax-free rental income. Exclude items Husbanken says do not count. See its income guide before relying on a result.":"해당 부수 보충 및 비과세 임대 소득을 포함하여 Husbanken이 적용하는 총 월별 기준을 사용하세요. Husbanken이 말하는 항목은 제외하세요. 결과에 의존하기 전에 소득 가이드를 참조하세요.","Monthly housing costs already approved under Husbanken rules, NOK":"Husbanken 규칙에 따라 이미 승인된 월별 주택 비용, NOK","Do not add every housing bill. Approved costs differ for rental, shared-cost and detached housing; enter the monthly amount under current Husbanken rules. A household and municipality cap is applied below.":"모든 주택 청구서를 추가하지 마십시오. 승인된 비용은 임대, 공동 비용 및 단독 주택에 따라 다릅니다. 현재 Husbanken 규칙에 따라 월별 금액을 입력하세요. 아래에는 가구 및 지방자치단체 한도가 적용됩니다.","Household members aged 18 or older":"18세 이상 가구 구성원","Household members under 18":"18 미만의 가구 구성원","2026 municipality cap group":"2026 자치단체 캡 그룹","Other municipalities":"기타 자치단체","Oslo":"오슬로","Bergen, Trondheim, Tromsø, Stavanger or Bærum":"베르겐, 트론헤임, 트롬쇠, 스타방에르 또는 배룸","Kristiansand, Skedsmo, Frogn, Lørenskog, Nordre Follo, Asker, Nesodden, Sola or Sandnes":"Kristiansand, Skedsmo, Frogn, Lørenskog, Nordre Follo, Asker, Nesodden, Sola 또는 Sandnes","Estimate monthly amount":"예상 월별 금액","Clear entries":"항목 지우기","Enter the household’s monthly income basis, approved housing costs and composition.":"가구의 월 소득 기준, 승인된 주택 비용 및 구성을 입력하세요.","Scenario calculated on this device. Husbanken decides actual cases.":"이 장치에서 계산된 시나리오입니다. Husbanken은 실제 사례를 결정합니다.","Entries cleared.":"항목이 삭제되었습니다.","Check the monthly amounts, household counts and municipality group.":"월별 금액, 가구 수 및 지자체 그룹을 확인하세요.","Standard monthly scenario":"표준 월별 시나리오","Estimated monthly housing benefit":"예상 월별 주택 혜택","Monthly household income entered":"월 가계 소득 입력됨","Household income weight":"가계소득 가중치","Weighted monthly income":"가중 월 소득","Estimated monthly own contribution":"예상 월별 자체 기여도","Approved housing costs entered":"승인된 주택 비용이 입력되었습니다.","Monthly housing-cost cap":"월 주거비 한도","Approved costs used after cap":"한도 이후 사용된 비용 승인","Costs remaining after own contribution":"자체 기여 후 남은 비용","Coverage rate":"커버리지 비율","Assumptions used":"사용된 가정","The standard contribution thresholds and housing-cost caps use Husbanken’s 2026 rates checked 17 October 2026.":"표준 기여 임계값 및 주택 비용 상한은 Husbanken의 2026 요율 확인 17 10월 2026를 사용합니다.","Estimated benefit = max(0, approved costs after cap − own contribution) × 73.7%. Weighted income uses 1.00 for the first member, 0.13 for each additional member aged 18 or older and 0.15 for each additional member under 18.":"예상 이익 = 최대(0, 한도 후 승인 비용 − 자체 기여) × 73.7%. 가중 소득은 첫 번째 구성원에 대해 1.00를 사용하고, 18세 이상인 각 추가 구성원에 대해 0.13를 사용하며, 18 아래의 각 추가 구성원에 대해 0.15를 사용합니다.","The entered income must already follow Husbanken’s income rules. Special thresholds, the separate household income ceiling, payout floor and personal eligibility are not calculated.":"입력된 소득은 이미 Husbanken의 소득 규칙을 따라야 합니다. 특별 한도, 별도 가구 소득 한도, 지급 하한선, 개인 자격은 계산되지 않습니다.","Private, local calculation. No figures are uploaded or stored by this page.":"비공개, 로컬 계산. 이 페이지에는 그림이 업로드되거나 저장되지 않습니다.","Husbanken: calculation":"Husbanken: 계산","Husbanken: income basis":"Husbanken: 소득 기준","Husbanken: 2026 own-contribution rates":"Husbanken: 2026 자체 기여율","Husbanken: 2026 housing-cost caps":"Husbanken: 2026 주택 비용 한도","Open Husbanken’s official calculator":"Husbanken 공식 계산기 열기"},"mr":{"Norway Housing Benefit Estimator":"नॉर्वे हाऊसिंग बेनिफिट एस्टिमेटर","Norway Housing Benefit Calculator 2026 — Monthly Scenario":"नॉर्वे हाउसिंग बेनिफिट कॅल्क्युलेटर 2026 — मासिक परिस्थिती","Estimate a standard monthly Norwegian housing-benefit scenario from the household income basis, approved housing costs, household size and municipality group. See the 2026 assumptions and continue to Husbanken for a current eligibility check.":"कौटुंबिक उत्पन्नाच्या आधारावर, मंजूर घरांच्या किंमती, घराचा आकार आणि नगरपालिका गट यावरून मानक मासिक नॉर्वेजियन गृहनिर्माण-लाभ परिस्थितीचा अंदाज लावा. 2026 गृहीतके पहा आणि वर्तमान पात्रता तपासणीसाठी Husbanken वर जा.","Use this private scenario to understand how Norway’s housing-benefit formula combines approved housing costs, weighted household income and the 2026 coverage rate. The interface language never changes the Norwegian rules.":"नॉर्वेचे गृहनिर्माण-लाभ सूत्र मंजूर गृहनिर्माण खर्च, भारित घरगुती उत्पन्न आणि 2026 कव्हरेज दर कसे एकत्र करते हे समजून घेण्यासाठी या खाजगी परिस्थितीचा वापर करा. इंटरफेस भाषा कधीही नॉर्वेजियन नियम बदलत नाही.","Calculations run in this browser. Entries are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"गणना या ब्राउझरमध्ये चालतात. नोंदी सर्व्हरवर पाठवल्या जात नाहीत किंवा या साधनाद्वारे जतन केल्या जात नाहीत.","Example":"उदाहरण","For one household member with no income and NOK 8,000 in monthly approved housing costs, the 2026 standard own contribution is about NOK 2,215 per month. The estimated benefit is about NOK 4,032 after applying the 73.7% rate.":"उत्पन्न नसलेल्या कुटुंबातील एका सदस्यासाठी आणि मासिक मंजूर घरांच्या खर्चामध्ये NOK 8,000, 2026 मानक स्वतःचे योगदान प्रति महिना सुमारे NOK 2,215 आहे. 73.7% दर लागू केल्यानंतर अंदाजे लाभ NOK 4,032 आहे.","How the scenario works":"परिदृश्य कसे कार्य करते","The tool divides household income by the official household weight, calculates the standard own contribution from weighted annual income, limits approved housing costs by the household-size and municipality cap, subtracts the monthly own contribution and applies 73.7%.":"टूल अधिकृत कौटुंबिक वजनानुसार घरगुती उत्पन्नाची विभागणी करते, भारित वार्षिक उत्पन्नातून मानक स्वत:च्या योगदानाची गणना करते, घरगुती आकार आणि नगरपालिका कॅपद्वारे मंजूर गृहनिर्माण खर्च मर्यादित करते, मासिक स्वतःचे योगदान वजा करते आणि 73.7% लागू करते.","Common questions":"सामान्य प्रश्न","Is this an official award or eligibility decision?":"हा अधिकृत पुरस्कार किंवा पात्रता निर्णय आहे का?","No. It is a standard-case scenario, not an application or decision. Husbanken’s official calculator applies current eligibility limits, personal rules and the month being checked.":"नं. हे एक मानक-केस परिस्थिती आहे, अर्ज किंवा निर्णय नाही. Husbanken चे अधिकृत कॅल्क्युलेटर सध्याच्या पात्रता मर्यादा, वैयक्तिक नियम आणि तपासला जात असलेला महिना लागू करतो.","What should I enter as household income?":"घरगुती उत्पन्न म्हणून मी काय प्रविष्ट करावे?","Enter the monthly household income basis used by Husbanken before household weighting. It may include taxable monthly income, reportable annual income converted to a month, applicable wealth supplement and tax-free rental income. Children’s income and several named benefits are excluded. Check Husbanken’s income guidance.":"कौटुंबिक भारनियमनापूर्वी Husbanken द्वारे वापरलेला मासिक घरगुती उत्पन्नाचा आधार प्रविष्ट करा. यात करपात्र मासिक उत्पन्न, एका महिन्यात रूपांतरित केलेले अहवाल करण्यायोग्य वार्षिक उत्पन्न, लागू संपत्ती पूरक आणि करमुक्त भाड्याचे उत्पन्न यांचा समावेश असू शकतो. मुलांचे उत्पन्न आणि अनेक नामांकित फायदे वगळले आहेत. Husbanken चे उत्पन्न मार्गदर्शन तपासा.","What counts as approved housing costs?":"मंजूर गृहनिर्माण खर्च म्हणून काय मोजले जाते?","Husbanken counts costs differently for renters, shared-cost housing and detached homes. Enter the amount already worked out under its current rules, not every housing bill. The result is still capped by household size and municipality.":"Husbanken भाड्याने देणाऱ्या, सामायिक-किंमत गृहनिर्माण आणि विलग घरांसाठी खर्च वेगळ्या पद्धतीने मोजतो. सध्याच्या नियमांनुसार आधीच तयार केलेली रक्कम एंटर करा, प्रत्येक गृहनिर्माण बिल नाही. परिणाम अद्याप घरगुती आकार आणि नगरपालिकेद्वारे मर्यादित आहे.","Does changing language change the rules?":"भाषा बदलल्याने नियम बदलतात का?","No. This tool estimates a Norway-only 2026 scenario in every interface language.":"नं. हे साधन प्रत्येक इंटरफेस भाषेमध्ये नॉर्वे-केवळ 2026 परिस्थितीचा अंदाज लावते.","Scope and limits":"व्याप्ति आणि मर्यादा","Norway only. This standard-case estimate does not decide eligibility or model the separate upper household-income limit, minimum payout, single old-age pensioner or young-disabled thresholds, special-adapted housing, transition rules, or every income and asset exception. The 2026 rates are static and must be rechecked against Husbanken. Use its official calculator for the month you are checking.":"फक्त नॉर्वे. हा मानक-प्रकरण अंदाज पात्रता ठरवत नाही किंवा स्वतंत्र उच्च घरगुती-उत्पन्न मर्यादा, किमान पेआउट, एकल वृद्ध-पेन्शनर किंवा तरुण-अपंग थ्रेशोल्ड, विशेष-अनुकूलित गृहनिर्माण, संक्रमण नियम किंवा प्रत्येक उत्पन्न आणि मालमत्ता अपवाद ठरवत नाही. 2026 दर स्थिर आहेत आणि Husbanken विरुद्ध पुन्हा तपासले जाणे आवश्यक आहे. तुम्ही तपासत असलेल्या महिन्यासाठी त्याचे अधिकृत कॅल्क्युलेटर वापरा.","Estimate a standard monthly scenario":"मानक मासिक परिस्थितीचा अंदाज लावा","Norwegian rules only · standard 2026 rates · checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country or rules.":"केवळ नॉर्वेजियन नियम · मानक 2026 दर · चेक केलेले 17 ऑक्टोबर 2026 · भाषा देश किंवा नियम बदलत नाही.","Monthly household income basis before weighting, NOK":"वेटिंग करण्यापूर्वी मासिक घरगुती उत्पन्नाचा आधार, NOK","Use the gross monthly basis Husbanken applies, including any applicable wealth supplement and tax-free rental income. Exclude items Husbanken says do not count. See its income guide before relying on a result.":"कोणत्याही लागू संपत्ती पुरवणी आणि करमुक्त भाड्याने मिळणाऱ्या उत्पन्नासह Husbanken लागू होणारा सकल मासिक आधार वापरा. वगळा आयटम Husbanken म्हणतात मोजू नका. निकालावर अवलंबून राहण्यापूर्वी त्याचे उत्पन्न मार्गदर्शक पहा.","Monthly housing costs already approved under Husbanken rules, NOK":"हसबँकेन नियम, NOK अंतर्गत मासिक गृहनिर्माण खर्च आधीच मंजूर","Do not add every housing bill. Approved costs differ for rental, shared-cost and detached housing; enter the monthly amount under current Husbanken rules. A household and municipality cap is applied below.":"प्रत्येक घरांचे बिल जोडू नका. भाडे, सामायिक-किंमत आणि विलग घरांसाठी मंजूर खर्च भिन्न आहेत; वर्तमान Husbanken नियमांनुसार मासिक रक्कम प्रविष्ट करा. खाली घरगुती आणि नगरपालिका कॅप लागू केली आहे.","Household members aged 18 or older":"18 किंवा त्याहून अधिक वयाचे घरगुती सदस्य","Household members under 18":"18 अंतर्गत घरातील सदस्य","2026 municipality cap group":"2026 नगरपालिका टोपी गट","Other municipalities":"इतर नगरपालिका","Oslo":"ओस्लो","Bergen, Trondheim, Tromsø, Stavanger or Bærum":"बर्गेन, ट्रॉन्डहाइम, ट्रोम्स, स्टॅव्हेंजर किंवा बेरम","Kristiansand, Skedsmo, Frogn, Lørenskog, Nordre Follo, Asker, Nesodden, Sola or Sandnes":"Kristiansand, Skedsmo, Frogn, Lørenskog, Nordre Follo, Asker, Nesodden, Sola or Sandnes","Estimate monthly amount":"मासिक रकमेचा अंदाज लावा","Clear entries":"प्रविष्टी साफ करा","Enter the household’s monthly income basis, approved housing costs and composition.":"कुटुंबाचा मासिक उत्पन्नाचा आधार, मंजूर गृहनिर्माण खर्च आणि रचना प्रविष्ट करा.","Scenario calculated on this device. Husbanken decides actual cases.":"या डिव्हाइसवर गणना केलेली परिस्थिती. हसबँकेन वास्तविक केसेस ठरवतात.","Entries cleared.":"प्रविष्टी साफ केल्या.","Check the monthly amounts, household counts and municipality group.":"मासिक रक्कम, घरगुती संख्या आणि नगरपालिका गट तपासा.","Standard monthly scenario":"मानक मासिक परिस्थिती","Estimated monthly housing benefit":"अंदाजित मासिक गृहनिर्माण लाभ","Monthly household income entered":"मासिक घरगुती उत्पन्न प्रविष्ट केले","Household income weight":"घरगुती उत्पन्नाचे वजन","Weighted monthly income":"भारित मासिक उत्पन्न","Estimated monthly own contribution":"अंदाजित मासिक स्वतःचे योगदान","Approved housing costs entered":"मंजूर गृहनिर्माण खर्च प्रविष्ट केला","Monthly housing-cost cap":"मासिक गृहनिर्माण-खर्च कॅप","Approved costs used after cap":"कॅप नंतर वापरलेले मंजूर खर्च","Costs remaining after own contribution":"स्वतःच्या योगदानानंतर शिल्लक खर्च","Coverage rate":"कव्हरेज दर","Assumptions used":"गृहीतके वापरली","The standard contribution thresholds and housing-cost caps use Husbanken’s 2026 rates checked 17 October 2026.":"मानक योगदान थ्रेशोल्ड आणि गृहनिर्माण-खर्च कॅप्स Husbanken चे 2026 दर तपासलेले 17 ऑक्टोबर 2026 वापरतात.","Estimated benefit = max(0, approved costs after cap − own contribution) × 73.7%. Weighted income uses 1.00 for the first member, 0.13 for each additional member aged 18 or older and 0.15 for each additional member under 18.":"अंदाजित लाभ = कमाल(0, कॅप − स्वतःच्या योगदानानंतर मंजूर खर्च) × 73.7%. भारित उत्पन्न पहिल्या सदस्यासाठी 1.00, 18 किंवा त्याहून अधिक वयाच्या प्रत्येक अतिरिक्त सदस्यासाठी 0.13 आणि 18 अंतर्गत प्रत्येक अतिरिक्त सदस्यासाठी 0.15 वापरते.","The entered income must already follow Husbanken’s income rules. Special thresholds, the separate household income ceiling, payout floor and personal eligibility are not calculated.":"प्रविष्ट केलेल्या उत्पन्नाने आधीच Husbanken च्या उत्पन्न नियमांचे पालन केले पाहिजे. विशेष थ्रेशोल्ड, स्वतंत्र घरगुती उत्पन्न कमाल मर्यादा, पेआउट फ्लोअर आणि वैयक्तिक पात्रता मोजली जात नाही.","Private, local calculation. No figures are uploaded or stored by this page.":"खाजगी, स्थानिक गणना. या पृष्ठाद्वारे कोणतेही आकडे अपलोड किंवा संग्रहित केलेले नाहीत.","Husbanken: calculation":"Husbanken: गणना","Husbanken: income basis":"Husbanken: उत्पन्नाचा आधार","Husbanken: 2026 own-contribution rates":"Husbanken: 2026 स्वतःचे योगदान दर","Husbanken: 2026 housing-cost caps":"Husbanken: 2026 गृहनिर्माण-खर्च कॅप्स","Open Husbanken’s official calculator":"Husbanken चे अधिकृत कॅल्क्युलेटर उघडा"},"ms":{"Norway Housing Benefit Estimator":"Penganggar Faedah Perumahan Norway","Norway Housing Benefit Calculator 2026 — Monthly Scenario":"Kalkulator Faedah Perumahan Norway 2026 — Senario Bulanan","Estimate a standard monthly Norwegian housing-benefit scenario from the household income basis, approved housing costs, household size and municipality group. See the 2026 assumptions and continue to Husbanken for a current eligibility check.":"Anggarkan senario faedah perumahan Norway bulanan standard daripada asas pendapatan isi rumah, kos perumahan yang diluluskan, saiz isi rumah dan kumpulan perbandaran. Lihat andaian 2026 dan teruskan ke Husbanken untuk semakan kelayakan semasa.","Use this private scenario to understand how Norway’s housing-benefit formula combines approved housing costs, weighted household income and the 2026 coverage rate. The interface language never changes the Norwegian rules.":"Gunakan senario peribadi ini untuk memahami cara formula faedah perumahan Norway menggabungkan kos perumahan yang diluluskan, pendapatan isi rumah berwajaran dan kadar perlindungan 2026. Bahasa antara muka tidak pernah mengubah peraturan Norway.","Calculations run in this browser. Entries are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"Pengiraan dijalankan dalam penyemak imbas ini. Entri tidak dihantar ke pelayan atau disimpan oleh alat ini.","Example":"Contoh","For one household member with no income and NOK 8,000 in monthly approved housing costs, the 2026 standard own contribution is about NOK 2,215 per month. The estimated benefit is about NOK 4,032 after applying the 73.7% rate.":"Untuk seorang ahli isi rumah tanpa pendapatan dan NOK 8,000 dalam kos perumahan yang diluluskan bulanan, sumbangan sendiri standard 2026 ialah kira-kira NOK 2,215 sebulan. Anggaran faedah adalah kira-kira NOK 4,032 selepas menggunakan kadar 73.7%.","How the scenario works":"Cara senario berfungsi","The tool divides household income by the official household weight, calculates the standard own contribution from weighted annual income, limits approved housing costs by the household-size and municipality cap, subtracts the monthly own contribution and applies 73.7%.":"Alat membahagikan pendapatan isi rumah dengan berat isi rumah rasmi, mengira sumbangan standard sendiri daripada pendapatan tahunan berwajaran, mengehadkan kos perumahan yang diluluskan mengikut saiz isi rumah dan had perbandaran, menolak sumbangan bulanan sendiri dan menggunakan 73.7%.","Common questions":"Soalan biasa","Is this an official award or eligibility decision?":"Adakah ini anugerah rasmi atau keputusan kelayakan?","No. It is a standard-case scenario, not an application or decision. Husbanken’s official calculator applies current eligibility limits, personal rules and the month being checked.":"No. Ia adalah senario kes standard, bukan permohonan atau keputusan. Kalkulator rasmi Husbanken menggunakan had kelayakan semasa, peraturan peribadi dan bulan yang diperiksa.","What should I enter as household income?":"Apakah yang perlu saya masukkan sebagai pendapatan isi rumah?","Enter the monthly household income basis used by Husbanken before household weighting. It may include taxable monthly income, reportable annual income converted to a month, applicable wealth supplement and tax-free rental income. Children’s income and several named benefits are excluded. Check Husbanken’s income guidance.":"Masukkan asas pendapatan isi rumah bulanan yang digunakan oleh Husbanken sebelum wajaran isi rumah. Ia mungkin termasuk pendapatan bulanan bercukai, pendapatan tahunan boleh dilaporkan yang ditukar kepada sebulan, tambahan kekayaan terpakai dan pendapatan sewa tanpa cukai. Pendapatan kanak-kanak dan beberapa faedah dinamakan dikecualikan. Semak panduan pendapatan Husbanken.","What counts as approved housing costs?":"Apakah yang dikira sebagai kos perumahan yang diluluskan?","Husbanken counts costs differently for renters, shared-cost housing and detached homes. Enter the amount already worked out under its current rules, not every housing bill. The result is still capped by household size and municipality.":"Husbanken mengira kos secara berbeza untuk penyewa, perumahan kos kongsi dan rumah berasingan. Masukkan jumlah yang telah ditetapkan di bawah peraturan semasanya, bukan setiap bil perumahan. Hasilnya masih dihadkan oleh saiz isi rumah dan perbandaran.","Does changing language change the rules?":"Adakah menukar bahasa mengubah peraturan?","No. This tool estimates a Norway-only 2026 scenario in every interface language.":"No. Alat ini menganggarkan senario 2026 Norway sahaja dalam setiap bahasa antara muka.","Scope and limits":"Skop dan had","Norway only. This standard-case estimate does not decide eligibility or model the separate upper household-income limit, minimum payout, single old-age pensioner or young-disabled thresholds, special-adapted housing, transition rules, or every income and asset exception. The 2026 rates are static and must be rechecked against Husbanken. Use its official calculator for the month you are checking.":"Norway sahaja. Anggaran kes standard ini tidak menentukan kelayakan atau memodelkan had pendapatan isi rumah atas yang berasingan, pembayaran minimum, pesara tua tunggal atau ambang kurang upaya muda, perumahan yang disesuaikan khas, peraturan peralihan atau setiap pengecualian pendapatan dan aset. Kadar 2026 adalah statik dan mesti disemak semula terhadap Husbanken. Gunakan kalkulator rasminya untuk bulan yang anda semak.","Estimate a standard monthly scenario":"Anggarkan senario bulanan standard","Norwegian rules only · standard 2026 rates · checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country or rules.":"Peraturan Norway sahaja · kadar 2026 standard · disemak 17 Oktober 2026 · bahasa tidak mengubah negara atau peraturan.","Monthly household income basis before weighting, NOK":"Asas pendapatan isi rumah bulanan sebelum wajaran, NOK","Use the gross monthly basis Husbanken applies, including any applicable wealth supplement and tax-free rental income. Exclude items Husbanken says do not count. See its income guide before relying on a result.":"Gunakan asas bulanan kasar yang digunakan oleh Husbanken, termasuk sebarang tambahan kekayaan yang berkenaan dan pendapatan sewa tanpa cukai. Kecualikan item yang Husbanken kata jangan dikira. Lihat panduan pendapatannya sebelum bergantung pada hasil.","Monthly housing costs already approved under Husbanken rules, NOK":"Kos perumahan bulanan telah diluluskan di bawah peraturan Husbanken, NOK","Do not add every housing bill. Approved costs differ for rental, shared-cost and detached housing; enter the monthly amount under current Husbanken rules. A household and municipality cap is applied below.":"Jangan tambah setiap bil perumahan. Kos yang diluluskan berbeza untuk sewaan, kos bersama dan perumahan berasingan; masukkan amaun bulanan di bawah peraturan Husbanken semasa. Topi isi rumah dan perbandaran digunakan di bawah.","Household members aged 18 or older":"Ahli isi rumah berumur 18 atau lebih tua","Household members under 18":"Ahli isi rumah di bawah 18","2026 municipality cap group":"2026 kumpulan topi perbandaran","Other municipalities":"Perbandaran lain","Oslo":"Oslo","Bergen, Trondheim, Tromsø, Stavanger or Bærum":"Bergen, Trondheim, Tromsø, Stavanger atau Bærum","Kristiansand, Skedsmo, Frogn, Lørenskog, Nordre Follo, Asker, Nesodden, Sola or Sandnes":"Kristiansand, Skedsmo, Frogn, Lørenskog, Nordre Follo, Asker, Nesodden, Sola atau Sandnes","Estimate monthly amount":"Anggaran amaun bulanan","Clear entries":"Kosongkan entri","Enter the household’s monthly income basis, approved housing costs and composition.":"Masukkan asas pendapatan bulanan isi rumah, kos perumahan yang diluluskan dan komposisi.","Scenario calculated on this device. Husbanken decides actual cases.":"Senario dikira pada peranti ini. Husbanken memutuskan kes sebenar.","Entries cleared.":"Entri dikosongkan.","Check the monthly amounts, household counts and municipality group.":"Semak amaun bulanan, kiraan isi rumah dan kumpulan perbandaran.","Standard monthly scenario":"Senario bulanan standard","Estimated monthly housing benefit":"Anggaran faedah perumahan bulanan","Monthly household income entered":"Pendapatan isi rumah bulanan dimasukkan","Household income weight":"Berat pendapatan isi rumah","Weighted monthly income":"Pendapatan bulanan berwajaran","Estimated monthly own contribution":"Anggaran sumbangan bulanan sendiri","Approved housing costs entered":"Kos perumahan yang diluluskan telah dimasukkan","Monthly housing-cost cap":"Had kos perumahan bulanan","Approved costs used after cap":"Kos yang diluluskan digunakan selepas had","Costs remaining after own contribution":"Baki kos selepas sumbangan sendiri","Coverage rate":"Kadar perlindungan","Assumptions used":"Andaian yang digunakan","The standard contribution thresholds and housing-cost caps use Husbanken’s 2026 rates checked 17 October 2026.":"Ambang sumbangan standard dan had kos perumahan menggunakan kadar 2026 Husbanken yang disemak 17 Oktober 2026.","Estimated benefit = max(0, approved costs after cap − own contribution) × 73.7%. Weighted income uses 1.00 for the first member, 0.13 for each additional member aged 18 or older and 0.15 for each additional member under 18.":"Anggaran faedah = maks(0, kos diluluskan selepas had − sumbangan sendiri) × 73.7%. Pendapatan wajaran menggunakan 1.00 untuk ahli pertama, 0.13 untuk setiap ahli tambahan berumur 18 atau lebih tua dan 0.15 untuk setiap ahli tambahan di bawah 18.","The entered income must already follow Husbanken’s income rules. Special thresholds, the separate household income ceiling, payout floor and personal eligibility are not calculated.":"Pendapatan yang dimasukkan mesti sudah mengikut peraturan pendapatan Husbanken. Ambang khas, siling pendapatan isi rumah yang berasingan, tingkat pembayaran dan kelayakan peribadi tidak dikira.","Private, local calculation. No figures are uploaded or stored by this page.":"Pengiraan peribadi, tempatan. Tiada angka dimuat naik atau disimpan oleh halaman ini.","Husbanken: calculation":"Husbanken: pengiraan","Husbanken: income basis":"Husbanken: asas pendapatan","Husbanken: 2026 own-contribution rates":"Husbanken: 2026 kadar sumbangan sendiri","Husbanken: 2026 housing-cost caps":"Husbanken: 2026 had kos perumahan","Open Husbanken’s official calculator":"Open Husbanken kalkulator rasmi"},"nb":{"Norway Housing Benefit Estimator":"Norge Boligstøtte Estimator","Norway Housing Benefit Calculator 2026 — Monthly Scenario":"Norge Bostøttekalkulator 2026 — Månedsscenario","Estimate a standard monthly Norwegian housing-benefit scenario from the household income basis, approved housing costs, household size and municipality group. See the 2026 assumptions and continue to Husbanken for a current eligibility check.":"Beregn et standard månedlig norsk bostøttescenario ut fra husholdningsinntektsgrunnlaget, godkjente bokostnader, husholdningsstørrelse og kommunegruppe. Se 2026-forutsetningene og fortsett til Husbanken for en aktuell kvalifikasjonssjekk.","Use this private scenario to understand how Norway’s housing-benefit formula combines approved housing costs, weighted household income and the 2026 coverage rate. The interface language never changes the Norwegian rules.":"Bruk dette private scenariet for å forstå hvordan Norges bostøtteformel kombinerer godkjente boligkostnader, vektet husholdningsinntekt og dekningsgraden 2026. Grensesnittspråket endrer aldri de norske reglene.","Calculations run in this browser. Entries are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"Beregninger kjøres i denne nettleseren. Oppføringer sendes ikke til en server eller lagres av dette verktøyet.","Example":"Eksempel","For one household member with no income and NOK 8,000 in monthly approved housing costs, the 2026 standard own contribution is about NOK 2,215 per month. The estimated benefit is about NOK 4,032 after applying the 73.7% rate.":"For ett husstandsmedlem uten inntekt og NOK 8,000 i månedlige godkjente bokostnader, er 2026 standard eget bidrag ca NOK 2,215 per måned. Den estimerte fordelen er ca NOK 4,032 etter bruk av 73.7 %-satsen.","How the scenario works":"Hvordan scenariet fungerer","The tool divides household income by the official household weight, calculates the standard own contribution from weighted annual income, limits approved housing costs by the household-size and municipality cap, subtracts the monthly own contribution and applies 73.7%.":"Verktøyet deler husholdningsinntekten på den offisielle husholdningsvekten, beregner standard eget bidrag fra vektet årsinntekt, begrenser godkjente bokostnader med husholdningsstørrelse og kommunegrense, trekker fra det månedlige eget bidrag og bruker 73.7%.","Common questions":"Vanlige spørsmål","Is this an official award or eligibility decision?":"Er dette en offisiell tildeling eller valgbarhetsbeslutning?","No. It is a standard-case scenario, not an application or decision. Husbanken’s official calculator applies current eligibility limits, personal rules and the month being checked.":"Nr. Det er et standardscenario, ikke en søknad eller vedtak. Husbankens offisielle kalkulator bruker gjeldende valgbarhetsgrenser, personlige regler og måneden som kontrolleres.","What should I enter as household income?":"Hva skal jeg angi som husholdningsinntekt?","Enter the monthly household income basis used by Husbanken before household weighting. It may include taxable monthly income, reportable annual income converted to a month, applicable wealth supplement and tax-free rental income. Children’s income and several named benefits are excluded. Check Husbanken’s income guidance.":"Skriv inn månedlig husholdningsinntektsgrunnlag Husbanken bruker før husholdningsvekting. Det kan omfatte skattepliktig månedsinntekt, rapporteringspliktig årsinntekt omregnet til en måned, gjeldende formuetillegg og skattefrie leieinntekter. Barns inntekt og flere navngitte ytelser er ekskludert. Sjekk Husbankens inntektsveiledning.","What counts as approved housing costs?":"Hva teller som godkjente bokostnader?","Husbanken counts costs differently for renters, shared-cost housing and detached homes. Enter the amount already worked out under its current rules, not every housing bill. The result is still capped by household size and municipality.":"Husbanken regner kostnader ulikt for leietakere, bodelinger og eneboliger. Skriv inn beløpet som allerede er utarbeidet under gjeldende regler, ikke hver boligregning. Resultatet er fortsatt begrenset av husholdningsstørrelse og kommune.","Does changing language change the rules?":"Endres reglene ved å endre språk?","No. This tool estimates a Norway-only 2026 scenario in every interface language.":"Nr. Dette verktøyet estimerer et 2026-scenario kun for Norge i hvert grensesnittspråk.","Scope and limits":"Omfang og begrensninger","Norway only. This standard-case estimate does not decide eligibility or model the separate upper household-income limit, minimum payout, single old-age pensioner or young-disabled thresholds, special-adapted housing, transition rules, or every income and asset exception. The 2026 rates are static and must be rechecked against Husbanken. Use its official calculator for the month you are checking.":"Kun Norge. Dette standard-case-estimatet bestemmer ikke kvalifisering eller modellerer den separate øvre husholdningsinntektsgrensen, minimumsutbetalingen, terskler for enslig alderspensjonist eller unge funksjonshemmede, spesialtilpassede boliger, overgangsregler eller alle unntak av inntekt og formue. 2026-kursene er statiske og må kontrolleres på nytt mot Husbanken. Bruk den offisielle kalkulatoren for måneden du sjekker.","Estimate a standard monthly scenario":"Beregn et standard månedlig scenario","Norwegian rules only · standard 2026 rates · checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country or rules.":"kun norske regler · standard 2026-priser · sjekket 17 oktober 2026 · språk endrer ikke land eller regler.","Monthly household income basis before weighting, NOK":"Månedlig husholdningsinntektsgrunnlag før vekting, kr","Use the gross monthly basis Husbanken applies, including any applicable wealth supplement and tax-free rental income. Exclude items Husbanken says do not count. See its income guide before relying on a result.":"Benytt brutto månedsgrunnlag Husbanken gjelder, inkludert eventuelt gjeldende formuetillegg og skattefrie leieinntekter. Ekskluder varer Husbanken sier ikke teller. Se inntektsguiden før du stoler på et resultat.","Monthly housing costs already approved under Husbanken rules, NOK":"Månedlige bokostnader allerede godkjent etter Husbankens regler, kr","Do not add every housing bill. Approved costs differ for rental, shared-cost and detached housing; enter the monthly amount under current Husbanken rules. A household and municipality cap is applied below.":"Ikke legg til hver boligregning. Godkjente kostnader er forskjellige for utleie, delt kostnad og enebolig; oppgi månedsbeløpet etter gjeldende Husbanken-regler. Nedenfor er det satt på et husstands- og kommunetak.","Household members aged 18 or older":"Husstandsmedlemmer på 18 eller eldre","Household members under 18":"Husstandsmedlemmer under 18","2026 municipality cap group":"2026 kommunehettegruppe","Other municipalities":"Andre kommuner","Oslo":"Oslo","Bergen, Trondheim, Tromsø, Stavanger or Bærum":"Bergen, Trondheim, Tromsø, Stavanger eller Bærum","Kristiansand, Skedsmo, Frogn, Lørenskog, Nordre Follo, Asker, Nesodden, Sola or Sandnes":"Kristiansand, Skedsmo, Frogn, Lørenskog, Nordre Follo, Asker, Nesodden, Sola eller Sandnes","Estimate monthly amount":"Estimer månedlig beløp","Clear entries":"Slett oppføringer","Enter the household’s monthly income basis, approved housing costs and composition.":"Skriv inn husstandens månedlige inntektsgrunnlag, godkjente bokostnader og sammensetning.","Scenario calculated on this device. Husbanken decides actual cases.":"Scenario beregnet på denne enheten. Husbanken avgjør faktiske saker.","Entries cleared.":"Oppføringer slettet.","Check the monthly amounts, household counts and municipality group.":"Sjekk månedlige beløp, husstandstall og kommunegruppe.","Standard monthly scenario":"Standard månedlig scenario","Estimated monthly housing benefit":"Estimert månedlig bostøtte","Monthly household income entered":"Månedlig husholdningsinntekt lagt inn","Household income weight":"Husholdningsinntektsvekt","Weighted monthly income":"Vektet månedlig inntekt","Estimated monthly own contribution":"Estimert månedlig eget bidrag","Approved housing costs entered":"Godkjente bokostnader lagt inn","Monthly housing-cost cap":"Månedlig boligkostnadstak","Approved costs used after cap":"Godkjente kostnader brukt etter tak","Costs remaining after own contribution":"Resterende kostnader etter eget bidrag","Coverage rate":"Dekningsgrad","Assumptions used":"Forutsetninger brukt","The standard contribution thresholds and housing-cost caps use Husbanken’s 2026 rates checked 17 October 2026.":"Standard bidragsterskler og boligkostnadstak bruker Husbankens 2026-satser kontrollert 17 oktober 2026.","Estimated benefit = max(0, approved costs after cap − own contribution) × 73.7%. Weighted income uses 1.00 for the first member, 0.13 for each additional member aged 18 or older and 0.15 for each additional member under 18.":"Estimert nytte = maks(0, godkjente kostnader etter tak − eget bidrag) × 73.7%. Vektet inntekt bruker 1.00 for det første medlemmet, 0.13 for hvert ekstra medlem på 18 eller eldre og 0.15 for hvert ekstra medlem under 18.","The entered income must already follow Husbanken’s income rules. Special thresholds, the separate household income ceiling, payout floor and personal eligibility are not calculated.":"Den innførte inntekten skal allerede følge Husbankens inntektsregler. Spesielle terskler, det separate husholdningsinntektstaket, utbetalingsgulvet og personlig berettigelse beregnes ikke.","Private, local calculation. No figures are uploaded or stored by this page.":"Privat, lokal beregning. Ingen tall er lastet opp eller lagret av denne siden.","Husbanken: calculation":"Husbanken: utregning","Husbanken: income basis":"Husbanken: inntektsgrunnlag","Husbanken: 2026 own-contribution rates":"Husbanken: 2026 egne bidragssatser","Husbanken: 2026 housing-cost caps":"Husbanken: 2026 boligkostnadstak","Open Husbanken’s official calculator":"Åpne Husbankens offisielle kalkulator"},"nl":{"Norway Housing Benefit Estimator":"Noorwegen Schatting van de woningvoordelen","Norway Housing Benefit Calculator 2026 — Monthly Scenario":"Rekenmachine voor huisvestingsvoordelen in Noorwegen 2026 — Maandelijks scenario","Estimate a standard monthly Norwegian housing-benefit scenario from the household income basis, approved housing costs, household size and municipality group. See the 2026 assumptions and continue to Husbanken for a current eligibility check.":"Schat een standaard maandelijks Noors huursubsidiescenario op basis van het gezinsinkomen, de goedgekeurde huisvestingskosten, de grootte van het huishouden en de gemeentegroep. Zie de 2026-aannames en ga verder naar Husbanken voor een actuele geschiktheidscontrole.","Use this private scenario to understand how Norway’s housing-benefit formula combines approved housing costs, weighted household income and the 2026 coverage rate. The interface language never changes the Norwegian rules.":"Gebruik dit privéscenario om te begrijpen hoe de Noorse huisvestingsuitkeringsformule goedgekeurde huisvestingskosten, gewogen gezinsinkomen en het 2026-dekkingspercentage combineert. De interfacetaal verandert nooit de Noorse regels.","Calculations run in this browser. Entries are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"Berekeningen worden in deze browser uitgevoerd. Inzendingen worden niet naar een server verzonden of door deze tool opgeslagen.","Example":"Voorbeeld","For one household member with no income and NOK 8,000 in monthly approved housing costs, the 2026 standard own contribution is about NOK 2,215 per month. The estimated benefit is about NOK 4,032 after applying the 73.7% rate.":"Voor één lid van het huishouden zonder inkomen en NOK 8,000 aan maandelijks goedgekeurde woonlasten bedraagt de standaard eigen bijdrage 2026 ongeveer NOK 2,215 per maand. Het geschatte voordeel bedraagt ​​ongeveer NOK 4,032 na toepassing van het 73.7%-tarief.","How the scenario works":"Hoe het scenario werkt","The tool divides household income by the official household weight, calculates the standard own contribution from weighted annual income, limits approved housing costs by the household-size and municipality cap, subtracts the monthly own contribution and applies 73.7%.":"De tool deelt het huishoudinkomen door het officiële huishoudgewicht, berekent de standaard eigen bijdrage uit het gewogen jaarinkomen, beperkt de goedgekeurde woonlasten op basis van de huishoudgrootte en het gemeenteplafond, trekt de maandelijkse eigen bijdrage af en past 73.7% toe.","Common questions":"Veelgestelde vragen","Is this an official award or eligibility decision?":"Is dit een officiële toekenning of beslissing om in aanmerking te komen?","No. It is a standard-case scenario, not an application or decision. Husbanken’s official calculator applies current eligibility limits, personal rules and the month being checked.":"Nr. Het is een standaardscenario en geen aanvraag of beschikking. De officiële rekenmachine van Husbanken past de huidige deelnamelimieten, persoonlijke regels en de maand die wordt gecontroleerd toe.","What should I enter as household income?":"Wat moet ik invullen als huishoudinkomen?","Enter the monthly household income basis used by Husbanken before household weighting. It may include taxable monthly income, reportable annual income converted to a month, applicable wealth supplement and tax-free rental income. Children’s income and several named benefits are excluded. Check Husbanken’s income guidance.":"Voer de maandelijkse inkomensbasis van het huishouden in die door Husbanken wordt gebruikt vóór de weging van het huishouden. Het kan hierbij gaan om belastbaar maandinkomen, te rapporteren jaarinkomen omgerekend naar een maand, toepasselijke vermogenssupplement en belastingvrije huurinkomsten. Het inkomen van kinderen en diverse genoemde uitkeringen zijn uitgesloten. Bekijk de inkomensrichtlijnen van Husbanken.","What counts as approved housing costs?":"Wat telt als goedgekeurde woonlasten?","Husbanken counts costs differently for renters, shared-cost housing and detached homes. Enter the amount already worked out under its current rules, not every housing bill. The result is still capped by household size and municipality.":"Husbanken berekent de kosten verschillend voor huurders, koopwoningen en vrijstaande woningen. Voer het bedrag in dat al is berekend volgens de huidige regels, niet elke huisvestingsrekening. Het resultaat wordt nog steeds begrensd door de grootte van het huishouden en de gemeente.","Does changing language change the rules?":"Verandert het veranderen van de taal de regels?","No. This tool estimates a Norway-only 2026 scenario in every interface language.":"Nr. Deze tool schat een 2026-scenario dat alleen voor Noorwegen beschikbaar is, in elke interfacetaal.","Scope and limits":"Reikwijdte en limieten","Norway only. This standard-case estimate does not decide eligibility or model the separate upper household-income limit, minimum payout, single old-age pensioner or young-disabled thresholds, special-adapted housing, transition rules, or every income and asset exception. The 2026 rates are static and must be rechecked against Husbanken. Use its official calculator for the month you are checking.":"Alleen Noorwegen. Deze standaardschatting bepaalt niet of u in aanmerking komt en modelleert niet de afzonderlijke bovengrens voor het gezinsinkomen, de minimumuitbetaling, de drempels voor alleenstaande gepensioneerden of jongeren met een handicap, speciaal aangepaste huisvesting, overgangsregels of elke uitzondering op inkomen en vermogen. De 2026-tarieven zijn statisch en moeten opnieuw worden gecontroleerd aan de hand van Husbanken. Gebruik de officiële rekenmachine voor de maand die u controleert.","Estimate a standard monthly scenario":"Schat een standaard maandscenario","Norwegian rules only · standard 2026 rates · checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country or rules.":"Alleen Noorse regels · standaard 2026-tarieven · gecontroleerd 17 oktober 2026 · taal verandert het land of de regels niet.","Monthly household income basis before weighting, NOK":"Maandelijkse inkomensbasis van het huishouden vóór weging, NOK","Use the gross monthly basis Husbanken applies, including any applicable wealth supplement and tax-free rental income. Exclude items Husbanken says do not count. See its income guide before relying on a result.":"Gebruik de bruto maandbasis die Husbanken hanteert, inclusief eventuele geldende vermogenstoeslag en belastingvrije huurinkomsten. Sluit items uit die volgens Husbanken niet meetellen. Raadpleeg de inkomstengids voordat u op een resultaat vertrouwt.","Monthly housing costs already approved under Husbanken rules, NOK":"Maandelijkse huisvestingskosten al goedgekeurd volgens de regels van Husbanken, NOK","Do not add every housing bill. Approved costs differ for rental, shared-cost and detached housing; enter the monthly amount under current Husbanken rules. A household and municipality cap is applied below.":"Voeg niet elke woningrekening toe. Goedgekeurde kosten verschillen voor huurwoningen, woningen voor gedeelde kosten en vrijstaande woningen; voer het maandbedrag in volgens de huidige Husbanken-regels. Hieronder wordt een huishoudens- en gemeenteplafond toegepast.","Household members aged 18 or older":"Leden van het huishouden van 18 of ouder","Household members under 18":"Leden van het huishouden onder 18","2026 municipality cap group":"2026 gemeentekapgroep","Other municipalities":"Overige gemeenten","Oslo":"Oslo","Bergen, Trondheim, Tromsø, Stavanger or Bærum":"Bergen, Trondheim, Tromsø, Stavanger of Bærum","Kristiansand, Skedsmo, Frogn, Lørenskog, Nordre Follo, Asker, Nesodden, Sola or Sandnes":"Kristiansand, Skedsmo, Frogn, Lørenskog, Nordre Follo, Asker, Nesodden, Sola of Sandnes","Estimate monthly amount":"Schatting van het maandbedrag","Clear entries":"Invoer wissen","Enter the household’s monthly income basis, approved housing costs and composition.":"Vul de maandelijkse inkomensgrondslag van het huishouden, de goedgekeurde woonlasten en de samenstelling in.","Scenario calculated on this device. Husbanken decides actual cases.":"Scenario berekend op dit apparaat. Husbanken beslist over concrete zaken.","Entries cleared.":"Invoer gewist.","Check the monthly amounts, household counts and municipality group.":"Controleer de maandbedragen, huishoudensaantallen en gemeentegroep.","Standard monthly scenario":"Standaard maandscenario","Estimated monthly housing benefit":"Geschatte maandelijkse huurtoeslag","Monthly household income entered":"Maandelijks huishoudinkomen ingevoerd","Household income weight":"Gewicht van het gezinsinkomen","Weighted monthly income":"Gewogen maandinkomen","Estimated monthly own contribution":"Geschatte maandelijkse eigen bijdrage","Approved housing costs entered":"Goedgekeurde woonlasten ingevoerd","Monthly housing-cost cap":"Maandelijks woonlastplafond","Approved costs used after cap":"Goedgekeurde kosten gebruikt na cap","Costs remaining after own contribution":"Restant kosten na eigen bijdrage","Coverage rate":"Dekkingspercentage","Assumptions used":"Gebruikte aannames","The standard contribution thresholds and housing-cost caps use Husbanken’s 2026 rates checked 17 October 2026.":"De standaardpremiedrempels en plafonds voor de huisvestingskosten zijn gebaseerd op de 2026-tarieven van Husbanken, gecontroleerd op 17 oktober 2026.","Estimated benefit = max(0, approved costs after cap − own contribution) × 73.7%. Weighted income uses 1.00 for the first member, 0.13 for each additional member aged 18 or older and 0.15 for each additional member under 18.":"Geschatte uitkering = max(0, goedgekeurde kosten na limiet − eigen bijdrage) × 73.7%. Voor het gewogen inkomen wordt 1.00 gebruikt voor het eerste lid, 0.13 voor elk extra lid van 18 of ouder en 0.15 voor elk extra lid onder 18.","The entered income must already follow Husbanken’s income rules. Special thresholds, the separate household income ceiling, payout floor and personal eligibility are not calculated.":"Het ingevoerde inkomen moet al voldoen aan de inkomensregels van Husbanken. Speciale drempels, het afzonderlijke gezinsinkomensplafond, het uitbetalingsminimum en de persoonlijke geschiktheid worden niet berekend.","Private, local calculation. No figures are uploaded or stored by this page.":"Privé, lokale berekening. Er worden geen cijfers geüpload of opgeslagen door deze pagina.","Husbanken: calculation":"Husbanken: berekening","Husbanken: income basis":"Husbanken: inkomensgrondslag","Husbanken: 2026 own-contribution rates":"Husbanken: 2026 eigen bijdragetarieven","Husbanken: 2026 housing-cost caps":"Husbanken: 2026 woonlastplafonds","Open Husbanken’s official calculator":"Open de officiële rekenmachine van Husbanken"},"pl":{"Norway Housing Benefit Estimator":"Norweski kalkulator świadczeń mieszkaniowych","Norway Housing Benefit Calculator 2026 — Monthly Scenario":"Norweski kalkulator świadczeń mieszkaniowych 2026 — scenariusz miesięczny","Estimate a standard monthly Norwegian housing-benefit scenario from the household income basis, approved housing costs, household size and municipality group. See the 2026 assumptions and continue to Husbanken for a current eligibility check.":"Oszacuj standardowy miesięczny norweski scenariusz świadczeń mieszkaniowych na podstawie dochodu gospodarstwa domowego, zatwierdzonych kosztów mieszkania, wielkości gospodarstwa domowego i grupy gmin. Zapoznaj się z założeniami 2026 i udaj się do Husbanken, aby sprawdzić aktualną kwalifikowalność.","Use this private scenario to understand how Norway’s housing-benefit formula combines approved housing costs, weighted household income and the 2026 coverage rate. The interface language never changes the Norwegian rules.":"Skorzystaj z tego prywatnego scenariusza, aby zrozumieć, w jaki sposób norweska formuła świadczeń mieszkaniowych łączy zatwierdzone koszty mieszkania, ważony dochód gospodarstwa domowego i stawkę ubezpieczenia 2026. Język interfejsu nigdy nie zmienia norweskich zasad.","Calculations run in this browser. Entries are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"Obliczenia są uruchamiane w tej przeglądarce. Wpisy nie są wysyłane na serwer ani zapisywane przez to narzędzie.","Example":"Przykład","For one household member with no income and NOK 8,000 in monthly approved housing costs, the 2026 standard own contribution is about NOK 2,215 per month. The estimated benefit is about NOK 4,032 after applying the 73.7% rate.":"W przypadku jednego członka gospodarstwa domowego nieposiadającego dochodów i posiadającego 8,000 NOK w zatwierdzonych miesięcznych kosztach mieszkaniowych, standardowy wkład własny 2026 wynosi około 2,215 NOK miesięcznie. Szacunkowa korzyść wynosi około 4,032 NOK po zastosowaniu stawki 73.7%.","How the scenario works":"Jak działa scenariusz","The tool divides household income by the official household weight, calculates the standard own contribution from weighted annual income, limits approved housing costs by the household-size and municipality cap, subtracts the monthly own contribution and applies 73.7%.":"Narzędzie dzieli dochód gospodarstwa domowego przez oficjalną wagę gospodarstwa domowego, oblicza standardowy wkład własny z ważonego rocznego dochodu, ogranicza zatwierdzone koszty mieszkaniowe o wielkość gospodarstwa domowego i limit gminy, odejmuje miesięczny wkład własny i stosuje 73.7%.","Common questions":"Często zadawane pytania","Is this an official award or eligibility decision?":"Czy jest to oficjalna decyzja o przyznaniu nagrody lub kwalifikowalności?","No. It is a standard-case scenario, not an application or decision. Husbanken’s official calculator applies current eligibility limits, personal rules and the month being checked.":"Nie. Jest to standardowy scenariusz, a nie wniosek lub decyzja. Oficjalny kalkulator Husbanken uwzględnia aktualne limity kwalifikowalności, zasady osobiste i sprawdzany miesiąc.","What should I enter as household income?":"Co mam wpisać jako dochód gospodarstwa domowego?","Enter the monthly household income basis used by Husbanken before household weighting. It may include taxable monthly income, reportable annual income converted to a month, applicable wealth supplement and tax-free rental income. Children’s income and several named benefits are excluded. Check Husbanken’s income guidance.":"Wprowadź podstawę miesięcznego dochodu gospodarstwa domowego stosowaną przez Husbanken przed ważeniem gospodarstwa domowego. Może obejmować miesięczny dochód podlegający opodatkowaniu, roczny dochód podlegający zgłoszeniu przeliczony na miesiąc, obowiązujący dodatek majątkowy i wolny od podatku dochód z wynajmu. Dochody dzieci i kilka określonych świadczeń są wyłączone. Sprawdź wytyczne dotyczące dochodów Husbanken.","What counts as approved housing costs?":"Co zalicza się do zatwierdzonych kosztów mieszkaniowych?","Husbanken counts costs differently for renters, shared-cost housing and detached homes. Enter the amount already worked out under its current rules, not every housing bill. The result is still capped by household size and municipality.":"Husbanken inaczej oblicza koszty dla najemców, mieszkań dzielonych i domów jednorodzinnych. Wpisz kwotę już obliczoną na jej obecnych zasadach, a nie każdy rachunek za mieszkanie. Wynik jest nadal ograniczony wielkością gospodarstwa domowego i gminą.","Does changing language change the rules?":"Czy zmiana języka zmienia zasady?","No. This tool estimates a Norway-only 2026 scenario in every interface language.":"Nie. To narzędzie szacuje scenariusz 2026 dostępny wyłącznie w Norwegii w każdym języku interfejsu.","Scope and limits":"Zakres i ograniczenia","Norway only. This standard-case estimate does not decide eligibility or model the separate upper household-income limit, minimum payout, single old-age pensioner or young-disabled thresholds, special-adapted housing, transition rules, or every income and asset exception. The 2026 rates are static and must be rechecked against Husbanken. Use its official calculator for the month you are checking.":"Tylko Norwegia. To standardowe oszacowanie nie decyduje o kwalifikowalności ani nie modeluje oddzielnego górnego limitu dochodu gospodarstwa domowego, minimalnej wypłaty, progów dla emerytów samotnych lub młodych osób niepełnosprawnych, specjalnie przystosowanych mieszkań, zasad przejściowych ani każdego wyjątku w zakresie dochodów i majątku. Stawki 2026 są statyczne i należy je ponownie sprawdzić w stosunku do Husbanken. Skorzystaj z oficjalnego kalkulatora dla miesiąca, który sprawdzasz.","Estimate a standard monthly scenario":"Oszacuj standardowy scenariusz miesięczny","Norwegian rules only · standard 2026 rates · checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country or rules.":"Tylko reguły norweskie · Stawki standardowe 2026 · sprawdzone 17 Październik 2026 · język nie zmienia kraju ani zasad.","Monthly household income basis before weighting, NOK":"Podstawa miesięcznego dochodu gospodarstwa domowego przed ważeniem, NOK","Use the gross monthly basis Husbanken applies, including any applicable wealth supplement and tax-free rental income. Exclude items Husbanken says do not count. See its income guide before relying on a result.":"Wykorzystaj stawkę miesięczną brutto obowiązującą w Husbanken, obejmującą wszelkie obowiązujące dodatki majątkowe i dochody z wynajmu wolne od podatku. Wyklucz pozycje, które zdaniem Husbankena się nie liczą. Zanim zaczniesz polegać na wynikach, zapoznaj się z przewodnikiem po dochodach.","Monthly housing costs already approved under Husbanken rules, NOK":"Miesięczne koszty mieszkaniowe już zatwierdzone zgodnie z przepisami Husbanken, NOK","Do not add every housing bill. Approved costs differ for rental, shared-cost and detached housing; enter the monthly amount under current Husbanken rules. A household and municipality cap is applied below.":"Nie dodawaj każdego rachunku za mieszkanie. Zatwierdzone koszty różnią się w przypadku wynajmu, mieszkań dzielonych i domów jednorodzinnych; wprowadź miesięczną kwotę zgodnie z obowiązującymi zasadami Husbanken. Poniżej zastosowano górny limit dla gospodarstwa domowego i gminy.","Household members aged 18 or older":"Członkowie gospodarstwa domowego w wieku 18 lub starsi","Household members under 18":"Członkowie gospodarstwa domowego pod 18","2026 municipality cap group":"2026 grupa limitów gminnych","Other municipalities":"Inne gminy","Oslo":"Oslo","Bergen, Trondheim, Tromsø, Stavanger or Bærum":"Bergen, Trondheim, Tromsø, Stavanger lub Bærum","Kristiansand, Skedsmo, Frogn, Lørenskog, Nordre Follo, Asker, Nesodden, Sola or Sandnes":"Kristiansand, Skedsmo, Frogn, Lørenskog, Nordre Follo, Asker, Nesodden, Sola lub Sandnes","Estimate monthly amount":"Oszacuj miesięczną kwotę","Clear entries":"Wyczyść wpisy","Enter the household’s monthly income basis, approved housing costs and composition.":"Wprowadź podstawę miesięcznego dochodu gospodarstwa domowego, zatwierdzone koszty mieszkaniowe i skład.","Scenario calculated on this device. Husbanken decides actual cases.":"Scenariusz obliczony na tym urządzeniu. Husbanken decyduje o rzeczywistych sprawach.","Entries cleared.":"Wpisy zostały usunięte.","Check the monthly amounts, household counts and municipality group.":"Sprawdź kwoty miesięczne, liczbę gospodarstw domowych i grupę gmin.","Standard monthly scenario":"Standardowy scenariusz miesięczny","Estimated monthly housing benefit":"Szacowany miesięczny dodatek mieszkaniowy","Monthly household income entered":"Wprowadzono miesięczny dochód gospodarstwa domowego","Household income weight":"Waga dochodu gospodarstwa domowego","Weighted monthly income":"Ważony miesięczny dochód","Estimated monthly own contribution":"Szacowany miesięczny wkład własny","Approved housing costs entered":"Wprowadzono zatwierdzone koszty mieszkaniowe","Monthly housing-cost cap":"Miesięczny limit kosztów mieszkaniowych","Approved costs used after cap":"Zatwierdzone koszty stosowane po ograniczeniu","Costs remaining after own contribution":"Koszty pozostałe po wkładzie własnym","Coverage rate":"Wskaźnik pokrycia","Assumptions used":"Zastosowano założenia","The standard contribution thresholds and housing-cost caps use Husbanken’s 2026 rates checked 17 October 2026.":"Standardowe progi składek i górne limity kosztów mieszkaniowych wykorzystują stawki Husbanken 2026 sprawdzone w 17 w październiku 2026.","Estimated benefit = max(0, approved costs after cap − own contribution) × 73.7%. Weighted income uses 1.00 for the first member, 0.13 for each additional member aged 18 or older and 0.15 for each additional member under 18.":"Szacowana korzyść = max(0, zatwierdzone koszty po uwzględnieniu limitu – wkład własny) × 73.7%. Dochód ważony wykorzystuje 1.00 dla pierwszego członka, 0.13 dla każdego dodatkowego członka w wieku 18 lub starszego i 0.15 dla każdego dodatkowego członka poniżej 18.","The entered income must already follow Husbanken’s income rules. Special thresholds, the separate household income ceiling, payout floor and personal eligibility are not calculated.":"Wprowadzony dochód musi już być zgodny z regułami dochodowymi Husbanken. Progi specjalne, oddzielny pułap dochodu gospodarstwa domowego, dolna granica wypłaty i uprawnienia osobiste nie są obliczane.","Private, local calculation. No figures are uploaded or stored by this page.":"Prywatne, lokalne obliczenia. Na tej stronie nie są przesyłane ani przechowywane żadne dane liczbowe.","Husbanken: calculation":"Husbanken: obliczenia","Husbanken: income basis":"Husbanken: podstawa dochodu","Husbanken: 2026 own-contribution rates":"Husbanken: 2026 stawki wkładu własnego","Husbanken: 2026 housing-cost caps":"Husbanken: 2026 limity kosztów obudowy","Open Husbanken’s official calculator":"Otwórz oficjalny kalkulator Husbankena"},"pt":{"Norway Housing Benefit Estimator":"Estimador de benefícios de habitação na Noruega","Norway Housing Benefit Calculator 2026 — Monthly Scenario":"Calculadora de subsídio de habitação na Noruega 2026 — Cenário mensal","Estimate a standard monthly Norwegian housing-benefit scenario from the household income basis, approved housing costs, household size and municipality group. See the 2026 assumptions and continue to Husbanken for a current eligibility check.":"Estimar um cenário mensal padrão de benefícios habitacionais noruegueses com base na renda familiar, custos de habitação aprovados, tamanho da família e grupo de municípios. Consulte as premissas 2026 e continue até Husbanken para uma verificação de elegibilidade atual.","Use this private scenario to understand how Norway’s housing-benefit formula combines approved housing costs, weighted household income and the 2026 coverage rate. The interface language never changes the Norwegian rules.":"Utilize este cenário privado para compreender como a fórmula de subsídio de habitação da Noruega combina custos de habitação aprovados, rendimento familiar ponderado e a taxa de cobertura 2026. O idioma da interface nunca altera as regras norueguesas.","Calculations run in this browser. Entries are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"Cálculos são executados neste navegador. As entradas não são enviadas para um servidor ou salvas por esta ferramenta.","Example":"Exemplo","For one household member with no income and NOK 8,000 in monthly approved housing costs, the 2026 standard own contribution is about NOK 2,215 per month. The estimated benefit is about NOK 4,032 after applying the 73.7% rate.":"Para um membro do agregado familiar sem rendimentos e NOK 8,000 em custos de habitação aprovados mensalmente, a contribuição própria padrão 2026 é de cerca de NOK 2,215 por mês. O benefício estimado é de cerca de NOK 4,032 após a aplicação da taxa 73.7%.","How the scenario works":"Como funciona o cenário","The tool divides household income by the official household weight, calculates the standard own contribution from weighted annual income, limits approved housing costs by the household-size and municipality cap, subtracts the monthly own contribution and applies 73.7%.":"A ferramenta divide a renda familiar pelo peso oficial da família, calcula a contribuição própria padrão a partir da renda anual ponderada, limita os custos de habitação aprovados pelo tamanho da família e pelo limite municipal, subtrai a contribuição própria mensal e aplica 73.7%.","Common questions":"Perguntas comuns","Is this an official award or eligibility decision?":"Este é um prêmio oficial ou uma decisão de elegibilidade?","No. It is a standard-case scenario, not an application or decision. Husbanken’s official calculator applies current eligibility limits, personal rules and the month being checked.":"Não. É um cenário padrão, não uma aplicação ou decisão. A calculadora oficial do Husbanken aplica os limites de elegibilidade atuais, as regras pessoais e o mês que está sendo verificado.","What should I enter as household income?":"O que devo inserir como renda familiar?","Enter the monthly household income basis used by Husbanken before household weighting. It may include taxable monthly income, reportable annual income converted to a month, applicable wealth supplement and tax-free rental income. Children’s income and several named benefits are excluded. Check Husbanken’s income guidance.":"Insira a base de renda familiar mensal usada pelo Husbanken antes da ponderação familiar. Pode incluir rendimento mensal tributável, rendimento anual reportável convertido para um mês, complemento patrimonial aplicável e rendimento de aluguer isento de impostos. A renda infantil e vários benefícios nomeados estão excluídos. Verifique a orientação de rendimento do Husbanken.","What counts as approved housing costs?":"O que conta como custos de habitação aprovados?","Husbanken counts costs differently for renters, shared-cost housing and detached homes. Enter the amount already worked out under its current rules, not every housing bill. The result is still capped by household size and municipality.":"Husbanken contabiliza os custos de forma diferente para locatários, moradias com custos compartilhados e moradias isoladas. Insira o valor já acertado de acordo com as regras atuais, e não com todas as contas habitacionais. O resultado ainda é limitado pelo tamanho da família e pelo município.","Does changing language change the rules?":"Mudar o idioma altera as regras?","No. This tool estimates a Norway-only 2026 scenario in every interface language.":"Não. Esta ferramenta estima um cenário 2026 somente na Noruega em cada idioma de interface.","Scope and limits":"Escopo e limites","Norway only. This standard-case estimate does not decide eligibility or model the separate upper household-income limit, minimum payout, single old-age pensioner or young-disabled thresholds, special-adapted housing, transition rules, or every income and asset exception. The 2026 rates are static and must be rechecked against Husbanken. Use its official calculator for the month you are checking.":"Somente Noruega. Esta estimativa de caso padrão não decide a elegibilidade nem modela o limite superior separado do rendimento familiar, o pagamento mínimo, os limiares para pensionistas de velhice únicos ou jovens deficientes, habitação especialmente adaptada, regras de transição ou todas as exceções de rendimentos e bens. As taxas 2026 são estáticas e devem ser verificadas novamente em relação ao Husbanken. Use sua calculadora oficial para o mês que você está verificando.","Estimate a standard monthly scenario":"Estimar um cenário mensal padrão","Norwegian rules only · standard 2026 rates · checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country or rules.":"Somente regras norueguesas · taxas 2026 padrão · verificado 17 outubro 2026 · idioma não altera o país ou as regras.","Monthly household income basis before weighting, NOK":"Base de renda familiar mensal antes da ponderação, NOK","Use the gross monthly basis Husbanken applies, including any applicable wealth supplement and tax-free rental income. Exclude items Husbanken says do not count. See its income guide before relying on a result.":"Use a base mensal bruta que o Husbanken aplica, incluindo qualquer suplemento patrimonial aplicável e renda de aluguel isenta de impostos. Exclua itens que Husbanken diz não contar. Consulte seu guia de receitas antes de confiar em um resultado.","Monthly housing costs already approved under Husbanken rules, NOK":"Custos mensais de habitação já aprovados pelas regras do Husbanken, NOK","Do not add every housing bill. Approved costs differ for rental, shared-cost and detached housing; enter the monthly amount under current Husbanken rules. A household and municipality cap is applied below.":"Não adicione todas as contas de habitação. Os custos aprovados diferem para arrendamento, custos partilhados e habitação isolada; insira o valor mensal de acordo com as regras atuais do Husbanken. Um limite familiar e municipal é aplicado abaixo.","Household members aged 18 or older":"Membros da família com idade igual ou superior a 18","Household members under 18":"Membros da família sob 18","2026 municipality cap group":"2026 grupo de limite municipal","Other municipalities":"Outros municípios","Oslo":"Oslo","Bergen, Trondheim, Tromsø, Stavanger or Bærum":"Bergen, Trondheim, Tromsø, Stavanger ou Bærum","Kristiansand, Skedsmo, Frogn, Lørenskog, Nordre Follo, Asker, Nesodden, Sola or Sandnes":"Kristiansand, Skedsmo, Frogn, Lørenskog, Nordre Follo, Asker, Nesodden, Sola ou Sandnes","Estimate monthly amount":"Estimar valor mensal","Clear entries":"Limpar entradas","Enter the household’s monthly income basis, approved housing costs and composition.":"Insira a base de renda mensal da família, custos de moradia aprovados e composição.","Scenario calculated on this device. Husbanken decides actual cases.":"Cenário calculado neste dispositivo. Husbanken decide casos reais.","Entries cleared.":"Inscrições apagadas.","Check the monthly amounts, household counts and municipality group.":"Verifique os valores mensais, contagens de domicílios e grupo de municípios.","Standard monthly scenario":"Cenário mensal padrão","Estimated monthly housing benefit":"Benefício de moradia mensal estimado","Monthly household income entered":"Renda familiar mensal inserida","Household income weight":"Peso da renda familiar","Weighted monthly income":"Renda mensal ponderada","Estimated monthly own contribution":"Contribuição própria mensal estimada","Approved housing costs entered":"Custos de habitação aprovados inseridos","Monthly housing-cost cap":"Limite mensal de custo de habitação","Approved costs used after cap":"Custos aprovados usados após limite","Costs remaining after own contribution":"Custos restantes após contribuição própria","Coverage rate":"Taxa de cobertura","Assumptions used":"Suposições usadas","The standard contribution thresholds and housing-cost caps use Husbanken’s 2026 rates checked 17 October 2026.":"Os limites de contribuição padrão e limites de custo de habitação usam as taxas 2026 do Husbanken verificadas 17 outubro 2026.","Estimated benefit = max(0, approved costs after cap − own contribution) × 73.7%. Weighted income uses 1.00 for the first member, 0.13 for each additional member aged 18 or older and 0.15 for each additional member under 18.":"Benefício estimado = máx(0, custos aprovados após limite - contribuição própria) × 73.7%. A renda ponderada usa 1.00 para o primeiro membro, 0.13 para cada membro adicional com idade 18 ou mais e 0.15 para cada membro adicional sob 18.","The entered income must already follow Husbanken’s income rules. Special thresholds, the separate household income ceiling, payout floor and personal eligibility are not calculated.":"O rendimento inserido já deve seguir as regras de rendimento do Husbanken. Os limites especiais, o limite máximo separado do rendimento familiar, o limite mínimo de pagamento e a elegibilidade pessoal não são calculados.","Private, local calculation. No figures are uploaded or stored by this page.":"Cálculo local privado. Nenhuma figura é carregada ou armazenada por esta página.","Husbanken: calculation":"Husbanken: cálculo","Husbanken: income basis":"Husbanken: base de renda","Husbanken: 2026 own-contribution rates":"Husbanken: 2026 taxas de contribuição própria","Husbanken: 2026 housing-cost caps":"Husbanken: 2026 limites de custo de habitação","Open Husbanken’s official calculator":"Calculadora oficial aberta do Husbanken"},"ru":{"Norway Housing Benefit Estimator":"Оценщик жилищных пособий в Норвегии","Norway Housing Benefit Calculator 2026 — Monthly Scenario":"Калькулятор жилищных пособий в Норвегии 2026 — ежемесячный сценарий","Estimate a standard monthly Norwegian housing-benefit scenario from the household income basis, approved housing costs, household size and municipality group. See the 2026 assumptions and continue to Husbanken for a current eligibility check.":"Оцените стандартный сценарий ежемесячного норвежского жилищного пособия на основе дохода домохозяйства, утвержденных расходов на жилье, размера домохозяйства и группы муниципалитета. Ознакомьтесь с предположениями 2026 и отправляйтесь в Husbanken для текущей проверки соответствия требованиям.","Use this private scenario to understand how Norway’s housing-benefit formula combines approved housing costs, weighted household income and the 2026 coverage rate. The interface language never changes the Norwegian rules.":"Воспользуйтесь этим частным сценарием, чтобы понять, как норвежская формула жилищных пособий объединяет утвержденные расходы на жилье, взвешенный семейный доход и уровень покрытия 2026. Язык интерфейса никогда не меняет норвежских правил.","Calculations run in this browser. Entries are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"Вычисления выполняются в этом браузере. Записи не отправляются на сервер и не сохраняются с помощью этого инструмента.","Example":"Пример","For one household member with no income and NOK 8,000 in monthly approved housing costs, the 2026 standard own contribution is about NOK 2,215 per month. The estimated benefit is about NOK 4,032 after applying the 73.7% rate.":"Для одного члена семьи, не имеющего дохода и имеющего ежемесячные утвержденные расходы на жилье 8,000, стандартный собственный взнос 2026 составляет около 2,215 норвежских крон в месяц. Предполагаемая выгода после применения ставки 73.7% составит около NOK 4,032.","How the scenario works":"Как работает сценарий","The tool divides household income by the official household weight, calculates the standard own contribution from weighted annual income, limits approved housing costs by the household-size and municipality cap, subtracts the monthly own contribution and applies 73.7%.":"Инструмент делит доход домохозяйства на официальный вес домохозяйства, рассчитывает стандартный собственный вклад на основе взвешенного годового дохода, ограничивает утвержденные расходы на жилье размером семьи и муниципальным пределом, вычитает ежемесячный собственный вклад и применяет 73.7%.","Common questions":"Общие вопросы","Is this an official award or eligibility decision?":"Это официальная награда или решение о допуске?","No. It is a standard-case scenario, not an application or decision. Husbanken’s official calculator applies current eligibility limits, personal rules and the month being checked.":"Нет. Это стандартный сценарий, а не заявление или решение. Официальный калькулятор Husbanken применяет текущие ограничения на участие, персональные правила и проверяемый месяц.","What should I enter as household income?":"Что мне следует указать в качестве семейного дохода?","Enter the monthly household income basis used by Husbanken before household weighting. It may include taxable monthly income, reportable annual income converted to a month, applicable wealth supplement and tax-free rental income. Children’s income and several named benefits are excluded. Check Husbanken’s income guidance.":"Введите ежемесячный доход домохозяйства, используемый Husbanken, до взвешивания домохозяйств. Он может включать облагаемый налогом ежемесячный доход, отчетный годовой доход, пересчитанный в месяц, применимую надбавку к богатству и необлагаемый налогом доход от аренды. Доходы детей и некоторые поименованные пособия исключены. Ознакомьтесь с руководством по доходам Husbanken.","What counts as approved housing costs?":"Что считается утвержденной стоимостью жилья?","Husbanken counts costs differently for renters, shared-cost housing and detached homes. Enter the amount already worked out under its current rules, not every housing bill. The result is still capped by household size and municipality.":"Husbanken рассчитывает затраты по-разному для арендаторов, жилья с долевой оплатой и отдельно стоящих домов. Введите сумму, уже выработанную по действующим правилам, а не по каждому жилищному счету. Результат по-прежнему ограничен размером домохозяйства и муниципалитетом.","Does changing language change the rules?":"Изменяет ли смена языка правила?","No. This tool estimates a Norway-only 2026 scenario in every interface language.":"Нет. Этот инструмент оценивает сценарий 2026 только для Норвегии на каждом языке интерфейса.","Scope and limits":"Объем и ограничения","Norway only. This standard-case estimate does not decide eligibility or model the separate upper household-income limit, minimum payout, single old-age pensioner or young-disabled thresholds, special-adapted housing, transition rules, or every income and asset exception. The 2026 rates are static and must be rechecked against Husbanken. Use its official calculator for the month you are checking.":"Только для Норвегии. Эта стандартная оценка не определяет право на участие и не моделирует отдельный верхний предел дохода домохозяйства, минимальную выплату, пороговые значения для одинокого пенсионера по старости или молодых инвалидов, специально адаптированное жилье, правила перехода или каждое исключение в отношении доходов и активов. Курсы 2026 являются статическими и должны быть перепроверены по отношению к Husbanken. Используйте его официальный калькулятор за месяц, который вы проверяете.","Estimate a standard monthly scenario":"Оценить стандартный ежемесячный сценарий","Norwegian rules only · standard 2026 rates · checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country or rules.":"Только норвежские правила · стандартные тарифы 2026 · проверено 17 Октябрь 2026 · язык не меняет страну или правила.","Monthly household income basis before weighting, NOK":"Месячный доход семьи до взвешивания, NOK","Use the gross monthly basis Husbanken applies, including any applicable wealth supplement and tax-free rental income. Exclude items Husbanken says do not count. See its income guide before relying on a result.":"Используйте валовую ежемесячную базу, применяемую Husbanken, включая любые применимые надбавки к богатству и необлагаемый налогом доход от аренды. Исключите элементы, которые, по словам Хусбанкена, не учитываются. Прежде чем полагаться на результат, ознакомьтесь с руководством по доходам.","Monthly housing costs already approved under Husbanken rules, NOK":"Ежемесячная стоимость жилья уже одобрена в соответствии с правилами Husbanken, NOK","Do not add every housing bill. Approved costs differ for rental, shared-cost and detached housing; enter the monthly amount under current Husbanken rules. A household and municipality cap is applied below.":"Не добавляйте все счета за жилье. Утвержденные расходы различаются для аренды, совместного проживания и отдельно стоящего жилья; введите ежемесячную сумму в соответствии с действующими правилами Husbanken. Ниже применяется ограничение для домохозяйств и муниципалитетов.","Household members aged 18 or older":"Члены семьи в возрасте 18 и старше","Household members under 18":"Члены семьи под номером 18","2026 municipality cap group":"2026 группа муниципальных колпаков","Other municipalities":"Другие муниципалитеты","Oslo":"Осло","Bergen, Trondheim, Tromsø, Stavanger or Bærum":"Берген, Тронхейм, Тромсё, Ставангер или Бэрум","Kristiansand, Skedsmo, Frogn, Lørenskog, Nordre Follo, Asker, Nesodden, Sola or Sandnes":"Кристиансанн, Скедсмо, Фрогн, Лоренског, Нордре Фолло, Аскер, Несодден, Сола или Санднес","Estimate monthly amount":"Оценочная ежемесячная сумма","Clear entries":"Очистить записи","Enter the household’s monthly income basis, approved housing costs and composition.":"Введите ежемесячный доход семьи, утвержденные расходы на жилье и состав.","Scenario calculated on this device. Husbanken decides actual cases.":"Сценарий рассчитан на этом устройстве. Хусбанкен решает реальные дела.","Entries cleared.":"Записи удалены.","Check the monthly amounts, household counts and municipality group.":"Проверьте ежемесячные суммы, количество домохозяйств и группу муниципалитетов.","Standard monthly scenario":"Стандартный ежемесячный сценарий","Estimated monthly housing benefit":"Расчетное ежемесячное жилищное пособие","Monthly household income entered":"Введен ежемесячный семейный доход","Household income weight":"Вес семейного дохода","Weighted monthly income":"Взвешенный ежемесячный доход","Estimated monthly own contribution":"Оценочный ежемесячный собственный вклад","Approved housing costs entered":"Введены утвержденные расходы на жилье","Monthly housing-cost cap":"Ежемесячный лимит стоимости жилья","Approved costs used after cap":"Утвержденные затраты используются после ограничения","Costs remaining after own contribution":"Затраты, оставшиеся после собственного вклада","Coverage rate":"Коэффициент покрытия","Assumptions used":"Использованные предположения","The standard contribution thresholds and housing-cost caps use Husbanken’s 2026 rates checked 17 October 2026.":"Стандартные пороговые значения взносов и ограничения стоимости жилья используют ставки Husbanken 2026, проверенные 17, октябрь 2026.","Estimated benefit = max(0, approved costs after cap − own contribution) × 73.7%. Weighted income uses 1.00 for the first member, 0.13 for each additional member aged 18 or older and 0.15 for each additional member under 18.":"Оценочная выгода = max(0, утвержденные затраты после ограничения – собственный вклад) × 73.7%. Для взвешенного дохода используется 1.00 для первого участника, 0.13 для каждого дополнительного участника в возрасте 18 или старше и 0.15 для каждого дополнительного участника под 18.","The entered income must already follow Husbanken’s income rules. Special thresholds, the separate household income ceiling, payout floor and personal eligibility are not calculated.":"Введенный доход уже должен соответствовать правилам дохода Husbanken. Специальные пороги, отдельный потолок дохода домохозяйства, минимальный размер выплат и личное право на участие не рассчитываются.","Private, local calculation. No figures are uploaded or stored by this page.":"Частный, местный расчет. На этой странице никакие цифры не загружаются и не сохраняются.","Husbanken: calculation":"Хусбанкен: расчет","Husbanken: income basis":"Хусбанкен: доходная база","Husbanken: 2026 own-contribution rates":"Husbanken: 2026 ставки собственных взносов","Husbanken: 2026 housing-cost caps":"Husbanken: 2026 ограничения стоимости жилья","Open Husbanken’s official calculator":"Открыть официальный калькулятор Husbanken"},"sv":{"Norway Housing Benefit Estimator":"Norge Bostadsförmånsuppskattare","Norway Housing Benefit Calculator 2026 — Monthly Scenario":"Norge Bostadsförmånskalkylator 2026 — Månadsscenario","Estimate a standard monthly Norwegian housing-benefit scenario from the household income basis, approved housing costs, household size and municipality group. See the 2026 assumptions and continue to Husbanken for a current eligibility check.":"Uppskatta ett standardmässigt månatligt norskt bostadsbidragsscenario utifrån hushållens inkomstbas, godkända boendekostnader, hushållsstorlek och kommungrupp. Se 2026 antaganden och fortsätt till Husbanken för en aktuell behörighetskontroll.","Use this private scenario to understand how Norway’s housing-benefit formula combines approved housing costs, weighted household income and the 2026 coverage rate. The interface language never changes the Norwegian rules.":"Använd detta privata scenario för att förstå hur Norges bostadsbidragsformel kombinerar godkända bostadskostnader, viktad hushållsinkomst och 2026 täckningsgrad. Gränssnittsspråket ändrar aldrig de norska reglerna.","Calculations run in this browser. Entries are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"Beräkningar körs i den här webbläsaren. Poster skickas inte till en server eller sparas av detta verktyg.","Example":"Exempel","For one household member with no income and NOK 8,000 in monthly approved housing costs, the 2026 standard own contribution is about NOK 2,215 per month. The estimated benefit is about NOK 4,032 after applying the 73.7% rate.":"För en hushållsmedlem utan inkomst och NOK 8,000 i månatliga godkända bostadskostnader, är 2026 standard eget bidrag cirka NOK 2,215 per månad. Den uppskattade fördelen är cirka NOK 4,032 efter att ha tillämpat 73.7 %-satsen.","How the scenario works":"Hur scenariot fungerar","The tool divides household income by the official household weight, calculates the standard own contribution from weighted annual income, limits approved housing costs by the household-size and municipality cap, subtracts the monthly own contribution and applies 73.7%.":"Verktyget delar hushållsinkomsten med den officiella hushållsvikten, beräknar standard eget bidrag från viktad årsinkomst, begränsar godkända boendekostnader med hushållsstorlek och kommuntak, subtraherar det månatliga eget bidraget och tillämpar 73.7%.","Common questions":"Vanliga frågor","Is this an official award or eligibility decision?":"Är detta en officiell utmärkelse eller valbarhetsbeslut?","No. It is a standard-case scenario, not an application or decision. Husbanken’s official calculator applies current eligibility limits, personal rules and the month being checked.":"Nr. Det är ett standardscenario, inte en ansökan eller ett beslut. Husbankens officiella kalkylator tillämpar gällande behörighetsgränser, personliga regler och månaden som kontrolleras.","What should I enter as household income?":"Vad ska jag ange som hushållsinkomst?","Enter the monthly household income basis used by Husbanken before household weighting. It may include taxable monthly income, reportable annual income converted to a month, applicable wealth supplement and tax-free rental income. Children’s income and several named benefits are excluded. Check Husbanken’s income guidance.":"Ange den månatliga hushållsinkomstgrund som Husbanken använder före hushållsviktning. Det kan omfatta skattepliktig månadsinkomst, rapporteringspliktig årsinkomst omräknat till en månad, tillämpligt förmögenhetstillägg och skattefria hyresintäkter. Barns inkomst och flera namngivna förmåner är exkluderade. Kolla Husbankens inkomstvägledning.","What counts as approved housing costs?":"Vad räknas som godkända boendekostnader?","Husbanken counts costs differently for renters, shared-cost housing and detached homes. Enter the amount already worked out under its current rules, not every housing bill. The result is still capped by household size and municipality.":"Husbanken räknar kostnader olika för hyresgäster, sambostäder och småhus. Ange det belopp som redan har utarbetats enligt dess nuvarande regler, inte varje bostadsräkning. Resultatet begränsas fortfarande av hushållsstorlek och kommun.","Does changing language change the rules?":"Ändras reglerna om du byter språk?","No. This tool estimates a Norway-only 2026 scenario in every interface language.":"Nr. Det här verktyget uppskattar ett 2026-scenario för endast Norge i varje gränssnittsspråk.","Scope and limits":"Omfattning och begränsningar","Norway only. This standard-case estimate does not decide eligibility or model the separate upper household-income limit, minimum payout, single old-age pensioner or young-disabled thresholds, special-adapted housing, transition rules, or every income and asset exception. The 2026 rates are static and must be rechecked against Husbanken. Use its official calculator for the month you are checking.":"Endast Norge. Denna uppskattning av standardfallet avgör inte berättigande eller modell för den separata övre hushållsinkomstgränsen, lägsta utbetalning, tröskelvärden för ensamstående ålderspensionär eller unga funktionshindrade, specialanpassade bostäder, övergångsregler eller varje inkomst- och tillgångsundantag. 2026-kurserna är statiska och måste kontrolleras på nytt mot Husbanken. Använd dess officiella kalkylator för månaden du kontrollerar.","Estimate a standard monthly scenario":"Uppskatta ett standardscenario för månaden","Norwegian rules only · standard 2026 rates · checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country or rules.":"Endast norska regler · standardpriser för 2026 · kontrollerade 17 oktober 2026 · språket ändrar inte landet eller reglerna.","Monthly household income basis before weighting, NOK":"Hushållets månatliga inkomstbas före viktning, NOK","Use the gross monthly basis Husbanken applies, including any applicable wealth supplement and tax-free rental income. Exclude items Husbanken says do not count. See its income guide before relying on a result.":"Använd det bruttomånadsunderlag Husbanken tillämpar inklusive eventuellt tillämpligt förmögenhetstillägg och skattefria hyresintäkter. Uteslut objekt som Husbanken säger inte räknas. Se dess inkomstguide innan du förlitar dig på ett resultat.","Monthly housing costs already approved under Husbanken rules, NOK":"Månatliga boendekostnader redan godkända enligt Husbankens regler, NOK","Do not add every housing bill. Approved costs differ for rental, shared-cost and detached housing; enter the monthly amount under current Husbanken rules. A household and municipality cap is applied below.":"Lägg inte till varje bostadsräkning. Godkända kostnader skiljer sig åt för hyres-, delad och fristående bostäder; ange månadsbeloppet enligt gällande Husbankens regler. Ett hushålls- och kommuntak tillämpas nedan.","Household members aged 18 or older":"Hushållsmedlemmar som är 18 eller äldre","Household members under 18":"Hushållsmedlemmar under 18","2026 municipality cap group":"2026 kommunlockgrupp","Other municipalities":"Övriga kommuner","Oslo":"Oslo","Bergen, Trondheim, Tromsø, Stavanger or Bærum":"Bergen, Trondheim, Tromsø, Stavanger eller Bærum","Kristiansand, Skedsmo, Frogn, Lørenskog, Nordre Follo, Asker, Nesodden, Sola or Sandnes":"Kristiansand, Skedsmo, Frogn, Lørenskog, Nordre Follo, Asker, Nesodden, Sola eller Sandnes","Estimate monthly amount":"Uppskatta månadsbelopp","Clear entries":"Rensa poster","Enter the household’s monthly income basis, approved housing costs and composition.":"Ange hushållets månadsinkomstunderlag, godkända boendekostnader och sammansättning.","Scenario calculated on this device. Husbanken decides actual cases.":"Scenario beräknat på denna enhet. Husbanken avgör faktiska ärenden.","Entries cleared.":"Inmatningar raderade.","Check the monthly amounts, household counts and municipality group.":"Kontrollera månadsbelopp, hushållsantal och kommungrupp.","Standard monthly scenario":"Standard månadsscenario","Estimated monthly housing benefit":"Beräknad månatlig bostadsbidrag","Monthly household income entered":"Hushållets månadsinkomst angett","Household income weight":"Hushållsinkomstvikt","Weighted monthly income":"Viktad månadsinkomst","Estimated monthly own contribution":"Uppskattat månatligt eget bidrag","Approved housing costs entered":"Godkända bostadskostnader angivna","Monthly housing-cost cap":"Månadstak för bostäder","Approved costs used after cap":"Godkända kostnader används efter tak","Costs remaining after own contribution":"Resterande kostnader efter eget bidrag","Coverage rate":"Täckningsgrad","Assumptions used":"Antagna antaganden","The standard contribution thresholds and housing-cost caps use Husbanken’s 2026 rates checked 17 October 2026.":"Standardbidragströsklarna och bostadskostnadstak använder Husbankens 2026 kontrollerade priser 17 oktober 2026.","Estimated benefit = max(0, approved costs after cap − own contribution) × 73.7%. Weighted income uses 1.00 for the first member, 0.13 for each additional member aged 18 or older and 0.15 for each additional member under 18.":"Uppskattad nytta = max(0, godkända kostnader efter tak − eget bidrag) × 73.7%. Den viktade inkomsten använder 1.00 för den första medlemmen, 0.13 för varje ytterligare medlem i åldern 18 eller äldre och 0.15 för varje ytterligare medlem under 18.","The entered income must already follow Husbanken’s income rules. Special thresholds, the separate household income ceiling, payout floor and personal eligibility are not calculated.":"Den bokförda inkomsten ska redan följa Husbankens inkomstregler. Särskilda trösklar, hushållets separata inkomsttak, utbetalningsgolv och personlig behörighet beräknas inte.","Private, local calculation. No figures are uploaded or stored by this page.":"Privat, lokal beräkning. Inga siffror laddas upp eller lagras av denna sida.","Husbanken: calculation":"Husbanken: beräkning","Husbanken: income basis":"Husbanken: inkomstunderlag","Husbanken: 2026 own-contribution rates":"Husbanken: 2026 egna bidragssatser","Husbanken: 2026 housing-cost caps":"Husbanken: 2026 bostadskostnadstak","Open Husbanken’s official calculator":"Öppna Husbankens officiella kalkylator"},"sw":{"Norway Housing Benefit Estimator":"Norway Makadirio ya Manufaa ya Makazi","Norway Housing Benefit Calculator 2026 — Monthly Scenario":"Norwe Kikokotoo cha Manufaa ya Makazi 2026 — Hali ya Kila Mwezi","Estimate a standard monthly Norwegian housing-benefit scenario from the household income basis, approved housing costs, household size and municipality group. See the 2026 assumptions and continue to Husbanken for a current eligibility check.":"Kadiria hali ya kawaida ya kila mwezi ya faida ya makazi ya Norway kutoka kwa msingi wa mapato ya kaya, gharama za makazi zilizoidhinishwa, ukubwa wa kaya na kikundi cha manispaa. Tazama mawazo ya 2026 na uende kwa Husbanken kwa ukaguzi wa sasa wa kustahiki.","Use this private scenario to understand how Norway’s housing-benefit formula combines approved housing costs, weighted household income and the 2026 coverage rate. The interface language never changes the Norwegian rules.":"Tumia hali hii ya kibinafsi ili kuelewa jinsi fomula ya manufaa ya makazi ya Norwe inavyochanganya gharama zilizoidhinishwa za makazi, uzani wa mapato ya kaya na kiwango cha huduma cha 2026. Lugha ya kiolesura haibadilishi kanuni za Kinorwe kamwe.","Calculations run in this browser. Entries are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"Mahesabu yanayoendeshwa katika kivinjari hiki. Maingizo hayatumwi kwa seva au kuhifadhiwa na zana hii.","Example":"Mfano","For one household member with no income and NOK 8,000 in monthly approved housing costs, the 2026 standard own contribution is about NOK 2,215 per month. The estimated benefit is about NOK 4,032 after applying the 73.7% rate.":"Kwa mwanakaya mmoja asiye na mapato na NOK 8,000 katika gharama za nyumba zilizoidhinishwa kila mwezi, kiwango cha 2026 cha mchango wa kibinafsi ni takriban NOK 2,215 kwa mwezi. Manufaa yanayokadiriwa ni takriban NOK 4,032 baada ya kutumia kiwango cha 73.7%.","How the scenario works":"Jinsi hali inavyofanya kazi","The tool divides household income by the official household weight, calculates the standard own contribution from weighted annual income, limits approved housing costs by the household-size and municipality cap, subtracts the monthly own contribution and applies 73.7%.":"Zana hugawanya mapato ya kaya kwa uzito rasmi wa kaya, kukokotoa mchango wa kawaida wa mtu binafsi kutoka kwa mapato ya kila mwaka yaliyopimwa, mipaka ya gharama za nyumba zilizoidhinishwa na ukubwa wa kaya na manispaa, hupunguza mchango wa kila mwezi na kutumia 73.7%.","Common questions":"Maswali ya kawaida","Is this an official award or eligibility decision?":"Je, hii ni tuzo rasmi au uamuzi wa kustahiki?","No. It is a standard-case scenario, not an application or decision. Husbanken’s official calculator applies current eligibility limits, personal rules and the month being checked.":"Na. Ni hali ya kawaida, sio maombi au uamuzi. Kikokotoo rasmi cha Husbanken hutumia vikomo vya sasa vya kustahiki, sheria za kibinafsi na mwezi unaoangaliwa.","What should I enter as household income?":"Niweke nini kama mapato ya kaya?","Enter the monthly household income basis used by Husbanken before household weighting. It may include taxable monthly income, reportable annual income converted to a month, applicable wealth supplement and tax-free rental income. Children’s income and several named benefits are excluded. Check Husbanken’s income guidance.":"Weka msingi wa mapato wa kila mwezi wa kaya unaotumiwa na Husbanken kabla ya uzani wa kaya. Inaweza kujumuisha mapato ya kila mwezi yanayotozwa ushuru, mapato ya kila mwaka yanayoripotiwa kubadilishwa kuwa mwezi, nyongeza ya mali inayotumika na mapato ya kukodisha bila kodi. Mapato ya watoto na faida kadhaa zilizotajwa hazijajumuishwa. Angalia mwongozo wa mapato wa Husbanken.","What counts as approved housing costs?":"Je, ni gharama gani za makazi zilizoidhinishwa?","Husbanken counts costs differently for renters, shared-cost housing and detached homes. Enter the amount already worked out under its current rules, not every housing bill. The result is still capped by household size and municipality.":"Husbanken huhesabu gharama kwa njia tofauti kwa wapangaji, nyumba za gharama ya pamoja na nyumba zilizotengwa. Ingiza kiasi ambacho tayari kimefanyiwa kazi chini ya sheria zake za sasa, sio kila muswada wa nyumba. Matokeo bado yamepunguzwa na ukubwa wa kaya na manispaa.","Does changing language change the rules?":"Je, kubadilisha lugha hubadilisha sheria?","No. This tool estimates a Norway-only 2026 scenario in every interface language.":"Na. Zana hii inakadiria hali ya 2026 ya Norwe pekee katika kila lugha ya kiolesura.","Scope and limits":"Upeo na mipaka","Norway only. This standard-case estimate does not decide eligibility or model the separate upper household-income limit, minimum payout, single old-age pensioner or young-disabled thresholds, special-adapted housing, transition rules, or every income and asset exception. The 2026 rates are static and must be rechecked against Husbanken. Use its official calculator for the month you are checking.":"Norway pekee. Kadirio hili la kesi ya kawaida haliamui kustahiki au kielelezo cha kikomo tofauti cha mapato ya juu ya kaya, malipo ya chini zaidi, pensheni ya uzee au viwango vya ulemavu wachanga, nyumba iliyoboreshwa maalum, sheria za mpito, au kila ubaguzi wa mapato na mali. Viwango vya 2026 ni tuli na lazima vikaguliwe upya dhidi ya Husbanken. Tumia kikokotoo chake rasmi cha mwezi unaoangalia.","Estimate a standard monthly scenario":"Kadiria hali ya kawaida ya kila mwezi","Norwegian rules only · standard 2026 rates · checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country or rules.":"Sheria za Norway pekee · viwango vya kawaida vya 2026 · imeangaliwa 17 Oktoba 2026 · lugha haibadilishi nchi au sheria.","Monthly household income basis before weighting, NOK":"Msingi wa mapato ya kila mwezi wa kaya kabla ya uzani, NOK","Use the gross monthly basis Husbanken applies, including any applicable wealth supplement and tax-free rental income. Exclude items Husbanken says do not count. See its income guide before relying on a result.":"Tumia msingi wa jumla wa mwezi unaotumika Husbanken, ikijumuisha nyongeza yoyote ya mali inayotumika na mapato ya kukodisha bila kodi. Ondoa vitu ambavyo Husbanken anasema usihesabu. Tazama mwongozo wake wa mapato kabla ya kutegemea matokeo.","Monthly housing costs already approved under Husbanken rules, NOK":"Gharama za nyumba za kila mwezi tayari zimeidhinishwa chini ya sheria za Husbanken, NOK","Do not add every housing bill. Approved costs differ for rental, shared-cost and detached housing; enter the monthly amount under current Husbanken rules. A household and municipality cap is applied below.":"Usiongeze kila bili ya nyumba. Gharama zilizoidhinishwa hutofautiana kwa kukodisha, gharama ya pamoja na makazi yaliyotengwa; ingiza kiasi cha kila mwezi chini ya sheria za sasa za Husbanken. Kikomo cha kaya na manispaa kinatumika hapa chini.","Household members aged 18 or older":"Wanafamilia walio na umri wa 18 au zaidi","Household members under 18":"Wanafamilia chini ya 18","2026 municipality cap group":"2026 kikundi cha manispaa","Other municipalities":"Manispaa nyingine","Oslo":"Oslo","Bergen, Trondheim, Tromsø, Stavanger or Bærum":"Bergen, Trondheim, Tromsø, Stavanger au Bærum","Kristiansand, Skedsmo, Frogn, Lørenskog, Nordre Follo, Asker, Nesodden, Sola or Sandnes":"Kristiansand, Skedsmo, Frogn, Lørenskog, Nordre Follo, Asker, Nesodden, Sola au Sandnes","Estimate monthly amount":"Kadiria kiasi cha kila mwezi","Clear entries":"Futa maingizo","Enter the household’s monthly income basis, approved housing costs and composition.":"Weka msingi wa mapato ya kila mwezi ya kaya, gharama na muundo ulioidhinishwa wa nyumba.","Scenario calculated on this device. Husbanken decides actual cases.":"Scenario imekokotolewa kwenye kifaa hiki. Husbanken anaamua kesi halisi.","Entries cleared.":"Maingizo yamefutwa.","Check the monthly amounts, household counts and municipality group.":"Angalia kiasi cha kila mwezi, hesabu za kaya na kikundi cha manispaa.","Standard monthly scenario":"Hali ya kawaida ya kila mwezi","Estimated monthly housing benefit":"Kadirio la faida ya kila mwezi ya makazi","Monthly household income entered":"Mapato ya kila mwezi ya kaya yameingizwa","Household income weight":"Uzito wa mapato ya kaya","Weighted monthly income":"Uzito wa mapato ya kila mwezi","Estimated monthly own contribution":"Kadirio la mchango wako wa kila mwezi","Approved housing costs entered":"Gharama za makazi zilizoidhinishwa zimeingizwa","Monthly housing-cost cap":"Kikomo cha gharama ya nyumba ya kila mwezi","Approved costs used after cap":"Gharama zilizoidhinishwa zinazotumika baada ya kikomo","Costs remaining after own contribution":"Gharama zinazosalia baada ya mchango wako mwenyewe","Coverage rate":"Kiwango cha malipo","Assumptions used":"Mawazo yaliyotumika","The standard contribution thresholds and housing-cost caps use Husbanken’s 2026 rates checked 17 October 2026.":"Viwango vya kawaida vya uchangiaji na vikomo vya gharama ya nyumba hutumia viwango vya 2026 vya Husbanken vilivyoangaliwa 17 Oktoba 2026.","Estimated benefit = max(0, approved costs after cap − own contribution) × 73.7%. Weighted income uses 1.00 for the first member, 0.13 for each additional member aged 18 or older and 0.15 for each additional member under 18.":"Kadirio la manufaa = max(0, gharama zilizoidhinishwa baada ya kiwango cha juu - mchango wako mwenyewe) × 73.7%. Mapato yaliyopimwa hutumia 1.00 kwa mwanachama wa kwanza, 0.13 kwa kila mwanachama wa ziada aliye na umri wa 18 au zaidi na 0.15 kwa kila mwanachama wa ziada chini ya 18.","The entered income must already follow Husbanken’s income rules. Special thresholds, the separate household income ceiling, payout floor and personal eligibility are not calculated.":"Mapato yaliyoingizwa lazima yafuate sheria za mapato za Husbanken. Viwango maalum, dari tofauti ya mapato ya kaya, sakafu ya malipo na ustahiki wa kibinafsi haujahesabiwa.","Private, local calculation. No figures are uploaded or stored by this page.":"Hesabu ya kibinafsi, ya ndani. Hakuna takwimu zilizopakiwa au kuhifadhiwa na ukurasa huu.","Husbanken: calculation":"Husbanken: hesabu","Husbanken: income basis":"Husbanken: msingi wa mapato","Husbanken: 2026 own-contribution rates":"Husbanken: 2026 viwango vya uchangiaji mwenyewe","Husbanken: 2026 housing-cost caps":"Husbanken: 2026 kofia za gharama ya nyumba","Open Husbanken’s official calculator":"Fungua kikokotoo rasmi cha Husbanken"},"ta":{"Norway Housing Benefit Estimator":"நோர்வே வீட்டு வசதி மதிப்பீட்டாளர்","Norway Housing Benefit Calculator 2026 — Monthly Scenario":"நோர்வே வீட்டு வசதி கால்குலேட்டர் 2026 — மாதாந்திர காட்சி","Estimate a standard monthly Norwegian housing-benefit scenario from the household income basis, approved housing costs, household size and municipality group. See the 2026 assumptions and continue to Husbanken for a current eligibility check.":"குடும்ப வருமானம், அங்கீகரிக்கப்பட்ட வீட்டுச் செலவுகள், வீட்டு அளவு மற்றும் நகராட்சிக் குழுவிலிருந்து நிலையான மாதாந்திர நார்வேஜிய வீட்டு வசதி-பயன் சூழ்நிலையை மதிப்பிடவும். 2026 அனுமானங்களைப் பார்க்கவும் மற்றும் தற்போதைய தகுதிச் சரிபார்ப்புக்காக Husbanken ஐத் தொடரவும்.","Use this private scenario to understand how Norway’s housing-benefit formula combines approved housing costs, weighted household income and the 2026 coverage rate. The interface language never changes the Norwegian rules.":"நார்வேயின் வீட்டுவசதி-பயன் சூத்திரம் அங்கீகரிக்கப்பட்ட வீட்டுச் செலவுகள், எடையுள்ள குடும்ப வருமானம் மற்றும் 2026 கவரேஜ் வீதம் ஆகியவற்றை எவ்வாறு ஒருங்கிணைக்கிறது என்பதைப் புரிந்துகொள்ள இந்த தனிப்பட்ட காட்சியைப் பயன்படுத்தவும். இடைமுக மொழி நோர்வே விதிகளை ஒருபோதும் மாற்றாது.","Calculations run in this browser. Entries are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"இந்த உலாவியில் கணக்கீடுகள் இயங்கும். உள்ளீடுகள் சேவையகத்திற்கு அனுப்பப்படாது அல்லது இந்தக் கருவியால் சேமிக்கப்படவில்லை.","Example":"எடுத்துக்காட்டு","For one household member with no income and NOK 8,000 in monthly approved housing costs, the 2026 standard own contribution is about NOK 2,215 per month. The estimated benefit is about NOK 4,032 after applying the 73.7% rate.":"வருமானம் இல்லாத ஒரு குடும்ப உறுப்பினர் மற்றும் NOK 8,000 மாதாந்திர அங்கீகரிக்கப்பட்ட வீட்டுச் செலவுகளில், 2026 நிலையான சொந்த பங்களிப்பு மாதத்திற்கு NOK 2,215 ஆகும். 73.7% வீதத்தைப் பயன்படுத்திய பிறகு NOK 4,032 என மதிப்பிடப்பட்ட பலன் கிடைக்கும்.","How the scenario works":"காட்சி எவ்வாறு செயல்படுகிறது","The tool divides household income by the official household weight, calculates the standard own contribution from weighted annual income, limits approved housing costs by the household-size and municipality cap, subtracts the monthly own contribution and applies 73.7%.":"கருவி வீட்டு வருமானத்தை அதிகாரப்பூர்வ வீட்டு எடையால் பிரிக்கிறது, எடையுள்ள வருடாந்திர வருமானத்திலிருந்து நிலையான சொந்த பங்களிப்பைக் கணக்கிடுகிறது, வீட்டு அளவு மற்றும் நகராட்சித் தொப்பியால் அங்கீகரிக்கப்பட்ட வீட்டுச் செலவுகளைக் கட்டுப்படுத்துகிறது, மாதாந்திர சொந்த பங்களிப்பைக் கழித்து 73.7% பயன்படுத்துகிறது.","Common questions":"பொதுவான கேள்விகள்","Is this an official award or eligibility decision?":"இது அதிகாரப்பூர்வ விருதா அல்லது தகுதிக்கான முடிவா?","No. It is a standard-case scenario, not an application or decision. Husbanken’s official calculator applies current eligibility limits, personal rules and the month being checked.":"எண். இது ஒரு நிலையான வழக்கு, பயன்பாடு அல்லது முடிவு அல்ல. Husbanken இன் அதிகாரப்பூர்வ கால்குலேட்டர் தற்போதைய தகுதி வரம்புகள், தனிப்பட்ட விதிகள் மற்றும் சரிபார்க்கப்படும் மாதம் ஆகியவற்றைப் பயன்படுத்துகிறது.","What should I enter as household income?":"வீட்டு வருமானமாக நான் எதை உள்ளிட வேண்டும்?","Enter the monthly household income basis used by Husbanken before household weighting. It may include taxable monthly income, reportable annual income converted to a month, applicable wealth supplement and tax-free rental income. Children’s income and several named benefits are excluded. Check Husbanken’s income guidance.":"குடும்ப எடைக்கு முன் Husbanken பயன்படுத்தும் மாத குடும்ப வருமானத்தை உள்ளிடவும். இதில் வரி விதிக்கக்கூடிய மாத வருமானம், ஒரு மாதமாக மாற்றப்பட்ட அறிக்கையிடக்கூடிய வருடாந்திர வருமானம், பொருந்தக்கூடிய செல்வச் சேர்க்கை மற்றும் வரி இல்லாத வாடகை வருமானம் ஆகியவை அடங்கும். குழந்தைகளின் வருமானம் மற்றும் பல பெயரிடப்பட்ட நன்மைகள் விலக்கப்பட்டுள்ளன. Husbanken இன் வருமான வழிகாட்டுதலைச் சரிபார்க்கவும்.","What counts as approved housing costs?":"அங்கீகரிக்கப்பட்ட வீட்டுச் செலவுகளாக என்ன கணக்கிடப்படுகிறது?","Husbanken counts costs differently for renters, shared-cost housing and detached homes. Enter the amount already worked out under its current rules, not every housing bill. The result is still capped by household size and municipality.":"ஹஸ்பேங்கன் வாடகைதாரர்கள், பகிர்வு-கட்டண வீடுகள் மற்றும் பிரிக்கப்பட்ட வீடுகளுக்கான செலவுகளை வித்தியாசமாக கணக்கிடுகிறது. அதன் தற்போதைய விதிகளின் கீழ் ஏற்கனவே வேலை செய்த தொகையை உள்ளிடவும், ஒவ்வொரு வீட்டு மசோதாவும் அல்ல. முடிவு இன்னும் வீட்டு அளவு மற்றும் நகராட்சி மூலம் வரம்பிடப்பட்டுள்ளது.","Does changing language change the rules?":"மொழியை மாற்றுவது விதிகளை மாற்றுமா?","No. This tool estimates a Norway-only 2026 scenario in every interface language.":"எண். ஒவ்வொரு இடைமுக மொழியிலும் நார்வேயில் மட்டும் 2026 காட்சியை இந்தக் கருவி மதிப்பிடுகிறது.","Scope and limits":"நோக்கம் மற்றும் வரம்புகள்","Norway only. This standard-case estimate does not decide eligibility or model the separate upper household-income limit, minimum payout, single old-age pensioner or young-disabled thresholds, special-adapted housing, transition rules, or every income and asset exception. The 2026 rates are static and must be rechecked against Husbanken. Use its official calculator for the month you are checking.":"நோர்வே மட்டும். இந்தத் தரநிலை மதிப்பீட்டானது, தனி உயர் குடும்ப வருமான வரம்பு, குறைந்தபட்ச ஊதியம், ஒற்றை முதியோர் ஓய்வூதியம் அல்லது இளம்-ஊனமுற்றோர் வரம்புகள், சிறப்புத் தழுவிய வீடுகள், மாறுதல் விதிகள் அல்லது ஒவ்வொரு வருமானம் மற்றும் சொத்து விதிவிலக்கு ஆகியவற்றைத் தகுதி அல்லது மாதிரியை தீர்மானிக்கவில்லை. 2026 விகிதங்கள் நிலையானவை மற்றும் Husbanken க்கு எதிராக மீண்டும் சரிபார்க்கப்பட வேண்டும். நீங்கள் சரிபார்க்கும் மாதத்திற்கு அதன் அதிகாரப்பூர்வ கால்குலேட்டரைப் பயன்படுத்தவும்.","Estimate a standard monthly scenario":"ஒரு நிலையான மாதாந்திர சூழ்நிலையை மதிப்பிடவும்","Norwegian rules only · standard 2026 rates · checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country or rules.":"நார்வேஜிய விதிகள் மட்டும் · நிலையான 2026 விகிதங்கள் · சரிபார்க்கப்பட்டது 17 அக்டோபர் 2026 · மொழி நாடு அல்லது விதிகளை மாற்றாது.","Monthly household income basis before weighting, NOK":"வெயிட்டிங் முன், NOK குடும்பத்தின் மாத வருமானம்","Use the gross monthly basis Husbanken applies, including any applicable wealth supplement and tax-free rental income. Exclude items Husbanken says do not count. See its income guide before relying on a result.":"பொருந்தக்கூடிய சொத்துச் சேர்க்கை மற்றும் வரி இல்லாத வாடகை வருமானம் உட்பட Husbanken பொருந்தும் மொத்த மாத அடிப்படையைப் பயன்படுத்தவும். Husbanken கூறும் பொருட்களை எண்ண வேண்டாம். முடிவை நம்புவதற்கு முன் அதன் வருமான வழிகாட்டியைப் பார்க்கவும்.","Monthly housing costs already approved under Husbanken rules, NOK":"Husbanken விதிகளின் கீழ் ஏற்கனவே அங்கீகரிக்கப்பட்ட மாதாந்திர வீட்டுச் செலவுகள், NOK","Do not add every housing bill. Approved costs differ for rental, shared-cost and detached housing; enter the monthly amount under current Husbanken rules. A household and municipality cap is applied below.":"ஒவ்வொரு வீட்டு மசோதாவையும் சேர்க்க வேண்டாம். அங்கீகரிக்கப்பட்ட செலவுகள் வாடகை, பகிரப்பட்ட செலவு மற்றும் பிரிக்கப்பட்ட வீடுகளுக்கு வேறுபடுகின்றன; தற்போதைய Husbanken விதிகளின் கீழ் மாதாந்திரத் தொகையை உள்ளிடவும். ஒரு வீடு மற்றும் நகராட்சி தொப்பி கீழே பயன்படுத்தப்படுகிறது.","Household members aged 18 or older":"18 அல்லது பழைய வீட்டு உறுப்பினர்கள்","Household members under 18":"18 இன் கீழ் வீட்டு உறுப்பினர்கள்","2026 municipality cap group":"2026 நகராட்சி தொப்பி குழு","Other municipalities":"பிற நகராட்சிகள்","Oslo":"ஒஸ்லோ","Bergen, Trondheim, Tromsø, Stavanger or Bærum":"பெர்கன், ட்ரொண்ட்ஹெய்ம், ட்ரோம்சோ, ஸ்டாவஞ்சர் அல்லது பாரம்","Kristiansand, Skedsmo, Frogn, Lørenskog, Nordre Follo, Asker, Nesodden, Sola or Sandnes":"கிறிஸ்டியன்சாண்ட், ஸ்கெட்ஸ்மோ, தவளை, லோரென்ஸ்காக், நோர்ட்ரே ஃபோலோ, ஆஸ்கர், நெசோடன், சோலா அல்லது சாண்ட்னெஸ்","Estimate monthly amount":"மாதாந்திரத் தொகையை மதிப்பிடவும்","Clear entries":"உள்ளீடுகளை அழிக்கவும்","Enter the household’s monthly income basis, approved housing costs and composition.":"குடும்பத்தின் மாத வருமானம், அங்கீகரிக்கப்பட்ட வீட்டுச் செலவுகள் மற்றும் கலவை ஆகியவற்றை உள்ளிடவும்.","Scenario calculated on this device. Husbanken decides actual cases.":"இந்தச் சாதனத்தில் காட்சி கணக்கிடப்பட்டது. ஹஸ்பாங்கன் உண்மையான வழக்குகளை முடிவு செய்கிறார்.","Entries cleared.":"பதிவுகள் அழிக்கப்பட்டன.","Check the monthly amounts, household counts and municipality group.":"மாதாந்திரத் தொகைகள், வீட்டுக் கணக்குகள் மற்றும் நகராட்சிக் குழுவைச் சரிபார்க்கவும்.","Standard monthly scenario":"தரமான மாதாந்திர காட்சி","Estimated monthly housing benefit":"மதிப்பீடு செய்யப்பட்ட மாதாந்திர வீட்டுப் பலன்","Monthly household income entered":"மாதாந்திர குடும்ப வருமானம் உள்ளிடப்பட்டது","Household income weight":"வீட்டு வருமான எடை","Weighted monthly income":"மாதாந்திர வருமானம்","Estimated monthly own contribution":"மாதாந்திர சொந்த பங்களிப்பு","Approved housing costs entered":"அங்கீகரிக்கப்பட்ட வீட்டுச் செலவுகள் உள்ளிடப்பட்டுள்ளன","Monthly housing-cost cap":"மாதாந்திர வீட்டு செலவு வரம்பு","Approved costs used after cap":"தொப்பிக்குப் பிறகு பயன்படுத்தப்படும் அங்கீகரிக்கப்பட்ட செலவுகள்","Costs remaining after own contribution":"சொந்த பங்களிப்புக்குப் பிறகு மீதமுள்ள செலவுகள்","Coverage rate":"கவரேஜ் விகிதம்","Assumptions used":"அனுமானங்கள் பயன்படுத்தப்பட்டன","The standard contribution thresholds and housing-cost caps use Husbanken’s 2026 rates checked 17 October 2026.":"நிலையான பங்களிப்பு வரம்புகள் மற்றும் வீட்டு விலை வரம்புகள் Husbanken இன் 2026 விகிதங்களைப் பயன்படுத்துகின்றன 17 அக்டோபர் 2026.","Estimated benefit = max(0, approved costs after cap − own contribution) × 73.7%. Weighted income uses 1.00 for the first member, 0.13 for each additional member aged 18 or older and 0.15 for each additional member under 18.":"மதிப்பிடப்பட்ட பலன் = அதிகபட்சம்(0, தொப்பிக்குப் பிறகு அனுமதிக்கப்பட்ட செலவுகள் - சொந்த பங்களிப்பு) × 73.7%. எடையுள்ள வருமானம் முதல் உறுப்பினருக்கு 1.00 ஐப் பயன்படுத்துகிறது, 18 அல்லது அதற்கு மேற்பட்ட ஒவ்வொரு கூடுதல் உறுப்பினருக்கும் 0.13 மற்றும் 18 இன் கீழ் ஒவ்வொரு கூடுதல் உறுப்பினருக்கும் 0.15.","The entered income must already follow Husbanken’s income rules. Special thresholds, the separate household income ceiling, payout floor and personal eligibility are not calculated.":"உள்ளீடு செய்யப்பட்ட வருமானம் ஏற்கனவே ஹஸ்பாங்கனின் வருமான விதிகளைப் பின்பற்ற வேண்டும். சிறப்பு வரம்புகள், தனி குடும்ப வருமான உச்சவரம்பு, செலுத்தும் தளம் மற்றும் தனிப்பட்ட தகுதி ஆகியவை கணக்கிடப்படவில்லை.","Private, local calculation. No figures are uploaded or stored by this page.":"தனிப்பட்ட, உள்ளூர் கணக்கீடு. இந்தப் பக்கத்தில் எந்த புள்ளிவிவரங்களும் பதிவேற்றப்படவில்லை அல்லது சேமிக்கப்படவில்லை.","Husbanken: calculation":"Husbanken: கணக்கீடு","Husbanken: income basis":"Husbanken: வருமான அடிப்படையில்","Husbanken: 2026 own-contribution rates":"Husbanken: 2026 சொந்த பங்களிப்பு விகிதங்கள்","Husbanken: 2026 housing-cost caps":"ஹஸ்பேங்கன்: 2026 வீட்டு விலை வரம்புகள்","Open Husbanken’s official calculator":"Husbanken இன் அதிகாரப்பூர்வ கால்குலேட்டரைத் திறக்கவும்"},"te":{"Norway Housing Benefit Estimator":"నార్వే హౌసింగ్ బెనిఫిట్ ఎస్టిమేటర్","Norway Housing Benefit Calculator 2026 — Monthly Scenario":"నార్వే హౌసింగ్ బెనిఫిట్ కాలిక్యులేటర్ 2026 — నెలవారీ దృశ్యం","Estimate a standard monthly Norwegian housing-benefit scenario from the household income basis, approved housing costs, household size and municipality group. See the 2026 assumptions and continue to Husbanken for a current eligibility check.":"గృహ ఆదాయ ప్రాతిపదికన, ఆమోదించబడిన గృహ ఖర్చులు, గృహ పరిమాణం మరియు మునిసిపాలిటీ సమూహం నుండి ప్రామాణిక నెలవారీ నార్వేజియన్ గృహ-ప్రయోజన దృశ్యాన్ని అంచనా వేయండి. 2026 అంచనాలను చూడండి మరియు ప్రస్తుత అర్హత తనిఖీ కోసం Husbankenకి కొనసాగండి.","Use this private scenario to understand how Norway’s housing-benefit formula combines approved housing costs, weighted household income and the 2026 coverage rate. The interface language never changes the Norwegian rules.":"నార్వే యొక్క హౌసింగ్-బెనిఫిట్ ఫార్ములా ఆమోదించబడిన గృహ ఖర్చులు, వెయిటెడ్ గృహ ఆదాయం మరియు 2026 కవరేజ్ రేటును ఎలా మిళితం చేస్తుందో అర్థం చేసుకోవడానికి ఈ ప్రైవేట్ దృష్టాంతాన్ని ఉపయోగించండి. ఇంటర్ఫేస్ భాష నార్వేజియన్ నియమాలను ఎప్పుడూ మార్చదు.","Calculations run in this browser. Entries are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"ఈ బ్రౌజర్‌లో లెక్కలు అమలవుతాయి. ఎంట్రీలు సర్వర్‌కు పంపబడవు లేదా ఈ సాధనం ద్వారా సేవ్ చేయబడవు.","Example":"ఉదాహరణ","For one household member with no income and NOK 8,000 in monthly approved housing costs, the 2026 standard own contribution is about NOK 2,215 per month. The estimated benefit is about NOK 4,032 after applying the 73.7% rate.":"నెలవారీ ఆమోదించబడిన గృహ ఖర్చులలో ఎటువంటి ఆదాయం మరియు NOK 8,000 లేని ఒక గృహ సభ్యునికి, 2026 ప్రామాణిక స్వంత సహకారం నెలకు NOK 2,215. 73.7% రేటును వర్తింపజేసిన తర్వాత అంచనా ప్రయోజనం NOK 4,032.","How the scenario works":"దృశ్యం ఎలా పని చేస్తుంది","The tool divides household income by the official household weight, calculates the standard own contribution from weighted annual income, limits approved housing costs by the household-size and municipality cap, subtracts the monthly own contribution and applies 73.7%.":"ఈ సాధనం గృహ ఆదాయాన్ని అధికారిక గృహ బరువుతో భాగిస్తుంది, వెయిటెడ్ వార్షిక ఆదాయం నుండి ప్రామాణిక సొంత సహకారాన్ని గణిస్తుంది, గృహ-పరిమాణం మరియు మునిసిపాలిటీ క్యాప్ ద్వారా ఆమోదించబడిన గృహ ఖర్చులను పరిమితం చేస్తుంది, నెలవారీ స్వంత సహకారాన్ని తీసివేస్తుంది మరియు 73.7%ని వర్తిస్తుంది.","Common questions":"సాధారణ ప్రశ్నలు","Is this an official award or eligibility decision?":"ఇది అధికారిక అవార్డు లేదా అర్హత నిర్ణయమా?","No. It is a standard-case scenario, not an application or decision. Husbanken’s official calculator applies current eligibility limits, personal rules and the month being checked.":"నం. ఇది ప్రామాణిక-కేస్ దృశ్యం, అప్లికేషన్ లేదా నిర్ణయం కాదు. Husbanken యొక్క అధికారిక కాలిక్యులేటర్ ప్రస్తుత అర్హత పరిమితులు, వ్యక్తిగత నియమాలు మరియు తనిఖీ చేయబడిన నెలను వర్తింపజేస్తుంది.","What should I enter as household income?":"నేను గృహ ఆదాయంగా ఏమి నమోదు చేయాలి?","Enter the monthly household income basis used by Husbanken before household weighting. It may include taxable monthly income, reportable annual income converted to a month, applicable wealth supplement and tax-free rental income. Children’s income and several named benefits are excluded. Check Husbanken’s income guidance.":"హస్‌బ్యాంకెన్ గృహాల వెయిటింగ్‌కు ముందు ఉపయోగించిన నెలవారీ గృహ ఆదాయ ప్రాతిపదికను నమోదు చేయండి. ఇందులో పన్ను విధించదగిన నెలవారీ ఆదాయం, నివేదించదగిన వార్షిక ఆదాయం నెలకు మార్చడం, వర్తించే సంపద అనుబంధం మరియు పన్ను రహిత అద్దె ఆదాయం వంటివి ఉండవచ్చు. పిల్లల ఆదాయం మరియు అనేక పేరున్న ప్రయోజనాలు మినహాయించబడ్డాయి. Husbanken ఆదాయ మార్గదర్శకాన్ని తనిఖీ చేయండి.","What counts as approved housing costs?":"ఆమోదించబడిన గృహ ఖర్చులు దేనిని లెక్కించాలి?","Husbanken counts costs differently for renters, shared-cost housing and detached homes. Enter the amount already worked out under its current rules, not every housing bill. The result is still capped by household size and municipality.":"హస్‌బ్యాంకెన్ అద్దెదారులు, భాగస్వామ్య ఖర్చుతో కూడిన గృహాలు మరియు వేరుచేసిన గృహాల కోసం వేర్వేరుగా ఖర్చులను గణిస్తారు. ప్రతి హౌసింగ్ బిల్లు కాకుండా దాని ప్రస్తుత నిబంధనల ప్రకారం ఇప్పటికే పనిచేసిన మొత్తాన్ని నమోదు చేయండి. ఫలితం ఇప్పటికీ ఇంటి పరిమాణం మరియు మునిసిపాలిటీ ద్వారా పరిమితం చేయబడింది.","Does changing language change the rules?":"భాషను మార్చడం నియమాలను మారుస్తుందా?","No. This tool estimates a Norway-only 2026 scenario in every interface language.":"నం. ఈ సాధనం ప్రతి ఇంటర్‌ఫేస్ భాషలో నార్వే-మాత్రమే 2026 దృశ్యాన్ని అంచనా వేస్తుంది.","Scope and limits":"స్కోప్ మరియు పరిమితులు","Norway only. This standard-case estimate does not decide eligibility or model the separate upper household-income limit, minimum payout, single old-age pensioner or young-disabled thresholds, special-adapted housing, transition rules, or every income and asset exception. The 2026 rates are static and must be rechecked against Husbanken. Use its official calculator for the month you are checking.":"నార్వే మాత్రమే. ఈ ప్రామాణిక-కేస్ అంచనా అర్హతను నిర్ణయించదు లేదా ప్రత్యేక ఉన్నత గృహ-ఆదాయ పరిమితి, కనీస చెల్లింపు, ఒకే వృద్ధాప్య పెన్షనర్ లేదా యువ-వికలాంగుల పరిమితులు, ప్రత్యేక-అడాప్టెడ్ హౌసింగ్, పరివర్తన నియమాలు లేదా ప్రతి ఆదాయం మరియు ఆస్తి మినహాయింపును నిర్ణయించదు. 2026 రేట్లు స్థిరంగా ఉన్నాయి మరియు తప్పనిసరిగా Husbankenకి వ్యతిరేకంగా మళ్లీ తనిఖీ చేయాలి. మీరు తనిఖీ చేస్తున్న నెల కోసం దాని అధికారిక కాలిక్యులేటర్‌ని ఉపయోగించండి.","Estimate a standard monthly scenario":"ప్రామాణిక నెలవారీ దృష్టాంతాన్ని అంచనా వేయండి","Norwegian rules only · standard 2026 rates · checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country or rules.":"నార్వేజియన్ నియమాలు మాత్రమే · ప్రామాణిక 2026 రేట్లు · తనిఖీ చేయబడిన 17 అక్టోబర్ 2026 · భాష దేశం లేదా నియమాలను మార్చదు.","Monthly household income basis before weighting, NOK":"వెయిటింగ్ ముందు నెలవారీ గృహ ఆదాయం ఆధారంగా, NOK","Use the gross monthly basis Husbanken applies, including any applicable wealth supplement and tax-free rental income. Exclude items Husbanken says do not count. See its income guide before relying on a result.":"ఏదైనా వర్తించే సంపద అనుబంధం మరియు పన్ను రహిత అద్దె ఆదాయంతో సహా Husbanken వర్తించే స్థూల నెలవారీ ప్రాతిపదికను ఉపయోగించండి. లెక్కించవద్దు అని హుస్‌బ్యాంకెన్ చెప్పిన అంశాలను మినహాయించండి. ఫలితంపై ఆధారపడే ముందు దాని ఆదాయ మార్గదర్శిని చూడండి.","Monthly housing costs already approved under Husbanken rules, NOK":"Husbanken నియమాలు, NOK ప్రకారం ఇప్పటికే ఆమోదించబడిన నెలవారీ గృహ ఖర్చులు","Do not add every housing bill. Approved costs differ for rental, shared-cost and detached housing; enter the monthly amount under current Husbanken rules. A household and municipality cap is applied below.":"ప్రతి హౌసింగ్ బిల్లును జోడించవద్దు. ఆమోదించబడిన ఖర్చులు అద్దె, భాగస్వామ్య-ఖర్చు మరియు వేరు చేయబడిన గృహాలకు భిన్నంగా ఉంటాయి; ప్రస్తుత Husbanken నిబంధనల ప్రకారం నెలవారీ మొత్తాన్ని నమోదు చేయండి. గృహ మరియు మునిసిపాలిటీ క్యాప్ క్రింద వర్తించబడుతుంది.","Household members aged 18 or older":"18 లేదా అంతకంటే ఎక్కువ వయస్సు గల గృహ సభ్యులు","Household members under 18":"18 కింద గృహ సభ్యులు","2026 municipality cap group":"2026 మునిసిపాలిటీ క్యాప్ గ్రూప్","Other municipalities":"ఇతర మున్సిపాలిటీలు","Oslo":"ఓస్లో","Bergen, Trondheim, Tromsø, Stavanger or Bærum":"బెర్గెన్, ట్రోండ్‌హీమ్, ట్రోమ్సో, స్టావాంజర్ లేదా బెరమ్","Kristiansand, Skedsmo, Frogn, Lørenskog, Nordre Follo, Asker, Nesodden, Sola or Sandnes":"క్రిస్టియన్‌సాండ్, స్కెడ్స్‌మో, ఫ్రాగ్న్, లోరెన్‌స్కోగ్, నోర్డ్రే ఫోలో, అస్కర్, నెసోడెన్, సోలా లేదా సాండ్‌నెస్","Estimate monthly amount":"నెలవారీ మొత్తాన్ని అంచనా వేయండి","Clear entries":"ఎంట్రీలను క్లియర్ చేయండి","Enter the household’s monthly income basis, approved housing costs and composition.":"కుటుంబం యొక్క నెలవారీ ఆదాయ ప్రాతిపదిక, ఆమోదించబడిన గృహ ఖర్చులు మరియు కూర్పును నమోదు చేయండి.","Scenario calculated on this device. Husbanken decides actual cases.":"ఈ పరికరంలో దృశ్యం లెక్కించబడింది. హస్బాంకెన్ వాస్తవ కేసులను నిర్ణయిస్తారు.","Entries cleared.":"ఎంట్రీలు క్లియర్ చేయబడ్డాయి.","Check the monthly amounts, household counts and municipality group.":"నెలవారీ మొత్తాలు, గృహాల గణనలు మరియు మునిసిపాలిటీ సమూహాన్ని తనిఖీ చేయండి.","Standard monthly scenario":"ప్రామాణిక నెలవారీ దృశ్యం","Estimated monthly housing benefit":"అంచనా వేయబడిన నెలవారీ గృహ ప్రయోజనం","Monthly household income entered":"నెలవారీ గృహ ఆదాయం నమోదు చేయబడింది","Household income weight":"గృహ ఆదాయ బరువు","Weighted monthly income":"వెయిటెడ్ నెలవారీ ఆదాయం","Estimated monthly own contribution":"అంచనా వేయబడిన నెలవారీ స్వంత సహకారం","Approved housing costs entered":"ఆమోదించబడిన గృహ ఖర్చులు నమోదు చేయబడ్డాయి","Monthly housing-cost cap":"నెలవారీ గృహ-వ్యయ పరిమితి","Approved costs used after cap":"క్యాప్ తర్వాత ఉపయోగించిన ఆమోదించబడిన ఖర్చులు","Costs remaining after own contribution":"సొంత సహకారం తర్వాత మిగిలిన ఖర్చులు","Coverage rate":"కవరేజ్ రేటు","Assumptions used":"ఉపయోగించబడిన ఊహలు","The standard contribution thresholds and housing-cost caps use Husbanken’s 2026 rates checked 17 October 2026.":"స్టాండర్డ్ కంట్రిబ్యూషన్ థ్రెషోల్డ్‌లు మరియు హౌసింగ్-కాస్ట్ క్యాప్‌లు Husbanken యొక్క 2026 రేట్లను ఉపయోగిస్తాయి 17 అక్టోబర్ 2026.","Estimated benefit = max(0, approved costs after cap − own contribution) × 73.7%. Weighted income uses 1.00 for the first member, 0.13 for each additional member aged 18 or older and 0.15 for each additional member under 18.":"అంచనా ప్రయోజనం = గరిష్టం(0, క్యాప్ తర్వాత ఆమోదించబడిన ఖర్చులు - స్వంత సహకారం) × 73.7%. వెయిటెడ్ ఆదాయం మొదటి సభ్యునికి 1.00ని ఉపయోగిస్తుంది, 18 లేదా అంతకంటే ఎక్కువ వయస్సు ఉన్న ప్రతి అదనపు సభ్యునికి 0.13 మరియు 18 కింద ప్రతి అదనపు సభ్యునికి 0.15.","The entered income must already follow Husbanken’s income rules. Special thresholds, the separate household income ceiling, payout floor and personal eligibility are not calculated.":"నమోదైన ఆదాయం తప్పనిసరిగా హుస్‌బ్యాంకెన్ ఆదాయ నియమాలను పాటించాలి. ప్రత్యేక పరిమితులు, ప్రత్యేక గృహ ఆదాయ పరిమితి, చెల్లింపు అంతస్తు మరియు వ్యక్తిగత అర్హతలు లెక్కించబడవు.","Private, local calculation. No figures are uploaded or stored by this page.":"ప్రైవేట్, స్థానిక గణన. ఈ పేజీ ద్వారా ఏ బొమ్మలు అప్‌లోడ్ చేయబడవు లేదా నిల్వ చేయబడవు.","Husbanken: calculation":"హస్బ్యాంకెన్: గణన","Husbanken: income basis":"హస్బ్యాంకెన్: ఆదాయ ఆధారం","Husbanken: 2026 own-contribution rates":"హస్బ్యాంకెన్: 2026 స్వంత-సహకార రేట్లు","Husbanken: 2026 housing-cost caps":"హస్బ్యాంకెన్: 2026 హౌసింగ్-కాస్ట్ క్యాప్స్","Open Husbanken’s official calculator":"హుస్‌బ్యాంకెన్ అధికారిక కాలిక్యులేటర్‌ను తెరవండి"},"th":{"Norway Housing Benefit Estimator":"ตัวประมาณผลประโยชน์ที่อยู่อาศัยของนอร์เวย์","Norway Housing Benefit Calculator 2026 — Monthly Scenario":"เครื่องคำนวณผลประโยชน์ที่อยู่อาศัยของนอร์เวย์ 2026 — สถานการณ์รายเดือน","Estimate a standard monthly Norwegian housing-benefit scenario from the household income basis, approved housing costs, household size and municipality group. See the 2026 assumptions and continue to Husbanken for a current eligibility check.":"ประมาณการสถานการณ์ผลประโยชน์ที่อยู่อาศัยของนอร์เวย์มาตรฐานรายเดือนจากเกณฑ์รายได้ของครัวเรือน ต้นทุนที่อยู่อาศัยที่ได้รับอนุมัติ ขนาดครัวเรือน และกลุ่มเทศบาล ดูสมมติฐานของ 2026 และไปที่ Husbanken เพื่อตรวจสอบสิทธิ์ในปัจจุบัน","Use this private scenario to understand how Norway’s housing-benefit formula combines approved housing costs, weighted household income and the 2026 coverage rate. The interface language never changes the Norwegian rules.":"ใช้สถานการณ์ส่วนตัวนี้เพื่อทำความเข้าใจว่าสูตรผลประโยชน์ที่อยู่อาศัยของนอร์เวย์ผสมผสานต้นทุนที่อยู่อาศัยที่ได้รับอนุมัติ รายได้ครัวเรือนแบบถ่วงน้ำหนัก และอัตราความครอบคลุมของ 2026 ได้อย่างไร ภาษาอินเทอร์เฟซไม่เคยเปลี่ยนแปลงกฎของนอร์เวย์","Calculations run in this browser. Entries are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"การคำนวณทำงานในเบราว์เซอร์นี้ รายการจะไม่ถูกส่งไปยังเซิร์ฟเวอร์หรือบันทึกโดยเครื่องมือนี้","Example":"ตัวอย่าง","For one household member with no income and NOK 8,000 in monthly approved housing costs, the 2026 standard own contribution is about NOK 2,215 per month. The estimated benefit is about NOK 4,032 after applying the 73.7% rate.":"สำหรับสมาชิกในครัวเรือนหนึ่งรายที่ไม่มีรายได้และมี NOK 8,000 อยู่ในค่าใช้จ่ายที่อยู่อาศัยที่ได้รับการอนุมัติรายเดือน เงินบริจาคมาตรฐานของ 2026 จะอยู่ที่ประมาณ NOK 2,215 ต่อเดือน ผลประโยชน์โดยประมาณคือประมาณ NOK 4,032 หลังจากใช้อัตรา 73.7%","How the scenario works":"สถานการณ์นี้ทำงานอย่างไร","The tool divides household income by the official household weight, calculates the standard own contribution from weighted annual income, limits approved housing costs by the household-size and municipality cap, subtracts the monthly own contribution and applies 73.7%.":"เครื่องมือจะแบ่งรายได้ครัวเรือนด้วยน้ำหนักครัวเรือนอย่างเป็นทางการ คำนวณเงินสมทบมาตรฐานของตัวเองจากรายได้ต่อปีแบบถ่วงน้ำหนัก จำกัดต้นทุนที่อยู่อาศัยที่ได้รับอนุมัติตามขนาดครัวเรือนและขีดจำกัดของเทศบาล ลบเงินบริจาครายเดือนของตัวเอง และใช้ 73.7%","Common questions":"คำถามที่พบบ่อย","Is this an official award or eligibility decision?":"นี่เป็นการตัดสินรางวัลหรือคุณสมบัติอย่างเป็นทางการหรือไม่","No. It is a standard-case scenario, not an application or decision. Husbanken’s official calculator applies current eligibility limits, personal rules and the month being checked.":"No. มันเป็นสถานการณ์ที่เป็นกรณีมาตรฐาน ไม่ใช่การสมัครหรือการตัดสินใจ เครื่องคิดเลขอย่างเป็นทางการของ Husbanken ใช้ข้อจำกัดคุณสมบัติในปัจจุบัน กฎส่วนบุคคล และเดือนที่กำลังตรวจสอบ","What should I enter as household income?":"ฉันควรระบุอะไรเป็นรายได้ครัวเรือน?","Enter the monthly household income basis used by Husbanken before household weighting. It may include taxable monthly income, reportable annual income converted to a month, applicable wealth supplement and tax-free rental income. Children’s income and several named benefits are excluded. Check Husbanken’s income guidance.":"ป้อนเกณฑ์รายได้ครัวเรือนต่อเดือนที่ Husbanken ใช้ก่อนชั่งน้ำหนักครัวเรือน อาจรวมถึงรายได้ต่อเดือนที่ต้องเสียภาษี รายได้ต่อปีที่รายงานซึ่งแปลงเป็นเดือน เงินเสริมความมั่งคั่งที่เกี่ยวข้อง และรายได้ค่าเช่าปลอดภาษี ไม่รวมรายได้ของเด็กและผลประโยชน์ที่ระบุชื่อหลายประการ ตรวจสอบคำแนะนำรายได้ของ Husbanken","What counts as approved housing costs?":"สิ่งที่นับเป็นต้นทุนที่อยู่อาศัยที่ได้รับอนุมัติคืออะไร","Husbanken counts costs differently for renters, shared-cost housing and detached homes. Enter the amount already worked out under its current rules, not every housing bill. The result is still capped by household size and municipality.":"Husbanken นับค่าใช้จ่ายที่แตกต่างกันสำหรับผู้เช่า บ้านแบบแบ่งค่าใช้จ่าย และบ้านเดี่ยว ป้อนจำนวนเงินที่คำนวณแล้วภายใต้กฎปัจจุบัน ไม่ใช่บิลค่าที่อยู่อาศัยทุกใบ ผลลัพธ์ยังคงถูกจำกัดด้วยขนาดครัวเรือนและเขตเทศบาล","Does changing language change the rules?":"การเปลี่ยนภาษาเปลี่ยนกฎหรือไม่?","No. This tool estimates a Norway-only 2026 scenario in every interface language.":"No. เครื่องมือนี้จะประมาณสถานการณ์จำลอง 2026 ของนอร์เวย์เท่านั้นในทุกภาษาอินเทอร์เฟซ","Scope and limits":"ขอบเขตและขีดจำกัด","Norway only. This standard-case estimate does not decide eligibility or model the separate upper household-income limit, minimum payout, single old-age pensioner or young-disabled thresholds, special-adapted housing, transition rules, or every income and asset exception. The 2026 rates are static and must be rechecked against Husbanken. Use its official calculator for the month you are checking.":"นอร์เวย์เท่านั้น การประมาณการกรณีมาตรฐานนี้ไม่ได้ตัดสินคุณสมบัติหรือแบบจำลองขีดจำกัดรายได้สูงสุดของครัวเรือนที่แยกจากกัน การจ่ายเงินขั้นต่ำ ผู้รับบำนาญวัยชราคนเดียวหรือเกณฑ์ขั้นต่ำสำหรับคนพิการอายุน้อย ที่อยู่อาศัยที่ดัดแปลงเป็นพิเศษ กฎการเปลี่ยนผ่าน หรือข้อยกเว้นรายได้และทรัพย์สินทุกรายการ อัตรา 2026 เป็นแบบคงที่และต้องตรวจสอบกับ Husbanken อีกครั้ง ใช้เครื่องคิดเลขอย่างเป็นทางการสำหรับเดือนที่คุณกำลังตรวจสอบ","Estimate a standard monthly scenario":"ประมาณการสถานการณ์มาตรฐานรายเดือน","Norwegian rules only · standard 2026 rates · checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country or rules.":"กฎของนอร์เวย์เท่านั้น · อัตรามาตรฐาน 2026 · ตรวจสอบแล้ว 17 ตุลาคม 2026 · ภาษาไม่เปลี่ยนประเทศหรือกฎ","Monthly household income basis before weighting, NOK":"พื้นฐานรายได้ครัวเรือนรายเดือนก่อนชั่งน้ำหนัก, NOK","Use the gross monthly basis Husbanken applies, including any applicable wealth supplement and tax-free rental income. Exclude items Husbanken says do not count. See its income guide before relying on a result.":"ใช้ยอดรวมรายเดือนที่ Husbanken นำไปใช้ รวมถึงรายได้เสริมด้านความมั่งคั่งที่เกี่ยวข้องและรายได้ค่าเช่าปลอดภาษี ไม่รวมรายการที่ Husbanken บอกว่าไม่นับ ดูคู่มือรายได้ก่อนที่จะพึ่งพาผลลัพธ์","Monthly housing costs already approved under Husbanken rules, NOK":"ต้นทุนที่อยู่อาศัยรายเดือนได้รับการอนุมัติแล้วภายใต้กฎ Husbanken, NOK","Do not add every housing bill. Approved costs differ for rental, shared-cost and detached housing; enter the monthly amount under current Husbanken rules. A household and municipality cap is applied below.":"ไม่ต้องบวกบิลค่าบ้านทุกใบ ต้นทุนที่ได้รับอนุมัติจะแตกต่างกันไปสำหรับค่าเช่า ต้นทุนร่วม และบ้านเดี่ยว ป้อนจำนวนเงินรายเดือนภายใต้กฎ Husbanken ปัจจุบัน ด้านล่างนี้จะใช้ขีดจำกัดของครัวเรือนและเทศบาล","Household members aged 18 or older":"สมาชิกในครัวเรือนที่มีอายุ 18 ขึ้นไป","Household members under 18":"สมาชิกในครัวเรือนภายใต้ 18","2026 municipality cap group":"2026 กลุ่มหมวกเทศบาล","Other municipalities":"เทศบาลอื่นๆ","Oslo":"ออสโล","Bergen, Trondheim, Tromsø, Stavanger or Bærum":"แบร์เกน, ทรอนด์เฮม, ทรอมโซ, สตาวังเงร์ หรือ เบรุม","Kristiansand, Skedsmo, Frogn, Lørenskog, Nordre Follo, Asker, Nesodden, Sola or Sandnes":"คริสเตียนแซนด์, สเคดสโม, ฟรอกน์, โลเรนสกอก, นอร์เดร โฟลโล, แอสเคอร์, เนซอสเดน, โซล่า หรือแซนด์เนส","Estimate monthly amount":"ประมาณการจำนวนเงินต่อเดือน","Clear entries":"ล้างรายการ","Enter the household’s monthly income basis, approved housing costs and composition.":"ป้อนเกณฑ์รายได้ต่อเดือนของครัวเรือน ต้นทุนที่อยู่อาศัยที่ได้รับอนุมัติ และองค์ประกอบ","Scenario calculated on this device. Husbanken decides actual cases.":"สถานการณ์จำลองที่คำนวณบนอุปกรณ์นี้ ฮุสบันเกนเป็นผู้ตัดสินคดีที่เกิดขึ้นจริง","Entries cleared.":"รายการถูกล้างแล้ว","Check the monthly amounts, household counts and municipality group.":"ตรวจสอบยอดเงินรายเดือน จำนวนครัวเรือน และกลุ่มเทศบาล","Standard monthly scenario":"สถานการณ์มาตรฐานรายเดือน","Estimated monthly housing benefit":"ผลประโยชน์ที่อยู่อาศัยโดยประมาณต่อเดือน","Monthly household income entered":"ป้อนรายได้ครัวเรือนรายเดือน","Household income weight":"น้ำหนักรายได้ครัวเรือน","Weighted monthly income":"รายได้ต่อเดือนแบบถ่วงน้ำหนัก","Estimated monthly own contribution":"เงินสมทบรายเดือนโดยประมาณ","Approved housing costs entered":"ป้อนต้นทุนที่อยู่อาศัยที่ได้รับอนุมัติแล้ว","Monthly housing-cost cap":"ขีดจำกัดต้นทุนที่อยู่อาศัยรายเดือน","Approved costs used after cap":"ต้นทุนที่ได้รับอนุมัติใช้หลังฝาปิด","Costs remaining after own contribution":"ต้นทุนที่เหลือหลังจากบริจาคเอง","Coverage rate":"อัตราการครอบคลุม","Assumptions used":"สมมติฐานที่ใช้","The standard contribution thresholds and housing-cost caps use Husbanken’s 2026 rates checked 17 October 2026.":"เกณฑ์การบริจาคมาตรฐานและขีดจำกัดต้นทุนที่อยู่อาศัยใช้อัตรา 2026 ของ Husbanken ที่ตรวจสอบ 17 ตุลาคม 2026","Estimated benefit = max(0, approved costs after cap − own contribution) × 73.7%. Weighted income uses 1.00 for the first member, 0.13 for each additional member aged 18 or older and 0.15 for each additional member under 18.":"ผลประโยชน์โดยประมาณ = สูงสุด (0, ต้นทุนที่อนุมัติหลัง cap − การสนับสนุนของตัวเอง) × 73.7% รายได้แบบถ่วงน้ำหนักจะใช้ 1.00 สำหรับสมาชิกคนแรก, 0.13 สำหรับสมาชิกเพิ่มเติมแต่ละคนที่มีอายุ 18 หรือเก่ากว่า และ 0.15 สำหรับสมาชิกเพิ่มเติมแต่ละคนภายใต้ 18","The entered income must already follow Husbanken’s income rules. Special thresholds, the separate household income ceiling, payout floor and personal eligibility are not calculated.":"รายได้ที่ป้อนต้องเป็นไปตามกฎรายได้ของ Husbanken แล้ว เกณฑ์พิเศษ เพดานรายได้ครัวเรือนที่แยกจากกัน ขั้นต่ำการจ่ายเงิน และคุณสมบัติส่วนบุคคลจะไม่ถูกคำนวณ","Private, local calculation. No figures are uploaded or stored by this page.":"การคำนวณแบบส่วนตัวในเครื่อง ไม่มีการอัพโหลดหรือจัดเก็บตัวเลขในหน้านี้","Husbanken: calculation":"Husbanken: การคำนวณ","Husbanken: income basis":"Husbanken: พื้นฐานรายได้","Husbanken: 2026 own-contribution rates":"Husbanken: 2026 อัตราการบริจาคของตัวเอง","Husbanken: 2026 housing-cost caps":"Husbanken: 2026 ตัวพิมพ์ใหญ่ราคาที่อยู่อาศัย","Open Husbanken’s official calculator":"เปิดเครื่องคิดเลขอย่างเป็นทางการของ Husbanken"},"tl":{"Norway Housing Benefit Estimator":"Norway Housing Benefit Estimator","Norway Housing Benefit Calculator 2026 — Monthly Scenario":"Norway Housing Benefit Calculator 2026 — Buwanang Sitwasyon","Estimate a standard monthly Norwegian housing-benefit scenario from the household income basis, approved housing costs, household size and municipality group. See the 2026 assumptions and continue to Husbanken for a current eligibility check.":"Tantyahin ang isang karaniwang buwanang Norwegian na senaryo ng benepisyo sa pabahay mula sa batayan ng kita ng sambahayan, mga inaprubahang gastos sa pabahay, laki ng sambahayan at grupo ng munisipalidad. Tingnan ang mga pagpapalagay na 2026 at magpatuloy sa Husbanken para sa kasalukuyang pagsusuri sa pagiging karapat-dapat.","Use this private scenario to understand how Norway’s housing-benefit formula combines approved housing costs, weighted household income and the 2026 coverage rate. The interface language never changes the Norwegian rules.":"Gamitin ang pribadong senaryo na ito upang maunawaan kung paano pinagsasama ng formula ng benepisyo sa pabahay ng Norway ang mga inaprubahang gastos sa pabahay, timbang na kita ng sambahayan at ang rate ng saklaw ng 2026. Hindi kailanman binabago ng wika ng interface ang mga panuntunang Norwegian.","Calculations run in this browser. Entries are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"Ang mga kalkulasyon ay tumatakbo sa browser na ito. Ang mga entry ay hindi ipinadala sa isang server o nai-save ng tool na ito.","Example":"Halimbawa","For one household member with no income and NOK 8,000 in monthly approved housing costs, the 2026 standard own contribution is about NOK 2,215 per month. The estimated benefit is about NOK 4,032 after applying the 73.7% rate.":"Para sa isang miyembro ng sambahayan na walang kita at NOK 8,000 sa buwanang naaprubahang mga gastos sa pabahay, ang karaniwang 2026 na sariling kontribusyon ay humigit-kumulang NOK 2,215 bawat buwan. Ang tinantyang benepisyo ay tungkol sa NOK 4,032 pagkatapos ilapat ang 73.7% rate.","How the scenario works":"Paano gumagana ang senaryo","The tool divides household income by the official household weight, calculates the standard own contribution from weighted annual income, limits approved housing costs by the household-size and municipality cap, subtracts the monthly own contribution and applies 73.7%.":"Hinahati ng tool ang kita ng sambahayan sa opisyal na timbang ng sambahayan, kinakalkula ang karaniwang sariling kontribusyon mula sa timbang na taunang kita, nililimitahan ang mga inaprubahang gastos sa pabahay ayon sa laki ng sambahayan at cap ng munisipyo, binabawasan ang buwanang sariling kontribusyon at inilalapat ang 73.7%.","Common questions":"Mga karaniwang tanong","Is this an official award or eligibility decision?":"Ito ba ay isang opisyal na parangal o desisyon sa pagiging kwalipikado?","No. It is a standard-case scenario, not an application or decision. Husbanken’s official calculator applies current eligibility limits, personal rules and the month being checked.":"Hindi. Ito ay isang karaniwang senaryo ng kaso, hindi isang aplikasyon o desisyon. Inilalapat ng opisyal na calculator ng Husbanken ang mga kasalukuyang limitasyon sa pagiging karapat-dapat, mga personal na panuntunan at ang buwang sinusuri.","What should I enter as household income?":"Ano ang dapat kong ipasok bilang kita ng sambahayan?","Enter the monthly household income basis used by Husbanken before household weighting. It may include taxable monthly income, reportable annual income converted to a month, applicable wealth supplement and tax-free rental income. Children’s income and several named benefits are excluded. Check Husbanken’s income guidance.":"Ilagay ang buwanang batayan ng kita ng sambahayan na ginagamit ng Husbanken bago ang timbang ng sambahayan. Maaaring kabilang dito ang nabubuwisang buwanang kita, naiuulat na taunang kita na na-convert sa isang buwan, naaangkop na supplement sa yaman at kita na walang buwis sa pag-upa. Ang kita ng mga bata at ilang pinangalanang benepisyo ay hindi kasama. Tingnan ang gabay sa kita ni Husbanken.","What counts as approved housing costs?":"Ano ang binibilang bilang naaprubahang mga gastos sa pabahay?","Husbanken counts costs differently for renters, shared-cost housing and detached homes. Enter the amount already worked out under its current rules, not every housing bill. The result is still capped by household size and municipality.":"Magkaiba ang pagbibilang ng Husbanken ng mga gastos para sa mga umuupa, shared-cost housing at detached na bahay. Ilagay ang halagang nagawa na sa ilalim ng mga kasalukuyang tuntunin nito, hindi lahat ng bayarin sa pabahay. Ang resulta ay nililimitahan pa rin ng laki ng sambahayan at munisipalidad.","Does changing language change the rules?":"Nababago ba ng pagbabago ng wika ang mga patakaran?","No. This tool estimates a Norway-only 2026 scenario in every interface language.":"Hindi. Tinatantya ng tool na ito ang isang 2026 na senaryo sa Norway lamang sa bawat wika ng interface.","Scope and limits":"Saklaw at limitasyon","Norway only. This standard-case estimate does not decide eligibility or model the separate upper household-income limit, minimum payout, single old-age pensioner or young-disabled thresholds, special-adapted housing, transition rules, or every income and asset exception. The 2026 rates are static and must be rechecked against Husbanken. Use its official calculator for the month you are checking.":"Norway lang. Ang pagtatantya ng karaniwang kaso na ito ay hindi nagpapasya sa pagiging karapat-dapat o modelo ng hiwalay na limitasyon sa itaas na kita ng sambahayan, pinakamababang pagbabayad, mga limitasyon ng pensiyonado sa nag-iisang gulang o kabataang may kapansanan, pabahay na espesyal na inangkop, mga panuntunan sa paglipat, o bawat pagbubukod sa kita at asset. Ang mga rate ng 2026 ay static at dapat suriin muli laban sa Husbanken. Gamitin ang opisyal na calculator nito para sa buwan na iyong sinusuri.","Estimate a standard monthly scenario":"Tantyahin ang isang karaniwang buwanang senaryo","Norwegian rules only · standard 2026 rates · checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country or rules.":"Norwegian rules lang · standard 2026 rate · checked 17 October 2026 · hindi binabago ng wika ang bansa o mga panuntunan.","Monthly household income basis before weighting, NOK":"Buwanang batayan ng kita ng sambahayan bago timbangin, NOK","Use the gross monthly basis Husbanken applies, including any applicable wealth supplement and tax-free rental income. Exclude items Husbanken says do not count. See its income guide before relying on a result.":"Gamitin ang kabuuang buwanang batayan na inilalapat ng Husbanken, kabilang ang anumang naaangkop na supplement ng yaman at kita na walang buwis sa pag-upa. Ibukod ang mga item na sinabi ni Husbanken na hindi binibilang. Tingnan ang gabay sa kita nito bago umasa sa isang resulta.","Monthly housing costs already approved under Husbanken rules, NOK":"Inaprubahan na ang mga buwanang gastos sa pabahay sa ilalim ng mga panuntunan ng Husbanken, NOK","Do not add every housing bill. Approved costs differ for rental, shared-cost and detached housing; enter the monthly amount under current Husbanken rules. A household and municipality cap is applied below.":"Huwag idagdag ang bawat bayarin sa pabahay. Naiiba ang mga inaprubahang gastos para sa rental, shared-cost at detached housing; ilagay ang buwanang halaga sa ilalim ng kasalukuyang mga panuntunan ng Husbanken. Ang takip ng sambahayan at munisipalidad ay inilalapat sa ibaba.","Household members aged 18 or older":"Mga miyembro ng sambahayan na may edad na 18 o mas matanda","Household members under 18":"Mga miyembro ng sambahayan sa ilalim ng 18","2026 municipality cap group":"2026 pangkat ng cap ng munisipalidad","Other municipalities":"Iba pang munisipalidad","Oslo":"Oslo","Bergen, Trondheim, Tromsø, Stavanger or Bærum":"Bergen, Trondheim, Tromsø, Stavanger o Bærum","Kristiansand, Skedsmo, Frogn, Lørenskog, Nordre Follo, Asker, Nesodden, Sola or Sandnes":"Kristiansand, Skedsmo, Frogn, Lørenskog, Nordre Follo, Asker, Nesodden, Sola o Sandnes","Estimate monthly amount":"Tantyahin ang buwanang halaga","Clear entries":"I-clear ang mga entry","Enter the household’s monthly income basis, approved housing costs and composition.":"Ipasok ang buwanang kita ng sambahayan, naaprubahang mga gastos sa pabahay at komposisyon.","Scenario calculated on this device. Husbanken decides actual cases.":"Kinakalkula ang senaryo sa device na ito. Si Husbanken ang nagpapasya ng mga aktwal na kaso.","Entries cleared.":"Na-clear ang mga entry.","Check the monthly amounts, household counts and municipality group.":"Tingnan ang mga buwanang halaga, bilang ng sambahayan at grupo ng munisipalidad.","Standard monthly scenario":"Karaniwang buwanang senaryo","Estimated monthly housing benefit":"Tinantyang buwanang benepisyo sa pabahay","Monthly household income entered":"Inilagay ang buwanang kita ng sambahayan","Household income weight":"Timbang ng kita ng sambahayan","Weighted monthly income":"Tinimbang buwanang kita","Estimated monthly own contribution":"Tinantyang buwanang sariling kontribusyon","Approved housing costs entered":"Inilagay ang mga inaprubahang gastos sa pabahay","Monthly housing-cost cap":"Cap ng buwanang gastos sa pabahay","Approved costs used after cap":"Mga naaprubahang gastos na ginamit pagkatapos ng cap","Costs remaining after own contribution":"Mga natitirang gastos pagkatapos ng sariling kontribusyon","Coverage rate":"Rate ng coverage","Assumptions used":"Mga ginamit na pagpapalagay","The standard contribution thresholds and housing-cost caps use Husbanken’s 2026 rates checked 17 October 2026.":"Ang mga karaniwang limitasyon ng kontribusyon at mga limitasyon sa halaga ng pabahay ay gumagamit ng 2026 rate ng Husbanken na nasuri na 17 Oktubre 2026.","Estimated benefit = max(0, approved costs after cap − own contribution) × 73.7%. Weighted income uses 1.00 for the first member, 0.13 for each additional member aged 18 or older and 0.15 for each additional member under 18.":"Tinantyang benepisyo = max(0, mga inaprubahang gastos pagkatapos ng cap − sariling kontribusyon) × 73.7%. Ang timbang na kita ay gumagamit ng 1.00 para sa unang miyembro, 0.13 para sa bawat karagdagang miyembro na may edad na 18 o mas matanda at 0.15 para sa bawat karagdagang miyembro sa ilalim ng 18.","The entered income must already follow Husbanken’s income rules. Special thresholds, the separate household income ceiling, payout floor and personal eligibility are not calculated.":"Dapat sumunod na ang ipinasok na kita sa mga panuntunan sa kita ng Husbanken. Ang mga espesyal na threshold, ang hiwalay na kisame ng kita ng sambahayan, sahig ng pagbabayad at personal na pagiging karapat-dapat ay hindi kinakalkula.","Private, local calculation. No figures are uploaded or stored by this page.":"Pribado, lokal na pagkalkula. Walang mga numero na na-upload o nakaimbak ng pahinang ito.","Husbanken: calculation":"Husbanken: pagkalkula","Husbanken: income basis":"Husbanken: batayan ng kita","Husbanken: 2026 own-contribution rates":"Husbanken: 2026 na mga rate ng sariling kontribusyon","Husbanken: 2026 housing-cost caps":"Husbanken: 2026 na mga takip sa halaga ng pabahay","Open Husbanken’s official calculator":"Open Husbanken's official calculator"},"tr":{"Norway Housing Benefit Estimator":"Norveç Konut Faydası Tahmin Aracı","Norway Housing Benefit Calculator 2026 — Monthly Scenario":"Norveç Konut Yardımı Hesaplayıcı 2026 — Aylık Senaryo","Estimate a standard monthly Norwegian housing-benefit scenario from the household income basis, approved housing costs, household size and municipality group. See the 2026 assumptions and continue to Husbanken for a current eligibility check.":"Hanehalkı geliri esasına, onaylanmış konut maliyetlerine, hane büyüklüğüne ve belediye grubuna göre standart bir aylık Norveç konut yardımı senaryosunu tahmin edin. 2026 varsayımlarına bakın ve güncel uygunluk kontrolü için Husbanken'e devam edin.","Use this private scenario to understand how Norway’s housing-benefit formula combines approved housing costs, weighted household income and the 2026 coverage rate. The interface language never changes the Norwegian rules.":"Norveç'in konut yardımı formülünün onaylı konut maliyetlerini, ağırlıklı hane gelirini ve 2026 kapsama oranını nasıl birleştirdiğini anlamak için bu özel senaryoyu kullanın. Arayüz dili Norveç kurallarını asla değiştirmez.","Calculations run in this browser. Entries are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"Hesaplamalar bu tarayıcıda yürütülür. Girişler bu araç tarafından bir sunucuya gönderilmez veya kaydedilmez.","Example":"Örnek","For one household member with no income and NOK 8,000 in monthly approved housing costs, the 2026 standard own contribution is about NOK 2,215 per month. The estimated benefit is about NOK 4,032 after applying the 73.7% rate.":"Geliri olmayan ve aylık onaylı konut maliyetleri NOK 8,000 olan bir hane üyesi için 2026 standart öz katkı payı ayda yaklaşık 2,215 NOK'tur. Tahmini fayda, %73.7 oranı uygulandıktan sonra yaklaşık 4,032 NOK'tur.","How the scenario works":"Senaryo nasıl işliyor?","The tool divides household income by the official household weight, calculates the standard own contribution from weighted annual income, limits approved housing costs by the household-size and municipality cap, subtracts the monthly own contribution and applies 73.7%.":"Araç, hane gelirini resmi hane ağırlığına böler, ağırlıklı yıllık gelirden standart öz katkıyı hesaplar, onaylı konut maliyetlerini hane büyüklüğü ve belediye sınırına göre sınırlar, aylık kendi katkısını çıkarır ve %73.7 uygular.","Common questions":"Genel sorular","Is this an official award or eligibility decision?":"Bu resmi bir ödül mü yoksa uygunluk kararı mı?","No. It is a standard-case scenario, not an application or decision. Husbanken’s official calculator applies current eligibility limits, personal rules and the month being checked.":"Hayır. Bu bir uygulama veya karar değil, standart bir durum senaryosudur. Husbanken'in resmi hesap makinesi mevcut uygunluk limitlerini, kişisel kuralları ve kontrol edilen ayı uygular.","What should I enter as household income?":"Hane geliri olarak ne girmeliyim?","Enter the monthly household income basis used by Husbanken before household weighting. It may include taxable monthly income, reportable annual income converted to a month, applicable wealth supplement and tax-free rental income. Children’s income and several named benefits are excluded. Check Husbanken’s income guidance.":"Hanehalkı ağırlıklandırmasından önce Husbanken tarafından kullanılan aylık hane geliri esasını girin. Vergiye tabi aylık geliri, bir aya dönüştürülen raporlanabilir yıllık geliri, geçerli servet katkısını ve vergiden muaf kira gelirini içerebilir. Çocukların geliri ve adı geçen çeşitli faydalar hariçtir. Husbanken'in gelir rehberini kontrol edin.","What counts as approved housing costs?":"Onaylanan konut maliyetleri neler sayılır?","Husbanken counts costs differently for renters, shared-cost housing and detached homes. Enter the amount already worked out under its current rules, not every housing bill. The result is still capped by household size and municipality.":"Husbanken, kiracılar, ortak maliyetli konutlar ve müstakil evler için maliyetleri farklı hesaplıyor. Her konut faturasını değil, mevcut kurallara göre önceden belirlenmiş olan tutarı girin. Sonuç hala hane büyüklüğü ve belediye ile sınırlıdır.","Does changing language change the rules?":"Dili değiştirmek kuralları değiştirir mi?","No. This tool estimates a Norway-only 2026 scenario in every interface language.":"Hayır. Bu araç, her arayüz dilinde yalnızca Norveç'e özgü bir 2026 senaryosunu tahmin eder.","Scope and limits":"Kapsam ve sınırlar","Norway only. This standard-case estimate does not decide eligibility or model the separate upper household-income limit, minimum payout, single old-age pensioner or young-disabled thresholds, special-adapted housing, transition rules, or every income and asset exception. The 2026 rates are static and must be rechecked against Husbanken. Use its official calculator for the month you are checking.":"Yalnızca Norveç. Bu standart durum tahmini, uygunluğu belirlemez veya ayrı üst hane geliri limitini, asgari ödemeyi, tek yaşlı emekli veya genç engelli eşiklerini, özel olarak uyarlanmış konut, geçiş kurallarını veya her türlü gelir ve varlık istisnasını modellemez. 2026 oranları statiktir ve Husbanken'e göre yeniden kontrol edilmesi gerekir. Kontrol ettiğiniz ay için resmi hesap makinesini kullanın.","Estimate a standard monthly scenario":"Standart bir aylık senaryoyu tahmin edin","Norwegian rules only · standard 2026 rates · checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country or rules.":"Yalnızca Norveç kuralları · standart 2026 oranları · kontrol edildi 17 Ekim 2026 · dil, ülkeyi veya kuralları değiştirmez.","Monthly household income basis before weighting, NOK":"Ağırlıklandırma öncesi aylık hane geliri esası, NOK","Use the gross monthly basis Husbanken applies, including any applicable wealth supplement and tax-free rental income. Exclude items Husbanken says do not count. See its income guide before relying on a result.":"Geçerli varlık takviyesi ve vergiden muaf kira geliri de dahil olmak üzere, Husbanken'in geçerli olduğu brüt aylık esası kullanın. Husbanken'in sayılmadığını söylediği öğeleri hariç tutun. Bir sonuca güvenmeden önce gelir rehberine bakın.","Monthly housing costs already approved under Husbanken rules, NOK":"Aylık konut maliyetleri Husbanken kurallarına göre zaten onaylandı, NOK","Do not add every housing bill. Approved costs differ for rental, shared-cost and detached housing; enter the monthly amount under current Husbanken rules. A household and municipality cap is applied below.":"Her konut faturasını eklemeyin. Onaylanan maliyetler kiralama, ortak maliyet ve müstakil konut için farklılık gösterir; Geçerli Husbanken kurallarına göre aylık tutarı girin. Aşağıda hane ve belediye sınırı uygulanmaktadır.","Household members aged 18 or older":"18 veya daha büyük yaştaki hane üyeleri","Household members under 18":"18 kapsamındaki hane üyeleri","2026 municipality cap group":"2026 belediye başlık grubu","Other municipalities":"Diğer belediyeler","Oslo":"Oslo","Bergen, Trondheim, Tromsø, Stavanger or Bærum":"Bergen, Trondheim, Tromsø, Stavanger veya Bærum","Kristiansand, Skedsmo, Frogn, Lørenskog, Nordre Follo, Asker, Nesodden, Sola or Sandnes":"Kristiansand, Skedsmo, Frogn, Lørenskog, Nordre Follo, Asker, Nesodden, Sola veya Sandnes","Estimate monthly amount":"Tahmini aylık tutar","Clear entries":"Girişleri temizle","Enter the household’s monthly income basis, approved housing costs and composition.":"Hanenin aylık gelir esasını, onaylanmış konut maliyetlerini ve kompozisyonunu girin.","Scenario calculated on this device. Husbanken decides actual cases.":"Bu cihazda hesaplanan senaryo. Gerçek davalara Husbanken karar veriyor.","Entries cleared.":"Girişler temizlendi.","Check the monthly amounts, household counts and municipality group.":"Aylık tutarları, hane sayımlarını ve belediye grubunu kontrol edin.","Standard monthly scenario":"Standart aylık senaryo","Estimated monthly housing benefit":"Tahmini aylık konut avantajı","Monthly household income entered":"Girilen aylık hane geliri","Household income weight":"Hanehalkı gelir ağırlığı","Weighted monthly income":"Ağırlıklı aylık gelir","Estimated monthly own contribution":"Tahmini aylık öz katkı","Approved housing costs entered":"Onaylanan konut maliyetleri girildi","Monthly housing-cost cap":"Aylık konut maliyeti tavanı","Approved costs used after cap":"Sınır sınırından sonra kullanılan onaylanmış maliyetler","Costs remaining after own contribution":"Kendi katkısından sonra kalan maliyetler","Coverage rate":"Kapsama oranı","Assumptions used":"Kullanılan varsayımlar","The standard contribution thresholds and housing-cost caps use Husbanken’s 2026 rates checked 17 October 2026.":"Standart katkı eşikleri ve konut maliyeti tavanları, Husbanken'in 2026 oranlarını kullanıyor; 17 Ekim 2026 ile kontrol edildi.","Estimated benefit = max(0, approved costs after cap − own contribution) × 73.7%. Weighted income uses 1.00 for the first member, 0.13 for each additional member aged 18 or older and 0.15 for each additional member under 18.":"Tahmini fayda = maksimum(0, üst sınırdan sonra onaylanan maliyetler - kendi katkısı) × 73.7%. Ağırlıklı gelirde ilk üye için 1.00, 18 veya daha büyük yaştaki her ek üye için 0.13 ve 18 kapsamındaki her ek üye için 0.15 kullanılır.","The entered income must already follow Husbanken’s income rules. Special thresholds, the separate household income ceiling, payout floor and personal eligibility are not calculated.":"Girilen gelirin halihazırda Husbanken'in gelir kurallarına uygun olması gerekir. Özel eşikler, ayrı hane geliri tavanı, ödeme tabanı ve kişisel uygunluk hesaplanmaz.","Private, local calculation. No figures are uploaded or stored by this page.":"Özel, yerel hesaplama. Bu sayfa tarafından hiçbir rakam yüklenmez veya saklanmaz.","Husbanken: calculation":"Husbanken: hesaplama","Husbanken: income basis":"Husbanken: gelir esası","Husbanken: 2026 own-contribution rates":"Husbanken: 2026 kendi katkı oranları","Husbanken: 2026 housing-cost caps":"Husbanken: 2026 konut maliyeti tavanları","Open Husbanken’s official calculator":"Husbanken'in resmi hesap makinesini aç"},"uk":{"Norway Housing Benefit Estimator":"Оцінювач житлових виплат у Норвегії","Norway Housing Benefit Calculator 2026 — Monthly Scenario":"Калькулятор житлової допомоги в Норвегії 2026 — місячний сценарій","Estimate a standard monthly Norwegian housing-benefit scenario from the household income basis, approved housing costs, household size and municipality group. See the 2026 assumptions and continue to Husbanken for a current eligibility check.":"Оцініть стандартний місячний норвезький сценарій пільг на житло на основі доходу домогосподарства, затверджених витрат на житло, розміру домогосподарства та групи муніципалітету. Перегляньте припущення 2026 і перейдіть до Husbanken для поточної перевірки відповідності.","Use this private scenario to understand how Norway’s housing-benefit formula combines approved housing costs, weighted household income and the 2026 coverage rate. The interface language never changes the Norwegian rules.":"Використовуйте цей приватний сценарій, щоб зрозуміти, як норвезька формула пільг на житло поєднує затверджені витрати на житло, зважений дохід домогосподарства та рівень покриття 2026. Мова інтерфейсу ніколи не змінює норвезькі правила.","Calculations run in this browser. Entries are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"Обчислення виконуються в цьому браузері. Записи не надсилаються на сервер і не зберігаються цим інструментом.","Example":"Приклад","For one household member with no income and NOK 8,000 in monthly approved housing costs, the 2026 standard own contribution is about NOK 2,215 per month. The estimated benefit is about NOK 4,032 after applying the 73.7% rate.":"Для одного члена домогосподарства без доходу та 8,000 норвезьких крон місячних затверджених витрат на житло стандартний власний внесок 2026 становить близько 2,215 норвезьких крон на місяць. Орієнтовна вигода становить приблизно 4,032 норвезьких крон після застосування ставки 73.7%.","How the scenario works":"Як працює сценарій","The tool divides household income by the official household weight, calculates the standard own contribution from weighted annual income, limits approved housing costs by the household-size and municipality cap, subtracts the monthly own contribution and applies 73.7%.":"Інструмент ділить дохід домогосподарства на офіційну вагу домогосподарства, обчислює стандартний власний внесок із зваженого річного доходу, обмежує затверджені витрати на житло розміром домогосподарства та лімітом муніципалітету, віднімає місячний власний внесок і застосовує 73.7%.","Common questions":"Поширені запитання","Is this an official award or eligibility decision?":"Це офіційна нагорода чи рішення про право?","No. It is a standard-case scenario, not an application or decision. Husbanken’s official calculator applies current eligibility limits, personal rules and the month being checked.":"№ Це стандартний сценарій, а не заява чи рішення. Офіційний калькулятор Husbanken застосовує поточні ліміти права, особисті правила та місяць, що перевіряється.","What should I enter as household income?":"Що я маю ввести як дохід родини?","Enter the monthly household income basis used by Husbanken before household weighting. It may include taxable monthly income, reportable annual income converted to a month, applicable wealth supplement and tax-free rental income. Children’s income and several named benefits are excluded. Check Husbanken’s income guidance.":"Введіть базу місячного доходу домогосподарства, яку використовує Husbanken до зважування домогосподарства. Він може включати оподатковуваний місячний дохід, звітний річний дохід, перерахований на місяць, відповідну надбавку до майна та неоподатковуваний дохід від оренди. Дохід на дітей і кілька названих пільг не враховуються. Перевірте вказівки Husbanken щодо доходів.","What counts as approved housing costs?":"Що вважається затвердженою вартістю житла?","Husbanken counts costs differently for renters, shared-cost housing and detached homes. Enter the amount already worked out under its current rules, not every housing bill. The result is still capped by household size and municipality.":"Husbanken по-різному підраховує витрати для орендарів, житла зі спільною вартістю та окремих будинків. Введіть суму, вже відпрацьовану за її діючими правилами, а не кожен рахунок ЖКГ. Результат все ще обмежується розміром домогосподарства та муніципалітетом.","Does changing language change the rules?":"Чи зміна мови змінює правила?","No. This tool estimates a Norway-only 2026 scenario in every interface language.":"№ Цей інструмент оцінює сценарій 2026 лише для Норвегії на кожній мові інтерфейсу.","Scope and limits":"Сфера застосування та обмеження","Norway only. This standard-case estimate does not decide eligibility or model the separate upper household-income limit, minimum payout, single old-age pensioner or young-disabled thresholds, special-adapted housing, transition rules, or every income and asset exception. The 2026 rates are static and must be rechecked against Husbanken. Use its official calculator for the month you are checking.":"Лише Норвегія. Ця стандартна оцінка не визначає відповідність і не моделює окрему верхню межу доходу домогосподарства, мінімальну виплату, порогові суми для одиноких пенсіонерів за віком або молодих інвалідів, спеціально адаптоване житло, правила переходу або всі винятки доходу та майна. Курси 2026 є статичними, і їх необхідно перевірити за Husbanken. Використовуйте його офіційний калькулятор для місяця, який ви перевіряєте.","Estimate a standard monthly scenario":"Оцініть стандартний місячний сценарій","Norwegian rules only · standard 2026 rates · checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country or rules.":"Лише правила Норвегії · стандартні тарифи 2026 · перевірено 17 Жовтень 2026 · мова не змінює країну чи правила.","Monthly household income basis before weighting, NOK":"Місячний дохід домогосподарства до зважування, NOK","Use the gross monthly basis Husbanken applies, including any applicable wealth supplement and tax-free rental income. Exclude items Husbanken says do not count. See its income guide before relying on a result.":"Використовуйте валову місячну основу, яку застосовує Husbanken, включаючи будь-які відповідні надбавки до майна та неоподатковуваний дохід від оренди. Виключити елементи, які, за словами Хусбанкена, не враховуються. Перш ніж покладатися на результат, ознайомтеся з посібником із доходів.","Monthly housing costs already approved under Husbanken rules, NOK":"Щомісячна вартість житла вже затверджена згідно з правилами Husbanken, NOK","Do not add every housing bill. Approved costs differ for rental, shared-cost and detached housing; enter the monthly amount under current Husbanken rules. A household and municipality cap is applied below.":"Не додавайте кожен рахунок за житло. Затверджені витрати відрізняються для оренди, спільної вартості та окремого житла; введіть місячну суму відповідно до чинних правил Husbanken. Нижче застосовано обмеження домогосподарства та муніципалітету.","Household members aged 18 or older":"Члени домогосподарства віком від 18 або старше","Household members under 18":"Члени родини під 18","2026 municipality cap group":"2026 група муніципалітету","Other municipalities":"Інші муніципалітети","Oslo":"Осло","Bergen, Trondheim, Tromsø, Stavanger or Bærum":"Берген, Тронхейм, Тромсе, Ставангер або Берум","Kristiansand, Skedsmo, Frogn, Lørenskog, Nordre Follo, Asker, Nesodden, Sola or Sandnes":"Крістіансанд, Скедсмо, Фрогн, Льоренскуг, Нордре Фолло, Аскер, Незодден, Сола або Санднес","Estimate monthly amount":"Орієнтовна місячна сума","Clear entries":"Очистити записи","Enter the household’s monthly income basis, approved housing costs and composition.":"Введіть місячний дохід домогосподарства, затверджені витрати на житло та склад.","Scenario calculated on this device. Husbanken decides actual cases.":"Сценарій, розрахований на цьому пристрої. Husbanken вирішує реальні справи.","Entries cleared.":"Записи видалено.","Check the monthly amounts, household counts and municipality group.":"Перевірте місячні суми, кількість домогосподарств і муніципальну групу.","Standard monthly scenario":"Стандартний місячний сценарій","Estimated monthly housing benefit":"Розрахунковий місячний розмір житлової допомоги","Monthly household income entered":"Введено місячний дохід домогосподарства","Household income weight":"Вага доходу домогосподарства","Weighted monthly income":"Зважений місячний дохід","Estimated monthly own contribution":"Розрахунковий місячний власний внесок","Approved housing costs entered":"Введені затверджені витрати на житло","Monthly housing-cost cap":"Місячне обмеження вартості житла","Approved costs used after cap":"Затверджені витрати, використані після обмеження","Costs remaining after own contribution":"Залишок витрат після власного внеску","Coverage rate":"Ставка покриття","Assumptions used":"Використані припущення","The standard contribution thresholds and housing-cost caps use Husbanken’s 2026 rates checked 17 October 2026.":"Стандартні порогові суми внесків і ліміти вартості житла використовують перевірені ставки Husbanken 2026 17 2026 за жовтень.","Estimated benefit = max(0, approved costs after cap − own contribution) × 73.7%. Weighted income uses 1.00 for the first member, 0.13 for each additional member aged 18 or older and 0.15 for each additional member under 18.":"Очікувана вигода = макс.(0, затверджені витрати після обмеження − власний внесок) × 73.7%. Зважений дохід використовує 1.00 для першого учасника, 0.13 для кожного додаткового учасника віком 18 або старше та 0.15 для кожного додаткового учасника до 18.","The entered income must already follow Husbanken’s income rules. Special thresholds, the separate household income ceiling, payout floor and personal eligibility are not calculated.":"Введений дохід уже має відповідати правилам доходу Husbanken. Спеціальні порогові значення, окрема межа доходу домогосподарства, мінімальна сума виплат і особисте право не розраховуються.","Private, local calculation. No figures are uploaded or stored by this page.":"Приватний, місцевий розрахунок. Ця сторінка не завантажує та не зберігає цифри.","Husbanken: calculation":"Husbanken: розрах","Husbanken: income basis":"Husbanken: основа доходу","Husbanken: 2026 own-contribution rates":"Husbanken: ставки власних внесків 2026","Husbanken: 2026 housing-cost caps":"Husbanken: обмеження вартості житла 2026","Open Husbanken’s official calculator":"Відкрийте офіційний калькулятор Husbanken"},"ur":{"Norway Housing Benefit Estimator":"ناروے ہاؤسنگ بینیفٹ کا تخمینہ لگانے والا","Norway Housing Benefit Calculator 2026 — Monthly Scenario":"ناروے ہاؤسنگ بینیفٹ کیلکولیٹر 2026 — ماہانہ منظرنامہ","Estimate a standard monthly Norwegian housing-benefit scenario from the household income basis, approved housing costs, household size and municipality group. See the 2026 assumptions and continue to Husbanken for a current eligibility check.":"گھریلو آمدنی کی بنیاد، منظور شدہ رہائش کے اخراجات، گھریلو سائز اور میونسپلٹی گروپ سے ایک معیاری ماہانہ نارویجن ہاؤسنگ بینیفٹ کے منظر نامے کا اندازہ لگائیں۔ 2026 مفروضے دیکھیں اور موجودہ اہلیت کی جانچ کے لیے Husbanken کو جاری رکھیں۔","Use this private scenario to understand how Norway’s housing-benefit formula combines approved housing costs, weighted household income and the 2026 coverage rate. The interface language never changes the Norwegian rules.":"اس نجی منظر نامے کو یہ سمجھنے کے لیے استعمال کریں کہ ناروے کا ہاؤسنگ بینیفٹ فارمولہ کس طرح منظور شدہ ہاؤسنگ اخراجات، وزنی گھریلو آمدنی اور 2026 کوریج کی شرح کو یکجا کرتا ہے۔ انٹرفیس کی زبان کبھی بھی نارویجن قوانین کو تبدیل نہیں کرتی ہے۔","Calculations run in this browser. Entries are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"حسابات اس براؤزر میں چلتے ہیں۔ اندراجات سرور کو نہیں بھیجے جاتے ہیں یا اس ٹول کے ذریعے محفوظ نہیں کیے جاتے ہیں۔","Example":"مثال","For one household member with no income and NOK 8,000 in monthly approved housing costs, the 2026 standard own contribution is about NOK 2,215 per month. The estimated benefit is about NOK 4,032 after applying the 73.7% rate.":"گھر کے ایک فرد کے لیے جس کی آمدنی نہیں ہے اور NOK 8,000 ماہانہ منظور شدہ ہاؤسنگ اخراجات میں، 2026 معیاری اپنا حصہ تقریباً NOK 2,215 ماہانہ ہے۔ 73.7% شرح لاگو کرنے کے بعد تخمینی فائدہ NOK 4,032 کے بارے میں ہے۔","How the scenario works":"منظر نامہ کیسے کام کرتا ہے۔","The tool divides household income by the official household weight, calculates the standard own contribution from weighted annual income, limits approved housing costs by the household-size and municipality cap, subtracts the monthly own contribution and applies 73.7%.":"یہ ٹول گھریلو آمدنی کو سرکاری گھریلو وزن سے تقسیم کرتا ہے، وزنی سالانہ آمدنی سے معیاری اپنی شراکت کا حساب لگاتا ہے، گھریلو سائز اور میونسپلٹی کیپ کے ذریعہ منظور شدہ ہاؤسنگ اخراجات کو محدود کرتا ہے، ماہانہ اپنی شراکت کو گھٹاتا ہے اور 73.7% لاگو کرتا ہے۔","Common questions":"عام سوالات","Is this an official award or eligibility decision?":"کیا یہ سرکاری ایوارڈ یا اہلیت کا فیصلہ ہے؟","No. It is a standard-case scenario, not an application or decision. Husbanken’s official calculator applies current eligibility limits, personal rules and the month being checked.":"نہیں، یہ ایک معیاری صورت حال ہے، درخواست یا فیصلہ نہیں۔ Husbanken کا آفیشل کیلکولیٹر اہلیت کی موجودہ حدود، ذاتی قواعد اور جس مہینے کی جانچ پڑتال کی جا رہی ہے لاگو کرتا ہے۔","What should I enter as household income?":"مجھے گھریلو آمدنی کے طور پر کیا درج کرنا چاہیے؟","Enter the monthly household income basis used by Husbanken before household weighting. It may include taxable monthly income, reportable annual income converted to a month, applicable wealth supplement and tax-free rental income. Children’s income and several named benefits are excluded. Check Husbanken’s income guidance.":"گھریلو وزن سے پہلے Husbanken کی طرف سے استعمال ہونے والی ماہانہ گھریلو آمدنی کی بنیاد درج کریں۔ اس میں قابل ٹیکس ماہانہ آمدنی، ایک ماہ میں تبدیل ہونے والی قابل اطلاع سالانہ آمدنی، قابل اطلاق ویلتھ سپلیمنٹ اور ٹیکس فری کرائے کی آمدنی شامل ہو سکتی ہے۔ بچوں کی آمدنی اور متعدد نامزد فوائد کو خارج کر دیا گیا ہے۔ Husbanken کی آمدنی کی رہنمائی چیک کریں۔","What counts as approved housing costs?":"منظور شدہ ہاؤسنگ اخراجات میں کیا شمار ہوتا ہے؟","Husbanken counts costs differently for renters, shared-cost housing and detached homes. Enter the amount already worked out under its current rules, not every housing bill. The result is still capped by household size and municipality.":"Husbanken کرایہ داروں، مشترکہ لاگت والے مکانات اور علیحدہ گھروں کے اخراجات کو مختلف طریقے سے شمار کرتا ہے۔ اس کے موجودہ قواعد کے تحت پہلے سے کام کی گئی رقم درج کریں، ہر ہاؤسنگ بل نہیں۔ نتیجہ اب بھی گھریلو سائز اور میونسپلٹی کے ذریعہ محدود ہے۔","Does changing language change the rules?":"کیا زبان بدلنے سے اصول بدل جاتے ہیں؟","No. This tool estimates a Norway-only 2026 scenario in every interface language.":"نہیں یہ ٹول ہر انٹرفیس زبان میں صرف ناروے کے 2026 منظر نامے کا تخمینہ لگاتا ہے۔","Scope and limits":"دائرہ کار اور حدود","Norway only. This standard-case estimate does not decide eligibility or model the separate upper household-income limit, minimum payout, single old-age pensioner or young-disabled thresholds, special-adapted housing, transition rules, or every income and asset exception. The 2026 rates are static and must be rechecked against Husbanken. Use its official calculator for the month you are checking.":"صرف ناروے یہ معیاری کیس کا تخمینہ اہلیت کا فیصلہ نہیں کرتا ہے اور نہ ہی علیحدہ اوپری گھریلو آمدنی کی حد، کم از کم ادائیگی، واحد بڑھاپے کے پنشنر یا نوجوان معذوروں کی حد، خصوصی موافقت شدہ رہائش، منتقلی کے قواعد، یا ہر آمدنی اور اثاثہ کی رعایت کا تعین نہیں کرتا ہے۔ 2026 کی شرحیں مستحکم ہیں اور Husbanken کے خلاف دوبارہ چیک کی جانی چاہیے۔ آپ جس مہینے کو چیک کر رہے ہیں اس کے لیے اس کا آفیشل کیلکولیٹر استعمال کریں۔","Estimate a standard monthly scenario":"ایک معیاری ماہانہ منظر نامے کا اندازہ لگائیں۔","Norwegian rules only · standard 2026 rates · checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country or rules.":"صرف ناروے کے قواعد · معیاری 2026 شرحیں · چیک شدہ 17 اکتوبر 2026 · زبان ملک یا قواعد کو تبدیل نہیں کرتی ہے۔","Monthly household income basis before weighting, NOK":"وزن سے پہلے ماہانہ گھریلو آمدنی کی بنیاد، NOK","Use the gross monthly basis Husbanken applies, including any applicable wealth supplement and tax-free rental income. Exclude items Husbanken says do not count. See its income guide before relying on a result.":"ہسبینکن لاگو ہونے والی مجموعی ماہانہ بنیاد کا استعمال کریں، بشمول کسی بھی قابل اطلاق دولت کے ضمیمہ اور ٹیکس سے پاک کرائے کی آمدنی۔ اشیاء کو خارج کریں Husbanken کہتا ہے کہ شمار نہ کریں۔ کسی نتیجے پر بھروسہ کرنے سے پہلے اس کی آمدنی کا رہنما دیکھیں۔","Monthly housing costs already approved under Husbanken rules, NOK":"ہسبینکن رولز، NOK کے تحت پہلے سے منظور شدہ مکان کے ماہانہ اخراجات","Do not add every housing bill. Approved costs differ for rental, shared-cost and detached housing; enter the monthly amount under current Husbanken rules. A household and municipality cap is applied below.":"ہر مکان کا بل شامل نہ کریں۔ کرایہ، مشترکہ لاگت اور علیحدہ رہائش کے لیے منظور شدہ اخراجات مختلف ہوتے ہیں۔ موجودہ Husbanken قوانین کے تحت ماہانہ رقم درج کریں۔ ذیل میں ایک گھریلو اور میونسپلٹی کیپ لاگو کی گئی ہے۔","Household members aged 18 or older":"18 یا اس سے زیادہ عمر کے گھریلو اراکین","Household members under 18":"18 کے تحت گھریلو اراکین","2026 municipality cap group":"2026 میونسپلٹی ٹوپی گروپ","Other municipalities":"دیگر میونسپلٹیز","Oslo":"اوسلو","Bergen, Trondheim, Tromsø, Stavanger or Bærum":"برگن، ٹرنڈہیم، ٹرومس، اسٹاوانجر یا بیرم","Kristiansand, Skedsmo, Frogn, Lørenskog, Nordre Follo, Asker, Nesodden, Sola or Sandnes":"Kristiansand, Skedsmo, Frogn, Lørenskog, Nordre Follo, Asker, Nesodden, Sola or Sandnes","Estimate monthly amount":"ماہانہ رقم کا تخمینہ لگائیں۔","Clear entries":"اندراجات صاف کریں۔","Enter the household’s monthly income basis, approved housing costs and composition.":"گھر کی ماہانہ آمدنی کی بنیاد، منظور شدہ رہائش کے اخراجات اور ساخت درج کریں۔","Scenario calculated on this device. Husbanken decides actual cases.":"اس ڈیوائس پر منظر نامے کا حساب لگایا گیا ہے۔ Husbanken اصل مقدمات کا فیصلہ کرتا ہے۔","Entries cleared.":"اندراجات صاف ہو گئے۔","Check the monthly amounts, household counts and municipality group.":"ماہانہ رقوم، گھریلو شمار اور میونسپلٹی گروپ چیک کریں۔","Standard monthly scenario":"معیاری ماہانہ منظرنامہ","Estimated monthly housing benefit":"متوقع ماہانہ ہاؤسنگ فائدہ","Monthly household income entered":"ماہانہ گھریلو آمدنی درج کی گئی۔","Household income weight":"گھریلو آمدنی کا وزن","Weighted monthly income":"وزنی ماہانہ آمدنی","Estimated monthly own contribution":"تخمینہ شدہ ماہانہ اپنا حصہ","Approved housing costs entered":"منظور شدہ ہاؤسنگ اخراجات درج کیے گئے۔","Monthly housing-cost cap":"ماہانہ ہاؤسنگ لاگت کی ٹوپی","Approved costs used after cap":"کیپ کے بعد استعمال شدہ منظور شدہ اخراجات","Costs remaining after own contribution":"اپنی شراکت کے بعد باقی اخراجات","Coverage rate":"کوریج کی شرح","Assumptions used":"مفروضے استعمال کیے گئے۔","The standard contribution thresholds and housing-cost caps use Husbanken’s 2026 rates checked 17 October 2026.":"معیاری شراکت کی حدیں اور ہاؤسنگ لاگت کیپس Husbanken کی 2026 کی شرحوں کا استعمال کرتی ہیں 17 اکتوبر 2026 کو چیک کیا گیا ہے۔","Estimated benefit = max(0, approved costs after cap − own contribution) × 73.7%. Weighted income uses 1.00 for the first member, 0.13 for each additional member aged 18 or older and 0.15 for each additional member under 18.":"تخمینی فائدہ = زیادہ سے زیادہ(0، ٹوپی کے بعد منظور شدہ اخراجات − اپنی شراکت) × 73.7%۔ وزنی آمدنی پہلے ممبر کے لیے 1.00، 18 یا اس سے زیادہ عمر کے ہر اضافی ممبر کے لیے 0.13 اور 18 کے تحت ہر اضافی ممبر کے لیے 0.15 استعمال کرتی ہے۔","The entered income must already follow Husbanken’s income rules. Special thresholds, the separate household income ceiling, payout floor and personal eligibility are not calculated.":"داخل کردہ آمدنی کو پہلے سے ہی Husbanken کے آمدنی کے قواعد پر عمل کرنا چاہیے۔ خصوصی حد، علیحدہ گھریلو آمدنی کی حد، ادائیگی کی منزل اور ذاتی اہلیت کا حساب نہیں لگایا گیا ہے۔","Private, local calculation. No figures are uploaded or stored by this page.":"نجی، مقامی حساب کتاب۔ اس صفحہ کے ذریعہ کوئی اعداد و شمار اپ لوڈ یا محفوظ نہیں کیے گئے ہیں۔","Husbanken: calculation":"Husbanken: حساب","Husbanken: income basis":"Husbanken: آمدنی کی بنیاد","Husbanken: 2026 own-contribution rates":"Husbanken: 2026 اپنی شراکت کی شرحیں","Husbanken: 2026 housing-cost caps":"Husbanken: 2026 ہاؤسنگ لاگت کیپس","Open Husbanken’s official calculator":"Husbanken کا آفیشل کیلکولیٹر کھولیں۔"},"vi":{"Norway Housing Benefit Estimator":"Công cụ ước tính lợi ích nhà ở của Na Uy","Norway Housing Benefit Calculator 2026 — Monthly Scenario":"Công cụ tính lợi ích nhà ở của Na Uy 2026 — Kịch bản hàng tháng","Estimate a standard monthly Norwegian housing-benefit scenario from the household income basis, approved housing costs, household size and municipality group. See the 2026 assumptions and continue to Husbanken for a current eligibility check.":"Ước tính kịch bản lợi ích nhà ở tiêu chuẩn hàng tháng của Na Uy dựa trên cơ sở thu nhập hộ gia đình, chi phí nhà ở được phê duyệt, quy mô hộ gia đình và nhóm đô thị. Xem các giả định 2026 và tiếp tục đến Husbanken để kiểm tra tính đủ điều kiện hiện tại.","Use this private scenario to understand how Norway’s housing-benefit formula combines approved housing costs, weighted household income and the 2026 coverage rate. The interface language never changes the Norwegian rules.":"Sử dụng kịch bản riêng tư này để hiểu cách công thức phúc lợi nhà ở của Na Uy kết hợp chi phí nhà ở được phê duyệt, thu nhập hộ gia đình có trọng số và tỷ lệ bao phủ 2026. Ngôn ngữ giao diện không bao giờ thay đổi các quy tắc của Na Uy.","Calculations run in this browser. Entries are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"Tính toán chạy trong trình duyệt này. Các bài dự thi không được gửi đến máy chủ hoặc được lưu bởi công cụ này.","Example":"Ví dụ","For one household member with no income and NOK 8,000 in monthly approved housing costs, the 2026 standard own contribution is about NOK 2,215 per month. The estimated benefit is about NOK 4,032 after applying the 73.7% rate.":"Đối với một thành viên hộ gia đình không có thu nhập và NOK 8,000 trong chi phí nhà ở được phê duyệt hàng tháng, khoản đóng góp tiêu chuẩn của 2026 là khoảng 2,215 NOK mỗi tháng. Lợi ích ước tính là khoảng NOK 4,032 sau khi áp dụng tỷ lệ 73.7%.","How the scenario works":"Kịch bản diễn ra như thế nào","The tool divides household income by the official household weight, calculates the standard own contribution from weighted annual income, limits approved housing costs by the household-size and municipality cap, subtracts the monthly own contribution and applies 73.7%.":"Công cụ này chia thu nhập hộ gia đình theo trọng số chính thức của hộ gia đình, tính toán khoản đóng góp tiêu chuẩn của riêng họ từ thu nhập hàng năm có trọng số, giới hạn chi phí nhà ở được phê duyệt theo quy mô hộ gia đình và giới hạn đô thị, trừ đi khoản đóng góp hàng tháng của chính họ và áp dụng 73.7%.","Common questions":"Các câu hỏi thường gặp","Is this an official award or eligibility decision?":"Đây có phải là quyết định chính thức về việc đủ điều kiện hay giải thưởng không?","No. It is a standard-case scenario, not an application or decision. Husbanken’s official calculator applies current eligibility limits, personal rules and the month being checked.":"Không. Đó là một tình huống tiêu chuẩn, không phải là một ứng dụng hay một quyết định. Máy tính chính thức của Husbanken áp dụng các giới hạn đủ điều kiện hiện tại, các quy tắc cá nhân và tháng được kiểm tra.","What should I enter as household income?":"Tôi nên nhập thu nhập hộ gia đình như thế nào?","Enter the monthly household income basis used by Husbanken before household weighting. It may include taxable monthly income, reportable annual income converted to a month, applicable wealth supplement and tax-free rental income. Children’s income and several named benefits are excluded. Check Husbanken’s income guidance.":"Nhập cơ sở thu nhập hộ gia đình hàng tháng được Husbanken sử dụng trước khi tính trọng số hộ gia đình. Nó có thể bao gồm thu nhập chịu thuế hàng tháng, thu nhập hàng năm phải báo cáo được chuyển đổi thành một tháng, phần bổ sung tài sản được áp dụng và thu nhập cho thuê miễn thuế. Thu nhập của trẻ em và một số lợi ích được nêu tên đều bị loại trừ. Kiểm tra hướng dẫn thu nhập của Husbanken.","What counts as approved housing costs?":"Chi phí nhà ở được phê duyệt là bao nhiêu?","Husbanken counts costs differently for renters, shared-cost housing and detached homes. Enter the amount already worked out under its current rules, not every housing bill. The result is still capped by household size and municipality.":"Husbanken tính chi phí khác nhau đối với người thuê nhà, nhà ở chia sẻ chi phí và nhà ở biệt lập. Nhập số tiền đã được tính toán theo quy định hiện hành, không phải mọi hóa đơn nhà ở. Kết quả vẫn bị giới hạn bởi quy mô hộ gia đình và đô thị.","Does changing language change the rules?":"Việc thay đổi ngôn ngữ có làm thay đổi quy tắc không?","No. This tool estimates a Norway-only 2026 scenario in every interface language.":"Không. Công cụ này ước tính kịch bản 2026 chỉ có ở Na Uy trong mọi ngôn ngữ giao diện.","Scope and limits":"Phạm vi và giới hạn","Norway only. This standard-case estimate does not decide eligibility or model the separate upper household-income limit, minimum payout, single old-age pensioner or young-disabled thresholds, special-adapted housing, transition rules, or every income and asset exception. The 2026 rates are static and must be rechecked against Husbanken. Use its official calculator for the month you are checking.":"Chỉ ở Na Uy. Ước tính trường hợp tiêu chuẩn này không quyết định khả năng hội đủ điều kiện hoặc lập mô hình giới hạn thu nhập hộ gia đình trên riêng biệt, khoản thanh toán tối thiểu, ngưỡng hưu trí cho người già độc thân hoặc người khuyết tật trẻ, nhà ở thích ứng đặc biệt, quy tắc chuyển tiếp hoặc mọi ngoại lệ về thu nhập và tài sản. Tỷ giá 2026 là tĩnh và phải được kiểm tra lại theo Husbanken. Sử dụng máy tính chính thức của nó cho tháng bạn đang kiểm tra.","Estimate a standard monthly scenario":"Ước tính kịch bản tiêu chuẩn hàng tháng","Norwegian rules only · standard 2026 rates · checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country or rules.":"Chỉ quy tắc của Na Uy · tỷ lệ 2026 tiêu chuẩn · đã kiểm tra 17 Tháng 10 2026 · ngôn ngữ không thay đổi quốc gia hoặc quy tắc.","Monthly household income basis before weighting, NOK":"Cơ sở thu nhập hộ gia đình hàng tháng trước khi tính trọng số, NOK","Use the gross monthly basis Husbanken applies, including any applicable wealth supplement and tax-free rental income. Exclude items Husbanken says do not count. See its income guide before relying on a result.":"Sử dụng tổng cơ sở hàng tháng mà Husbanken áp dụng, bao gồm mọi khoản bổ sung tài sản hiện hành và thu nhập cho thuê miễn thuế. Loại trừ các mục mà Husbanken cho rằng không được tính. Xem hướng dẫn thu nhập của nó trước khi dựa vào kết quả.","Monthly housing costs already approved under Husbanken rules, NOK":"Chi phí nhà ở hàng tháng đã được phê duyệt theo quy định của Husbanken, NOK","Do not add every housing bill. Approved costs differ for rental, shared-cost and detached housing; enter the monthly amount under current Husbanken rules. A household and municipality cap is applied below.":"Không thêm mọi hóa đơn nhà ở. Chi phí được phê duyệt khác nhau đối với nhà ở cho thuê, nhà ở chia sẻ chi phí và nhà ở riêng lẻ; nhập số tiền hàng tháng theo quy định hiện hành của Husbanken. Giới hạn hộ gia đình và đô thị được áp dụng dưới đây.","Household members aged 18 or older":"Thành viên hộ gia đình từ 18 trở lên","Household members under 18":"Thành viên hộ gia đình dưới 18","2026 municipality cap group":"2026 nhóm giới hạn đô thị","Other municipalities":"Các đô thị khác","Oslo":"Oslo","Bergen, Trondheim, Tromsø, Stavanger or Bærum":"Bergen, Trondheim, Tromsø, Stavanger hoặc Bærum","Kristiansand, Skedsmo, Frogn, Lørenskog, Nordre Follo, Asker, Nesodden, Sola or Sandnes":"Kristiansand, Skedsmo, Frogn, Lørenskog, Nordre Follo, Asker, Nesodden, Sola hoặc Sandnes","Estimate monthly amount":"Số tiền ước tính hàng tháng","Clear entries":"Xóa mục nhập","Enter the household’s monthly income basis, approved housing costs and composition.":"Nhập cơ sở thu nhập hàng tháng của hộ gia đình, chi phí và thành phần nhà ở được phê duyệt.","Scenario calculated on this device. Husbanken decides actual cases.":"Kịch bản được tính toán trên thiết bị này. Husbanken quyết định các trường hợp thực tế.","Entries cleared.":"Đã xóa mục nhập.","Check the monthly amounts, household counts and municipality group.":"Kiểm tra số tiền hàng tháng, số hộ gia đình và nhóm đô thị.","Standard monthly scenario":"Kịch bản tiêu chuẩn hàng tháng","Estimated monthly housing benefit":"Ưu đãi nhà ở hàng tháng ước tính","Monthly household income entered":"Đã nhập thu nhập hộ gia đình hàng tháng","Household income weight":"Trọng số thu nhập hộ gia đình","Weighted monthly income":"Thu nhập hàng tháng có trọng số","Estimated monthly own contribution":"Số tiền đóng góp ước tính hàng tháng","Approved housing costs entered":"Đã nhập chi phí nhà ở được phê duyệt","Monthly housing-cost cap":"Giới hạn chi phí nhà ở hàng tháng","Approved costs used after cap":"Chi phí được phê duyệt được sử dụng sau giới hạn","Costs remaining after own contribution":"Chi phí còn lại sau khi tự đóng góp","Coverage rate":"Tỷ lệ phủ sóng","Assumptions used":"Các giả định được sử dụng","The standard contribution thresholds and housing-cost caps use Husbanken’s 2026 rates checked 17 October 2026.":"Ngưỡng đóng góp tiêu chuẩn và giới hạn chi phí nhà ở sử dụng tỷ lệ 2026 của Husbanken đã được kiểm tra 17 2026 tháng 10.","Estimated benefit = max(0, approved costs after cap − own contribution) × 73.7%. Weighted income uses 1.00 for the first member, 0.13 for each additional member aged 18 or older and 0.15 for each additional member under 18.":"Lợi ích ước tính = tối đa(0, chi phí được phê duyệt sau giới hạn − đóng góp của chính mình) × 73.7%. Thu nhập có trọng số sử dụng 1.00 cho thành viên đầu tiên, 0.13 cho mỗi thành viên bổ sung có độ tuổi 18 trở lên và 0.15 cho mỗi thành viên bổ sung theo 18.","The entered income must already follow Husbanken’s income rules. Special thresholds, the separate household income ceiling, payout floor and personal eligibility are not calculated.":"Thu nhập đã nhập phải tuân theo quy định về thu nhập của Husbanken. Các ngưỡng đặc biệt, mức trần thu nhập hộ gia đình riêng biệt, mức thanh toán sàn và khả năng hội đủ điều kiện của cá nhân không được tính toán.","Private, local calculation. No figures are uploaded or stored by this page.":"Tính toán riêng, cục bộ. Không có số liệu nào được tải lên hoặc lưu trữ bởi trang này.","Husbanken: calculation":"Husbanken: tính toán","Husbanken: income basis":"Husbanken: cơ sở thu nhập","Husbanken: 2026 own-contribution rates":"Husbanken: Tỷ lệ đóng góp riêng của 2026","Husbanken: 2026 housing-cost caps":"Husbanken: Giới hạn chi phí nhà ở 2026","Open Husbanken’s official calculator":"Mở máy tính chính thức của Husbanken"},"zh":{"Norway Housing Benefit Estimator":"挪威住房福利估算器","Norway Housing Benefit Calculator 2026 — Monthly Scenario":"挪威住房福利计算器 2026 — 每月情景","Estimate a standard monthly Norwegian housing-benefit scenario from the household income basis, approved housing costs, household size and municipality group. See the 2026 assumptions and continue to Husbanken for a current eligibility check.":"根据家庭收入基础、批准的住房成本、家庭规模和城市群体估算挪威标准每月住房福利情景。请参阅 2026 假设并继续前往 Husbanken 进行当前资格检查。","Use this private scenario to understand how Norway’s housing-benefit formula combines approved housing costs, weighted household income and the 2026 coverage rate. The interface language never changes the Norwegian rules.":"使用此私人场景来了解挪威的住房福利公式如何结合批准的住房成本、加权家庭收入和 2026 覆盖率。界面语言永远不会改变挪威规则。","Calculations run in this browser. Entries are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"计算在此浏览器中运行。此工具不会将条目发送到服务器或保存。","Example":"示例","For one household member with no income and NOK 8,000 in monthly approved housing costs, the 2026 standard own contribution is about NOK 2,215 per month. The estimated benefit is about NOK 4,032 after applying the 73.7% rate.":"对于一名没有收入且每月核定住房费用为 8,000 挪威克朗的家庭成员，2026 标准自己缴款约为每月 2,215 挪威克朗。应用 73.7% 费率后，预计收益约为 4,032 挪威克朗。","How the scenario works":"场景如何运作","The tool divides household income by the official household weight, calculates the standard own contribution from weighted annual income, limits approved housing costs by the household-size and municipality cap, subtracts the monthly own contribution and applies 73.7%.":"该工具将家庭收入除以官方家庭权重，根据加权年收入计算标准自己缴款，根据家庭规模和城市上限限制批准的住房成本，减去每月自己缴款并应用 73.7%。","Common questions":"常见问题","Is this an official award or eligibility decision?":"这是官方奖项还是资格决定？","No. It is a standard-case scenario, not an application or decision. Husbanken’s official calculator applies current eligibility limits, personal rules and the month being checked.":"编号这是标准案例场景，而不是应用程序或决策。 Husbanken 的官方计算器适用当前的资格限制、个人规则和检查月份。","What should I enter as household income?":"我应该输入什么作为家庭收入？","Enter the monthly household income basis used by Husbanken before household weighting. It may include taxable monthly income, reportable annual income converted to a month, applicable wealth supplement and tax-free rental income. Children’s income and several named benefits are excluded. Check Husbanken’s income guidance.":"输入 Husbanken 在家庭加权之前使用的每月家庭收入基础。它可能包括应税月收入、折算为每月的应报告年收入、适用的财富补助和免税租金收入。儿童收入和多项指定福利不包括在内。查看 Husbanken 的收入指导。","What counts as approved housing costs?":"什么算作批准的住房费用？","Husbanken counts costs differently for renters, shared-cost housing and detached homes. Enter the amount already worked out under its current rules, not every housing bill. The result is still capped by household size and municipality.":"Husbanken 对租房者、共享成本住房和独立住宅的成本计算方式不同。输入根据现行规则已经计算出的金额，而不是每笔住房账单。结果仍然受到家庭规模和城市的限制。","Does changing language change the rules?":"改变语言会改变规则吗？","No. This tool estimates a Norway-only 2026 scenario in every interface language.":"编号该工具估计每种界面语言中仅限挪威的 2026 场景。","Scope and limits":"范围和限制","Norway only. This standard-case estimate does not decide eligibility or model the separate upper household-income limit, minimum payout, single old-age pensioner or young-disabled thresholds, special-adapted housing, transition rules, or every income and asset exception. The 2026 rates are static and must be rechecked against Husbanken. Use its official calculator for the month you are checking.":"仅限挪威。这一标准情况估计并不决定资格或对单独的家庭收入上限、最低支付额、单身老年养老金领取者或青年残疾人门槛、特殊适应住房、过渡规则或每项收入和资产例外情况进行建模。 2026 汇率是静态的，必须根据 Husbanken 重新检查。使用您要检查的月份的官方计算器。","Estimate a standard monthly scenario":"估计标准每月情景","Norwegian rules only · standard 2026 rates · checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country or rules.":"仅限挪威规则 · 标准 2026 费率 · 检查 17 10 月 2026 · 语言不会更改国家/地区或规则。","Monthly household income basis before weighting, NOK":"加权前的每月家庭收入基础，挪威克朗","Use the gross monthly basis Husbanken applies, including any applicable wealth supplement and tax-free rental income. Exclude items Husbanken says do not count. See its income guide before relying on a result.":"使用 Husbanken 适用的每月总额，包括任何适用的财富补助和免税租金收入。排除 Husbanken 认为不算数的项目。在依赖结果之前请参阅其收入指南。","Monthly housing costs already approved under Husbanken rules, NOK":"已根据 Husbanken 规则批准的每月住房费用，挪威克朗","Do not add every housing bill. Approved costs differ for rental, shared-cost and detached housing; enter the monthly amount under current Husbanken rules. A household and municipality cap is applied below.":"不要添加每笔住房账单。租赁、分摊费用和独立住房的批准费用有所不同；输入当前 Husbanken 规则下的每月金额。下面适用家庭和市政上限。","Household members aged 18 or older":"年龄为 18 或以上的家庭成员","Household members under 18":"18 下的家庭成员","2026 municipality cap group":"2026 市帽组","Other municipalities":"其他城市","Oslo":"奥斯陆","Bergen, Trondheim, Tromsø, Stavanger or Bærum":"卑尔根、特隆赫姆、特罗姆瑟、斯塔万格或贝鲁姆","Kristiansand, Skedsmo, Frogn, Lørenskog, Nordre Follo, Asker, Nesodden, Sola or Sandnes":"Kristiansand、Skedsmo、Frogn、Lørenskog、Nordre Follo、Asker、Nesodden、Sola 或 Sandnes","Estimate monthly amount":"估计每月金额","Clear entries":"清除条目","Enter the household’s monthly income basis, approved housing costs and composition.":"输入家庭的月收入基础、批准的住房费用和构成。","Scenario calculated on this device. Husbanken decides actual cases.":"在此设备上计算的场景。 Husbanken 对实际案件做出裁决。","Entries cleared.":"条目已清除。","Check the monthly amounts, household counts and municipality group.":"检查每月金额、家庭数量和城市组。","Standard monthly scenario":"标准月度场景","Estimated monthly housing benefit":"预计每月住房福利","Monthly household income entered":"输入的家庭月收入","Household income weight":"家庭收入权重","Weighted monthly income":"加权月收入","Estimated monthly own contribution":"估计每月自己的贡献","Approved housing costs entered":"已输入批准的住房费用","Monthly housing-cost cap":"每月住房费用上限","Approved costs used after cap":"上限后使用的批准成本","Costs remaining after own contribution":"自己贡献后剩余的费用","Coverage rate":"覆盖率","Assumptions used":"使用的假设","The standard contribution thresholds and housing-cost caps use Husbanken’s 2026 rates checked 17 October 2026.":"标准缴款门槛和住房成本上限使用 Husbanken 的 2026 利率（检查 17 10 月 2026）。","Estimated benefit = max(0, approved costs after cap − own contribution) × 73.7%. Weighted income uses 1.00 for the first member, 0.13 for each additional member aged 18 or older and 0.15 for each additional member under 18.":"估计效益 = 最大值（0，上限后的批准成本 - 自己的贡献）× 73.7%。加权收入对于第一个会员使用 1.00，对于 18 或以上的每个附加会员使用 0.13，对于 18 下的每个附加会员使用 0.15。","The entered income must already follow Husbanken’s income rules. Special thresholds, the separate household income ceiling, payout floor and personal eligibility are not calculated.":"输入的收入必须已遵循 Husbanken 的收入规则。特殊门槛、单独的家庭收入上限、支付下限和个人资格不计算在内。","Private, local calculation. No figures are uploaded or stored by this page.":"私有的本地计算。此页面未上传或存储任何数据。","Husbanken: calculation":"Husbanken：计算","Husbanken: income basis":"Husbanken：收入基础","Husbanken: 2026 own-contribution rates":"Husbanken：2026 自缴费率","Husbanken: 2026 housing-cost caps":"Husbanken：2026 住房成本上限","Open Husbanken’s official calculator":"打开Husbanken官方计算器"},"zh_tw":{"Norway Housing Benefit Estimator":"挪威住房福利估算器","Norway Housing Benefit Calculator 2026 — Monthly Scenario":"挪威住房福利計算器 2026 — 每月情景","Estimate a standard monthly Norwegian housing-benefit scenario from the household income basis, approved housing costs, household size and municipality group. See the 2026 assumptions and continue to Husbanken for a current eligibility check.":"根據家庭收入基礎、核准的住房成本、家庭規模和城市群體估算挪威標準每月住房福利情境。請參閱 2026 假設並繼續前往 Husbanken 進行當前資格檢查。","Use this private scenario to understand how Norway’s housing-benefit formula combines approved housing costs, weighted household income and the 2026 coverage rate. The interface language never changes the Norwegian rules.":"使用此私人場景來了解挪威的住房福利公式如何結合批准的住房成本、加權家庭收入和 2026 覆蓋率。界面語言永遠不會改變挪威規則。","Calculations run in this browser. Entries are not sent to a server or saved by this tool.":"計算在此瀏覽器中運作。此工具不會將條目傳送到伺服器或儲存。","Example":"範例","For one household member with no income and NOK 8,000 in monthly approved housing costs, the 2026 standard own contribution is about NOK 2,215 per month. The estimated benefit is about NOK 4,032 after applying the 73.7% rate.":"對於一名沒有收入且每月核定住房費用為 8,000 挪威克朗的家庭成員，2026 標準自己繳款約為每月 2,215 挪威克朗。應用 73.7% 費率後，預計收益約為 4,032 挪威克朗。","How the scenario works":"場景如何運作","The tool divides household income by the official household weight, calculates the standard own contribution from weighted annual income, limits approved housing costs by the household-size and municipality cap, subtracts the monthly own contribution and applies 73.7%.":"該工具將家庭收入除以官方家庭權重，根據加權年收入計算標準自行繳款，根據家庭規模和城市上限限制批准的住房成本，減去每月自己繳款並應用 73.7%。","Common questions":"常見問題","Is this an official award or eligibility decision?":"這是官方獎項還是資格決定？","No. It is a standard-case scenario, not an application or decision. Husbanken’s official calculator applies current eligibility limits, personal rules and the month being checked.":"編號這是標準案例場景，而不是應用程式或決策。 Husbanken 的官方計算器適用當前的資格限制、個人規則和檢查月份。","What should I enter as household income?":"我該輸入什麼作為家庭收入？","Enter the monthly household income basis used by Husbanken before household weighting. It may include taxable monthly income, reportable annual income converted to a month, applicable wealth supplement and tax-free rental income. Children’s income and several named benefits are excluded. Check Husbanken’s income guidance.":"輸入 Husbanken 在家庭加權之前使用的每月家庭收入基礎。它可能包括應稅月收入、折算為每月的應報告年收入、適用的財富補助和免稅租金收入。兒童收入和多項指定福利不包括在內。查看 Husbanken 的收入指導。","What counts as approved housing costs?":"什麼算是核准的房屋費用？","Husbanken counts costs differently for renters, shared-cost housing and detached homes. Enter the amount already worked out under its current rules, not every housing bill. The result is still capped by household size and municipality.":"Husbanken 對租屋者、共享成本住宅和獨立住宅的成本計算方式不同。輸入根據現行規則已經計算出的金額，而不是每筆住房帳單。結果仍然受到家庭規模和城市的限制。","Does changing language change the rules?":"改變語言會改變規則嗎？","No. This tool estimates a Norway-only 2026 scenario in every interface language.":"編號此工具估計每種介面語言中僅限挪威的 2026 場景。","Scope and limits":"範圍和限制","Norway only. This standard-case estimate does not decide eligibility or model the separate upper household-income limit, minimum payout, single old-age pensioner or young-disabled thresholds, special-adapted housing, transition rules, or every income and asset exception. The 2026 rates are static and must be rechecked against Husbanken. Use its official calculator for the month you are checking.":"僅限挪威。這項標準情況估計並不決定資格或對單獨的家庭收入上限、最低支付額、單身老年退休金領取者或青年殘疾人門檻、特殊適應住房、過渡規則或每項收入和資產例外情況進行建模。 2026 匯率是靜態的，必須根據 Husbanken 重新檢查。使用您要檢查的月份的官方計算器。","Estimate a standard monthly scenario":"估價標準每月情景","Norwegian rules only · standard 2026 rates · checked 17 October 2026 · language does not change the country or rules.":"僅限挪威規則 · 標準 2026 費率 · 檢查 17 10 月 2026 · 語言不會更改國家或規則。","Monthly household income basis before weighting, NOK":"加權前的每月家庭收入基礎，挪威克朗","Use the gross monthly basis Husbanken applies, including any applicable wealth supplement and tax-free rental income. Exclude items Husbanken says do not count. See its income guide before relying on a result.":"使用 Husbanken 適用的每月總額，包括任何適用的財富補助和免稅租金收入。排除 Husbanken 認為不算數的項目。在依賴結果之前請參閱其收入指南。","Monthly housing costs already approved under Husbanken rules, NOK":"已根據 Husbanken 規則批准的每月住房費用，挪威克朗","Do not add every housing bill. Approved costs differ for rental, shared-cost and detached housing; enter the monthly amount under current Husbanken rules. A household and municipality cap is applied below.":"不要新增每張住房帳單。租賃、分攤費用和獨立住房的核准費用有所不同；輸入目前 Husbanken 規則下的每月金額。下面適用家庭和市政上限。","Household members aged 18 or older":"年齡為 18 或以上的家庭成員","Household members under 18":"18 下的家庭成員","2026 municipality cap group":"2026 市帽組","Other municipalities":"其他城市","Oslo":"奧斯陸","Bergen, Trondheim, Tromsø, Stavanger or Bærum":"卑爾根、特隆赫姆、特羅姆瑟、斯塔萬格或貝魯姆","Kristiansand, Skedsmo, Frogn, Lørenskog, Nordre Follo, Asker, Nesodden, Sola or Sandnes":"Kristiansand、Skedsmo、Frogn、Lørenskog、Nordre Follo、Asker、Nesodden、Sola 或 Sandnes","Estimate monthly amount":"估價每月金額","Clear entries":"清除條目","Enter the household’s monthly income basis, approved housing costs and composition.":"輸入家庭的月收入基礎、核准的住房費用和組成。","Scenario calculated on this device. Husbanken decides actual cases.":"在此設備上計算的場景。 Husbanken 對實際案件做出裁決。","Entries cleared.":"條目已清除。","Check the monthly amounts, household counts and municipality group.":"檢查每月金額、家庭數量和城市組。","Standard monthly scenario":"標準月度場景","Estimated monthly housing benefit":"預計每月住房福利","Monthly household income entered":"輸入的家庭月收入","Household income weight":"家庭收入權重","Weighted monthly income":"加權月收入","Estimated monthly own contribution":"估計每月自己的貢獻","Approved housing costs entered":"已輸入核准的住房費用","Monthly housing-cost cap":"每月住房費用上限","Approved costs used after cap":"上限後使用的核准成本","Costs remaining after own contribution":"自己貢獻後剩餘的費用","Coverage rate":"覆蓋率","Assumptions used":"使用的假設","The standard contribution thresholds and housing-cost caps use Husbanken’s 2026 rates checked 17 October 2026.":"標準繳款門檻和房屋成本上限使用 Husbanken 的 2026 利率（檢查 17 10 月 2026）。","Estimated benefit = max(0, approved costs after cap − own contribution) × 73.7%. Weighted income uses 1.00 for the first member, 0.13 for each additional member aged 18 or older and 0.15 for each additional member under 18.":"估計效益 = 最大值（0，上限後的核准成本 - 自己的貢獻）× 73.7%。加權收入對於第一個會員使用 1.00，對於 18 或以上的每個附加會員使用 0.13，對於 18 下的每個附加會員使用 0.15。","The entered income must already follow Husbanken’s income rules. Special thresholds, the separate household income ceiling, payout floor and personal eligibility are not calculated.":"輸入的收入必須已遵循 Husbanken 的收入規則。特殊門檻、單獨的家庭收入上限、支付下限和個人資格不計算在內。","Private, local calculation. No figures are uploaded or stored by this page.":"私有的本地運算。此頁面未上傳或儲存任何資料。","Husbanken: calculation":"Husbanken：計算","Husbanken: income basis":"Husbanken：收入基礎","Husbanken: 2026 own-contribution rates":"Husbanken：2026 自繳費率","Husbanken: 2026 housing-cost caps":"Husbanken：2026 房屋成本上限","Open Husbanken’s official calculator":"開啟Husbanken官方計算器"}});
